  "承担 filtering 与层间 stress identity。这些对象必须与本站的局部乘积张量分开。": "Handles the filtering and interscale stress identity. These objects must be kept distinct from the site's local product tensor.",
  "承担 filtering 与层间 stress identity。Germano 的完整二阶 stress 方程明确包含速度三阶、压力–速度、压力–应变和梯度协方差。": "supports filtering and the interscale stress identity. Germano's complete second-order stress equation explicitly contains third-order velocity terms, pressure–velocity, pressure–strain, and gradient covariance.",
  "承担 smooth coarse-graining 与 SGS energy budget 的经典背景。一般 Sᵣ、Sᴿ 不自动组成 Germano 的嵌套滤波，本节的差场生产也不是标准 SGS 通量。": "provides the classical background for smooth coarse-graining and the SGS energy budget. General filters at the two scales do not automatically form a nested Germano hierarchy, and the difference-field production in this note is not the standard SGS flux.",
