  "处理 nonnormal common-domain generator，但 quasi-bounded 情形会带来不适合当前增长支的指数比较因子。": "Treats a nonnormal common-domain generator, but the quasi-bounded case introduces an exponential comparison factor unsuitable for the current growing branch.",
  "处理不同周期、通道或边界层几何中的黏性模态；它们的尺度与本节固定 \\(\\gamma=1/2\\) 的无壁周期问题不同。": "They treat viscous modes in geometries with different periods, channels, or boundary layers; their scalings differ from the wall-free periodic problem with fixed \\(\\gamma=1/2\\) considered here.",
