  "从问题边界到爆破排除树，并标出当前研究路线与文献的接口。": "From the problem boundary to the blow-up exclusion tree, with the interface between the current research route and the literature marked explicitly.",
  "从移动环带到时间 Hardy 核": "From moving annuli to the temporal Hardy kernel",
