  "带统一 prefactor 的冻结二分、精确有界 profile drift 与 Lyapunov--Perron 图构造闭合一条精确线性行的 fixed-window \\(e^{c_D|\\Lambda|}\\)。": "The frozen dichotomy with a uniform prefactor, exact bounded profile drift, and the Lyapunov--Perron graph construction close the fixed-window \\(e^{c_D|\\Lambda|}\\) law for one exact linear row.",
  "单位方向在每个正分母分支上满足精确 Rayleigh-payment identity。软方向增加无符号径向缺陷，直线 crossing 的孤立软源为 \\(3\\pi/(8\\sqrt\\varepsilon)\\)。固定能量 2D3C 真解只排除点态角速度控制；固定 cutoff 还显示正源与黏性曲率可在主阶抵消。": "The unit direction satisfies an exact Rayleigh-payment identity on each positive-denominator branch. The soft direction adds an unsigned radial defect, and the isolated soft source for a straight-line crossing is \\(3\\pi/(8\\sqrt\\varepsilon)\\). A fixed-energy exact 2D3C solution rules out only pointwise angular-speed control; a fixed cutoff also shows that the positive source and viscous curvature can cancel at leading order.",
  "单一 Fourier 壳可承载全正拉伸": "A single Fourier shell can carry entirely positive stretching",
