  "控制 fixed 或 specially modulated shear 的 spatial norms，不计一个 complex Fourier coordinate 的 temporal zeros 或 crossing slopes。": "control spatial norms for fixed or specially modulated shears; they do not count temporal zeros or crossing slopes of a complex Fourier coordinate.",
  "控制端点条件下的积分乘积；": "control integral products under endpoint conditions;",
  "控制空间交换子，不是时间系数导数 \\(V'\\)。": "controls spatial commutators, not the temporal coefficient derivative \\(V'\\).",
  "控制速度 Fourier/Wiener 量，而不是能量密度状态 C。限定式检索未找到相同打包，但未检出不是新颖性、优先权或不存在证明。": "controls the velocity Fourier/Wiener quantity rather than the energy-density state C. A targeted search found no identical packaging, but non-detection is not proof of novelty, priority, or nonexistence.",
  "控制一维实抛物方程的空间零数；": "controls the spatial zero number for one-dimensional real parabolic equations;",
  "困难出现在临界尺度": "The difficulty appears at the critical scale",
  "扩大尺度比不能改善完整环带基线；尺度比四只留下有限分离候选。": "Increasing the scale ratio does not improve the full annular baseline; scale ratio four leaves only a finite-separation candidate.",
  "累计回顾与 140 节索引": "Cumulative recap and 140-section index",
  "理论层级": "Theory Level",
  "理论地图": "Theory Map",
  "历史索引 · R0.61–R0.69O": "Historical index · R0.61–R0.69O",
  "连续振幅区间不靠网格采样即被两条粗环带封闭；这是静态机制排除，不是动力学正则性定理。": "Two coarse annuli close the continuous amplitude interval without grid sampling. This rules out a static mechanism; it is not a dynamical regularity theorem.",
  "联合抛物恒等式成立，同一 heat volume 仍不能单独支付单边生成": "The joint parabolic identity holds, yet the same heat volume still cannot by itself pay for one-sided creation",
  "两壳和多壳精确族排除了共同响应自动衰减、无权 \\(\\ell^2\\to\\ell^1\\) 升级和一个直接三场极化端点；带符号正输出系数已有精确消费不等式，但没有动态时间可积性。": "The exact two-shell and multishell families rule out automatic common-response decay, an unweighted \\(\\ell^2\\to\\ell^1\\) upgrade, and a direct polarized three-field endpoint estimate; the sign-sensitive positive-output coefficient has an exact consumption inequality, but no dynamical time integrability.",
  "两轮有限一手来源检索核对 exact shearing-wave superposition、classical 2D3C split、periodic-shear scalar dispersion、forced passive-scalar blocks 与 time schedules，以及 physical-shell flux locality。没有一篇被筛来源同时给出同一 unforced common-shear 解内的可独立 lobe windows、total-field floor、positive weighted cubic payment、disjoint-time K-clock witness 与 inherited exponential dwell threshold。这个结论仅为 six-source non-hit，不构成 novelty、priority 或 exhaustiveness claim。": "A bounded two-pass primary-source search checked exact shearing-wave superposition, the classical 2D3C split, scalar dispersion under periodic shear, forced passive-scalar blocks and time schedules, and physical-shell flux locality. None of the six screened sources simultaneously provides independently selectable lobe windows in one unforced common-shear solution, a total-field floor, positive weighted cubic payment, a disjoint-time K-clock witness, and the inherited exponential dwell threshold. This is only a six-source non-hit, not a novelty, priority, or exhaustiveness claim.",
  "两条终边都尚未闭合": "Neither terminal branch is closed",
  "邻近自治 ED、纯虚半经典势、kinetic Poincare 与局部 subelliptic estimates 都不直接给 nonautonomous、whole-line、center-uniform、L2_t H^-1_x-forced theorem。限定检索不构成新颖性或优先权证明。": "Nearby autonomous ED results, purely imaginary semiclassical potentials, kinetic Poincare inequalities, and local subelliptic estimates do not directly provide a nonautonomous, whole-line, center-uniform, L2_t H^-1_x-forced theorem. A bounded search does not establish novelty or priority.",
  "临界 \\(L^3\\) 在 \\(T_*\\) 前保持有界": "The critical \\(L^3\\) norm remains bounded before \\(T_*\\)",
  "临界端点": "Critical endpoints",
  "临界范数爆破下界、Type I 浓缩、奇点计数": "Critical-norm blow-up lower bounds, Type I concentration, and singular-point counting",
