  "R0.72U 的证明使用 model-specific two-moment identity。限定一手检索没有定位到可直接替代该证明的定理；这个检索结论不构成不存在性、新颖性或优先权主张。": "The R0.72U proof uses a model-specific two-moment identity. The bounded primary-source search did not locate a theorem that directly replaces this proof; that search result establishes neither nonexistence, novelty, nor priority.",
