  "R0.73H 再以实际增益归一化和谐波能量局部化闭合 varying-background planar fixed-distance departure；\\(d=0.01>1/450\\) 仅属有限诊断，预设下界指数种子、固定背景 Lyapunov 不稳定、横向三维、奇性与 Clay 保持 OPEN。": "R0.73H again closes varying-background planar fixed-distance departure through actual-gain normalization and harmonic-energy localization; \\(d=0.01>1/450\\) is only a finite diagnostic, while the prescribed lower-law seed, fixed-background Lyapunov instability, transverse three-dimensional dynamics, singularity, and Clay remain OPEN.",
  "R0.73I 的选定增益作用量与绝热文献边界": "R0.73I boundary for selected-gain action and adiabatic literature",
  "R0.73I 的主张边界": "Claim boundary of R0.73I",
  "R0.73I 校正继承端点，给出连续体上作用量和零窗口切向速率；固定正窗口 matching action、有界前因子与连续体两项式仍为 OPEN。三个 \\(N=48\\) action/WKB 窗口只作有限诊断。": "R0.73I corrects the inherited endpoint and gives a continuum upper action and a zero-window tangent rate; the matching action at fixed positive window, bounded prefactor, and continuum two-term law remain OPEN. The three \\(N=48\\) action/WKB windows are finite diagnostics only.",
  "R0.73J 的周期 Rayleigh--Evans 文献边界": "R0.73J literature boundary for periodic Rayleigh--Evans theory",
  "R0.73J 的主张边界": "Claim boundary of R0.73J",
  "R0.73J 在连续算子层面认证周期 Rayleigh 唯一简单最右谱支、显式谱隙、左右重叠和固定相位锚。自然盒首轮 76/83、depth-two 1/7 的失败历史保留；自适应 depth five 最终覆盖 83/83 个选定盒与 2896/2896 个叶盒。": "R0.73J certifies, at the continuum-operator level, the unique simple rightmost periodic Rayleigh spectral branch, an explicit spectral gap, left-right overlap, and a fixed phase anchor. The natural-box failure history of 76/83 in the first pass and 1/7 at depth-two is retained; adaptive depth five ultimately covers 83/83 selected boxes and 2896/2896 leaf boxes.",
  "R0.73K 的黏性消失谱持续文献边界": "Literature boundary for vanishing-viscosity spectral persistence in R0.73K",
  "R0.73K 的主张边界": "Claim boundary for R0.73K",
  "R0.73K 在共同但未显式量化的黏度阈值内闭合共同圆内唯一的实代数简单黏性谱支、Riesz 投影在算子范数下的一致收敛、特征值偏移的 \\(O(\\varepsilon)\\) 上界、条件数、固定半平面内无其他谱点，以及补空间 reduced-resolvent 与半群增长上界。1,190 个有限状态与 952 个跨 cutoff 比较只作诊断。": "Within a common but not explicitly quantified viscosity threshold, R0.73K establishes the unique real algebraically simple viscous spectral branch in a common circle, operator-norm uniform convergence of the Riesz projections, an \\(O(\\varepsilon)\\) upper bound on the eigenvalue shift, the condition number, absence of other spectral points in a fixed half-plane, and bounds on the complementary-space reduced resolvent and semigroup growth. The 1,190 finite states and 952 cross-cutoff comparisons are diagnostic only.",
  "R0.73L 的非自伴绝热跟踪文献边界": "Literature boundary for nonselfadjoint adiabatic tracking in R0.73L",
  "R0.73L 的主张边界": "Claim boundary for R0.73L",
  "R0.73L 用 Kato intertwining、固定快时间块和前向 Volterra 吸收，把冻结 rank-one 谱输入升级为真实非自治演化：相对跟踪误差为 \\(O(\\varepsilon)\\)，精确增益与黏性及无黏谱作用量只差统一两侧乘法常数，后向定位由同一条前向轨道相除得到。15 条主轨迹、5 条独立重算和 346 行附图源数据只作有限诊断。": "R0.73L uses Kato intertwining, fixed fast-time blocks, and forward Volterra absorption to upgrade frozen rank-one spectral input to a genuine nonautonomous evolution: the relative tracking error is \\(O(\\varepsilon)\\), the exact gain differs from the viscous and inviscid spectral actions only by uniform two-sided multiplicative constants, and backward localization is obtained by taking a ratio along the same forward orbit. The 15 primary trajectories, 5 independent recomputations, and 346 rows of figure source data serve only as finite diagnostics.",
  "R0.73M 的 prescribed-action 平面非线性偏离文献边界": "Literature boundary for the R0.73M prescribed-action planar nonlinear departure",
  "R0.73M 的主张边界": "Claim boundary for R0.73M",
  "R0.73M 用完整无黏作用量指定指数小种子，在固定物理时刻闭合 selected-pair 的二维非线性固定距离偏离。15 个主案例、5 个独立线性哨兵、3 个独立层级哨兵、28/28 验证与 27 行附图源数据只作有限诊断；固定背景、横向三维、奇性与 Clay 保持 OPEN。": "R0.73M uses the full inviscid action to prescribe an exponentially small seed and closes two-dimensional nonlinear fixed-distance departure of the selected pair at a fixed physical time. The 15 primary cases, 5 independent linear sentinels, 3 independent hierarchy sentinels, 28/28 validator checks, and 27 rows of figure source data serve only as finite diagnostics; fixed-background dynamics, transverse three-dimensional dynamics, singularity, and Clay remain OPEN.",
  "R0.73N 的固定成员稳定性与族转移文献边界": "Literature boundary for R0.73N fixed-member stability and family transfer",
