  "E.5 与 E.10 是尺度无量纲的固定尺度支付形式，但没有从任意初值推出右侧小性，也没有得到小于 1 的收缩系数。": "E.5 and E.10 are scale-invariant fixed-scale payment forms, but they do not derive smallness of the right-hand side from arbitrary initial data and do not yield a contraction factor below one.",
