  "。 自动测试同时核对三波闭合、无散性、\\(L^2\\) 守恒、临界带权非守恒和三个分离壳的无交叉支持共振。": ". Automatic testing simultaneously verifies triad closure, divergence-free condition, \\(L^2\\) conservation, nonconservation of the critical weighted quantity, and absence of cross-support resonance in three separated shells.",
