  "从压力形式到 Leray 投影、临界缩放、三个能量层级与可复算 Fourier 三波。": "From the pressure formulation to the Leray projection, critical scaling, three energy levels, and a reproducible Fourier-triad example.",
  "存在与振幅无关的统一常数 \\(c<1\\)，使全部光滑场的临界三线性项都不超过 \\(c\\nu\\|\\Lambda^{3/2}u\\|_2^2\\)。": "There exists a uniform constant \\(c<1\\) independent of amplitude such that the critical trilinear term for all smooth fields does not exceed \\(c\\nu\\|\\Lambda^{3/2}u\\|_2^2\\).",
  "待检验说法：": "The claim to be verified is:",
  "但临界二次量使用权重 \\(|k|\\)。在上述 \\(T\\) 的单模定义下， 正负模配对后的非线性贡献为": "But the critical quadratic quantity uses the weight \\(|k|\\). Under the single-mode definition of \\(T\\) above, pairing the positive and negative modes gives the nonlinear contribution",
  "当 \\(\\|\\Lambda^{1/2}u\\|_2<\\nu/C\\) 时，非线性可被黏性吸收，这解释小临界数据全局理论。 对任意大数据，右端与耗散含有同一个 \\(\\dot H^{3/2}\\) 因子，前面的临界范数未知且可能很大； 这个标准估计只能做到这里。": "when \\(\\|\\Lambda^{1/2}u\\|_2<\\nu/C\\), nonlinearity can be absorbed by viscosity, which explains the global theory for small critical data. For arbitrary large data, the right-hand side and dissipation contain the same factor of \\(\\dot H^{3/2}\\), with the critical norm unknown and possibly very large; this standard estimate stops here.",
  "定位 \\(L^2\\)、enstrophy、\\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) 中的闭合与失闭。": "Identify where the estimates close or fail to close in \\(L^2\\), enstrophy, and \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\).",
  "定义投影到无散子空间的算子": "Define the operator projecting onto the divergence-free subspace",
  "对 \\(b(u,v,w)=\\langle\\mathbb P(u\\cdot\\nabla v),w\\rangle\\) 作完整 dyadic 分解。": "Perform a complete dyadic decomposition of \\(b(u,v,w)=\\langle\\mathbb P(u\\cdot\\nabla v),w\\rangle\\).",
  "对动量方程取散度，并使用 \\(\\partial_j u_j=0\\)：": "Take the divergence of the momentum equation and use \\(\\partial_j u_j=0\\):",
  "对线性热半群作常数变易，得到": "Applying variation of constants to the linear heat semigroup gives",
  "对右端求时间导数，使用 \\(\\partial_t e^{\\nu(t-s)\\Delta}=\\nu\\Delta e^{\\nu(t-s)\\Delta}\\) 以及积分上限项，即恢复投影方程和初值。该公式正是局部不动点理论的起点。": "Differentiating the right-hand side in time and using \\(\\partial_t e^{\\nu(t-s)\\Delta}=\\nu\\Delta e^{\\nu(t-s)\\Delta}\\), together with the upper-limit term in the integral, recovers the projected equation and the initial data. This formula is the starting point for the local fixed-point theory.",
  "反向核对": "Reverse check",
