  "R0.1｜周期三维 NS 的临界能量与 Fourier 三波结构": "R0.1｜Critical energy of periodic three-dimensional NS and Fourier triad structure",
  "Tao 的 averaged Navier–Stokes 仍保留这类能量抵消，却可有限时爆破； 因此正面论证还需要用到原始核的更细结构。": "Tao's averaged Navier–Stokes still retains such energy cancellation but can have finite-time blow-up; therefore, a direct proof will need to use finer structure of the original kernel.",
