  "下一步：检查近对角螺旋核": "next step: check near-diagonal helical kernel",
  "下一份笔记只看仍没有小因子的区域。我准备做四件事：": "Next note will only examine regions that still do not have small factors. I plan to do four things:",
  "现在导数只看见低输出；由 \\(\\|\\nabla u_j\\|_\\infty\\le C\\lambda_j^2a_j\\)，": "now derivatives only see low outputs; by \\(\\|\\nabla u_j\\|_\\infty\\le C\\lambda_j^2a_j\\),",
  "写出四个非等价 helicity 符号类的精确几何耦合系数，固定归一化与相位约定。": "write down the exact geometric coupling coefficients for four nonequivalent helicity symbol classes, fixing normalization and phase conventions.",
  "研究笔记 R0.2 · 基础计算，欢迎勘误": "research note R0.2 · basic computations, welcome corrections",
  "研究笔记 R0.2 · 局部性检查": "research note R0.2 · local check",
  "研究笔记 R0.2：三维 Navier–Stokes 临界 H 半范数中的 dyadic 非局部尾、螺旋三波传递与近对角障碍。": "research note R0.2: three-dimensional Navier–Stokes critical H seminorm dyadic nonlocal tail, helical triad transfer and near-diagonal obstruction.",
  "一个零和三波 \\(\\boldsymbol k+\\boldsymbol p+\\boldsymbol q=0\\) 有八种符号组合。 记 \\(K=|\\boldsymbol k|\\le P=|\\boldsymbol p|\\le Q=|\\boldsymbol q|\\)， 对固定 \\((s_K,s_P,s_Q)\\)，Waleffe 的单三波方程把三个模能量率写成同一个实标量 \\(\\Phi\\) 乘以": "a zero and three-wave \\(\\boldsymbol k+\\boldsymbol p+\\boldsymbol q=0\\) has eight sign combinations. Note \\(K=|\\boldsymbol k|\\le P=|\\boldsymbol p|\\le Q=|\\boldsymbol q|\\), for fixed \\((s_K,s_P,s_Q)\\), Waleffe's single three-wave equation writes the three modal energy rates as one real scalar \\(\\Phi\\) multiplied by",
  "已复查": "reviewed",
  "已有结果": "existing results",
  "异号高频螺旋": "opposite-sign high-frequency helical",
  "异号高频螺旋：没有低模小因子": "opposite-sign high-frequency helical: no low-mode small factors",
  "因为 \\(\\langle u_{\\le j-M}\\cdot\\nabla u_j,u_j\\rangle=0\\)。": "because \\(\\langle u_{\\le j-M}\\cdot\\nabla u_j,u_j\\rangle=0\\).",
  "用整数三波族检查公式": "check formula with integer triad family",
  "有限壳宽内仍只有 \\(C\\|u\\|_{\\dot H^{1/2}}\\|u\\|_{\\dot H^{3/2}}^2\\)。": "still only \\(C\\|u\\|_{\\dot H^{1/2}}\\|u\\|_{\\dot H^{3/2}}^2\\) within finite shell width.",
  "有限邻壳求和后， \\(|R_M^{HH\\to L}|\\le C2^{-3M}AB^2\\)。 这个三阶衰减并非相位平均，而是无散性与临界权重共同产生的确定性估计。": "after summing over finite neighboring shells, \\(|R_M^{HH\\to L}|\\le C2^{-3M}AB^2\\). This third-order decay is not phase-averaged but a deterministic estimate produced by the divergence-free condition and critical weighting together.",
  "与两个高频能量率同阶。仅靠能量与 helicity 守恒不能产生 \\(K/P\\) 抑制。 因而，不能假定所有非局部螺旋三波都会成对近抵消。": "at the same order as two high-frequency energy rates. Energy and helicity conservation alone cannot produce suppression of \\(K/P\\). Thus, it cannot be assumed that all nonlocal helical triad transfers will pairwise nearly cancel out.",
  "与已有局部性理论一致": "in agreement with existing local theory",
  "预期因子": "expected factor",
  "源码：": "source code:",
  "再次对低指标作 Cauchy–Schwarz：": "reapply Cauchy–Schwarz to low indices:",
  "在 \\(\\mathbb T^3_{2\\pi}\\) 上取标准光滑 Littlewood–Paley 分解 \\(u=\\sum_j u_j\\)、\\(u_j=\\Delta_j u\\)，记 \\(\\lambda_j=2^j\\)。 零均值消除了齐次范数的零频问题；有限个最低壳只改变常数。": "On the \\(\\mathbb T^3_{2\\pi}\\), take the standard smooth Littlewood–Paley decomposition of \\(u=\\sum_j u_j\\) and \\(u_j=\\Delta_j u\\), denoting it as \\(\\lambda_j=2^j\\). The zero mean eliminates the zero frequency issue for homogeneous norms; a finite number of lowest shells only change constants.",
  "在 \\(K:P:Q\\in[1/2,2]^3\\) 且满足三角闭合的紧参数域上，定位耦合零点、退化角和最大值。": "Locate coupled zeros, degenerate angles, and maxima on the \\(K:P:Q\\in[1/2,2]^3\\) with triangular closure in a compact parameter domain.",
  "这里 \\(|h-j|\\le c\\)，故 \\(\\lambda_h\\simeq\\lambda_j\\)。": "Here \\(|h-j|\\le c\\), hence \\(\\lambda_h\\simeq\\lambda_j\\).",
  "这里的尾部估计是经典交换子、Bernstein 不等式与 Bony 分解的直接组合。 我写出逐项推导和计算脚本，方便复查。它不是新的定理，也没有闭合近对角临界项。 这些计算只说明：仅靠远距离三波抵消，还不足以得到大数据先验界。": "The tail estimate here is a direct combination of classical commutators, Bernstein inequalities, and Bony decomposition. I write out the step-by-step derivation and computational scripts for verification. It is not a new theorem and does not close near-diagonal critical terms. These calculations only show that mere far-field three-wave cancellations are insufficient to obtain a priori bounds in the large-data regime.",
  "这一步留下什么": "What remains at this step",
  "这一步说明": "What this step illustrates",
  "这一特定几何中 \\(Q-P=1/(Q+P)\\sim(2N)^{-1}\\)，所以同号类甚至显示 \\(N^{-2}\\) 的相对抑制； 普遍三角界只保证 \\(O(K/P)\\)。异号类趋近常数量级，没有衰减。": "In this specific geometry, \\(Q-P=1/(Q+P)\\sim(2N)^{-1}\\), so same-sign classes even show relative suppression of \\(N^{-2}\\); general triangular bounds only guarantee \\(O(K/P)\\). Opposite-sign classes approach constant magnitude without decay.",
  "正则性：光滑零均值场": "Regularity: smooth zero mean field",
  "指标关系": "Index relations",
  "逐壳代入，并记 \\(\\widetilde b_j=\\sum_{|h-j|\\le c}b_h\\)，得到": "Substitute shell by shell and denote it as \\(\\widetilde b_j=\\sum_{|h-j|\\le c}b_h\\), obtaining",
  "High–high→low 尾部": "High–high→low tail",
  "high–high→low 由于无散积分分部得到 \\(2^{-3M}\\)， 比两个 paraproduct 尾更强。": "High–high→low due to divergence-free integration by parts yields \\(2^{-3M}\\), stronger than two paraproduct tails.",
  "High–low：导数落在慢变量": "High–low: derivative falls on slow variable",
  "Littlewood–Paley 与粗粒化文献早已证明能量通量主要由相近尺度控制。": "Littlewood–Paley and coarse-graining literature have long established that energy flux is primarily controlled by nearby scales.",
  "Low / high 尾部": "Low / high tail",
  "Low–high：主输运项精确消失": "Low–high: main transport term precisely vanishes",
  "R0.2｜临界尺度局部性与螺旋三波": "R0.2｜Critical scale locality and helical three-wave",
  "R0.3 需要得到一个对全部相位成立的严格上界， 或一个可复算的相位配置将该上界否定。": "R0.3 Requires a strict upper bound valid for all phases, or a calculable phase configuration to negate such an upper bound.",
  "Waleffe 进一步用“instability assumption”讨论平均传递方向；那是湍流闭合中的动力学假设。 这里只使用单三波方程及其精确守恒比。我不由此推断完整 Navier–Stokes 解的级联方向。": "Waleffe further discusses the average transport direction using \"instability assumption\" in turbulence closure; that is a dynamical hypothesis in turbulent closure. Here only single three-wave equations and their exact conservation ratios are used. I do not infer the cascade direction of complete Navier–Stokes solutions from this.",
  "\\((1,1)\\) 或 \\(y=1+x\\)": "\\((1,1)\\) or \\(y=1+x\\)",
