  "单个三元组没有编码壳重数，也没有检查许多三元组之间的相位兼容性。": "single triad does not encode shell weights, nor does it check phase compatibility among many triads.",
  "单三元组的三个模态能量变化率共享一个实标量 \\(\\Phi\\)。在上述规范下，它们的比值是": "the three modal energy change rates of a single triad share one real scalar \\(\\Phi\\). Under the above norm, their ratios are",
  "当三个符号相同，\\(W_s\\) 中六个二次项两两抵消，所以 \\(W_s=0\\)。 这不是 \\(g\\) 消失；它来自单三元组同时守恒能量和 helicity。 对正螺旋模态，helicity 的二次权重正好是 \\(K\\)，与 \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) 平方的权重相同。": "when the three signs are the same, six quadratic terms in \\(W_s\\) cancel pairwise, so \\(W_s=0\\). This is not due to the disappearance of \\(g\\); it comes from the single triad simultaneously conserving energy and helicity. For positive helical modes, the quadratic weight for helicity exactly matches \\(K\\) with the weight of \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) squared.",
  "得到的排除": "obtained exclusion",
  "低于解析值 \\(4.83\\times10^{-7}\\)": "below analytic value \\(4.83\\times10^{-7}\\)",
  "对 \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) 的平方加权后，真正相关的侧长因子不是单独的 \\(g\\)，而是": "squared weighted by \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\), the truly relevant side length factor is not individual \\(g\\) but rather",
  "对每个非退化同号三元组， \\(K T_K+P T_P+Q T_Q=0\\)。因此其临界单三元组核 \\(\\mathcal C_{+++}\\) 在整个 \\(D\\) 上恒为零。": "for each nondegenerate same-sign triad, \\(K T_K+P T_P+Q T_Q=0\\). Therefore its critical single triad kernel \\(\\mathcal C_{+++}\\) vanishes identically over the entire \\(D\\).",
  "对每个格点保留两个螺旋分量，写出完整有限维三线性型。": "retains two helical components at each lattice point and writes out the full finite-dimensional trilinear form.",
