  "规范：Waleffe 螺旋基": "Convention: Waleffe helical basis",
  "计算脚本没有参与解析证明。它用显式复向量重新构造螺旋基，并把直接三重积与侧长闭式公式比较； 另用 \\(600\\times600\\) 网格给解析最大值提供独立下界。": "The computational script did not participate in the analytic proof. It reconstitutes the helical basis with explicit complex vectors and compares the direct triple product with side-length closed-form formulas; another \\(600\\times600\\) grid provides an independent lower bound for the analytic maximum.",
  "记 \\(p(r)=3r^3-2r^2-8r+4\\)。 在 \\((1,2)\\) 中，\\(p'(r)=9r^2-4r-8\\) 只有一个零点。 \\(p\\) 先下降后上升，而 \\(p(1)=-3\\)、\\(p(2)=4\\)，所以该区间内恰有一个根。": "Denote \\(p(r)=3r^3-2r^2-8r+4\\). In \\((1,2)\\), \\(p'(r)=9r^2-4r-8\\) has only one zero point. \\(p\\) first decreases then increases, while both \\(p(1)=-3\\) and \\(p(2)=4\\) do not, so there is exactly one root in this interval.",
  "记录三线性型与 \\(\\|u\\|_{\\dot H^{1/2}}\\|u\\|_{\\dot H^{3/2}}^2\\) 的比值随壳半径的变化。": "Record the ratio of the triple linear form to \\(\\|u\\|_{\\dot H^{1/2}}\\|u\\|_{\\dot H^{3/2}}^2\\) as a function of shell radius.",
