  "如果数值优化只在违反现实条件、散度零条件或 Fourier 闭合时产生增益，该构造作废。 如果增益依赖浮点误差，则改用区间界或有理算术复核。": "if numerical optimization only gains when violating realistic conditions, divergence-free condition, or Fourier closure, this construction is invalid. If the gain depends on floating-point error, use interval bounds or rational arithmetic for verification.",
  "若 \\(F(t)=(2x+2-t)(2-t)(2x-t)t^3\\)，则 \\[ \\frac{F'(t)}{F(t)} =\\frac3t-\\frac1{2x+2-t}-\\frac1{2-t}-\\frac1{2x-t}>0. \\] 这里用到 \\(0\\lt t\\le x\\le1\\)：后三个分母都不小于 \\(t\\)，且不可能同时等于 \\(t\\)。": "If \\(F(t)=(2x+2-t)(2-t)(2x-t)t^3\\), then \\[ \\frac{F'(t)}{F(t)} =\\frac3t-\\frac1{2x+2-t}-\\frac1{2-t}-\\frac1{2x-t}>0. \\] Here \\(0\\lt t\\le x\\le1\\): each of the last three denominators is at least \\(t\\), and they cannot all equal \\(t\\) at the same time.",
  "三个异号类在紧的近对角区域保留 \\(O(1)\\) 临界核。": "The three opposite-sign classes retain an \\(O(1)\\) critical kernel in the compact near-diagonal region.",
