  "把目标从 \\(t=0\\) 的 \\(\\Xi\\) 改为时间积分 \\[ \\mathcal G_T=\\int_0^T[-\\mathfrak T(u(\\tau))-\\nu\\|u(\\tau)\\|_{\\dot H^{3/2}}^2],d\\tau, \\] 检查瞬时最优是否也是短时增长最优。": "the goal is to change from time-integration check of instantaneous optimality for short-time growth optimality for \\(t=0\\) to \\(\\Xi\\) then to \\[ \\mathcal G_T=\\int_0^T[-\\mathfrak T(u(\\tau))-\\nu\\|u(\\tau)\\|_{\\dot H^{3/2}}^2],d\\tau, \\].",
