  "R0.13：第五阶树分解与外部能量下界": "R0.13: Fifth-order tree decomposition and lower bound on external energy",
  "R0.14 已把标量幅度和相位自由度压缩到不到百万分之一的比值间隙。 下一项真正可能改变结论的变量是极化，而不是继续微调催化模长。": "R0.14 has compressed scalar amplitudes and phase freedoms to a ratio gap of less than one in ten million. The next truly variable factor that could change the conclusion is polarization, rather than further fine-tuning of catalytic modulus length.",
