  "R0.15：关闭微小区间，再放开极化": "R0.15: close microinterval, then release polarization",
  ", Interval Mathematics 1985, LNCS 212, 37-56。多元 Bernstein 包围与细分收敛的来源。": ", Interval Mathematics 1985, LNCS 212, 37-56. The origin of multivariate Bernstein enveloping and subdivision convergence.",
  ", Physics of Fluids A 4 (1992), 350-363。Fourier 三波与极化相互作用的原始分析。": ", Physics of Fluids A 4 (1992), 350-363. The original Fourier triad and polarization interaction analysis.",
