  "目标次数": "target order",
  "频率审计：叶数 1–13": "frequency audit: leaf numbers 1–13",
  "频率支持由指数式树枚举压缩为精确的立方格点几何。": "frequency support is compressed from exponential tree enumeration to exact cubic lattice geometry.",
  "热算子第一次进入目标模的严格展开": "strict expansion of the thermal operator entering the target mode for the first time",
