  "R0.24：最小叶边界面上的 \\(N=3\\) 精确检查": "R0.24: exact \\(N=3\\) check on the minimal-leaf boundary face",
  "R0.25 完整数学说明": "Full mathematical note for R0.25",
  "R0.25｜边界面极化通道约化": "R0.25 | boundary-face polarization-channel reduction",
