  "所有区间端点均由 GMP 有理数直接计算，不依赖浮点舍入。": "all interval endpoints are directly calculated by GMP rational numbers without relying on floating-point rounding.",
  "同一笔记还证明 \\(U=-12u\\)、\\(V=-3v\\) 满足全阶恒等式 \\(\\{U,V\\}=UV\\) 与 \\(U/V=(Z/W)e^{-a}\\)，从而把尖锐输运精确约化为主动标量 \\(a\\) 和一个线性伸缩量。": "The same note also proves the all-order identities \\(U=-12u\\), \\(V=-3v\\), \\(\\{U,V\\}=UV\\), and \\(U/V=(Z/W)e^{-a}\\), thereby reducing the sharp transport exactly to the active scalar \\(a\\) and one linear stretch.",
  "图 R0.28-1。左图比较 \\(\\rho^A_N\\) 与根盒 \\(\\rho^D_N\\)；右图给出 \\(\\Gamma_N\\) 的根盒区间，虚线为一。阴影标记 \\(N=29\\) 至 40 的紧尾段。区间是有限精确结果，不代表已经证明比值收敛。": "Figure R0.28-1. The left panel compares \\(\\rho^A_N\\) with the root-box interval for \\(\\rho^D_N\\); the right panel shows the root-box interval for \\(\\Gamma_N\\), with a dashed line at one. Shading marks the tight tail window from \\(N=29\\) through 40. These are exact finite intervals, not a proof of ratio convergence.",
  "我消去了负边缘递推中的根式与生成元，把端点写成三个有理数数组。整个认证根盒上，奇偶符号在 \\(8\\le N\\le40\\) 成立，尖锐系数比从 \\(N=18\\) 到 40 持续占优。": "I removed the radicals and their generator from the negative-edge recurrence, reducing the endpoint to three rational arrays. Throughout the certified root box, the parity signs hold for \\(8\\le N\\le40\\), and the sharp-series coefficient ratio is uniformly smaller from \\(N=18\\) through 40.",
  "研究笔记 R0.28 · 精确有理数": "Research Note R0.28 · exact rational arithmetic",
  "研究笔记 R0.28：消去负边缘递推中的根式，以精确有理数认证 N≤40 的根盒符号与连续系数比分离。": "Research Note R0.28: remove radicals from the negative-edge recurrence and use exact rationals to certify root-box signs and consecutive coefficient-ratio separation through N≤40.",
  "已知叶单项式被完整提出，剩余三个数组全部属于 \\(\\mathbb Q\\)。": "After factoring out the known leaf monomials completely, all three remaining arrays lie in \\(\\mathbb Q\\).",
  "用这些有理数重建的 \\(\\sigma_{B,N}\\) 与 \\(d_N/((3N-1)a_N)\\)，在 \\(N\\le25\\) 上与 R0.27 证书逐项一致。": "Reconstructing \\(\\sigma_{B,N}\\) and \\(d_N/((3N-1)a_N)\\) from these rationals agrees term by term with the R0.27 certificate for \\(N\\le25\\).",
