  "有限窗口尚不能证明比值收敛，也不能定位真正的收敛半径。": "finite window cannot prove ratio convergence or locate the true convergence radius.",
  "有限电荷带已经被严格排除": "Finite charge bands have been rigorously ruled out",
  "于是 \\(a,u,v\\) 的全部系数都是有理数。生成元 \\(t\\) 只改变变量 \\(W\\) 的尺度，不再参与端点尖锐比。": "Thus every coefficient of \\(a,u,v\\) is rational. The radical generator \\(t\\) only rescales \\(W\\) and drops out of the endpoint sharp ratio.",
  "再把线性尖锐方程按根参数拆成": "Next split the linear sharp equation by the root parameters",
  "这段完整窗口中最小的下界是 \\(\\Gamma_{19}>1.0294319301\\)。在更稳定的 \\(N=29\\) 至 40 尾段，统一区间为": "the minimum lower bound in this complete window is \\(\\Gamma_{19}>1.0294319301\\). In the more stable \\(N=29\\) to 40 tail segment, unified intervals are",
  "这解释了 R0.27 的趋势，但还没有把趋势变成极限": "this explains R0.27's trend but has not yet turned trends into limits",
