  "R0.29 证明输运方程在电荷 \\(q\\) 上必然含有非零的向上耦合 \\(k f_{k,q+1}\\)。因此任何固定数量的相邻扇区都不能形成闭合递推；下一步必须控制带权无限电荷阶梯，或转向典范坐标中的指数奇点。": "R0.29 proves that the transport equation on charge \\(q\\) necessarily contains a non-zero upward coupling \\(k f_{k,q+1}\\). Therefore, any fixed number of adjacent sectors cannot form a closed recursion; the next step must control the weighted infinite charge ladder or turn to exponential singularities in canonical coordinates.",
