  "结果精确积分了线性输运层：任意以齐次多项式 \\(P_m(Z,W)\\) 起始的输运解都等于 \\(P_m(U,V)\\)。困难现在集中到典范映射本身的解析域和系数符号。": "The result integrates the linear transport layer exactly: every transported solution beginning with a homogeneous polynomial \\(P_m(Z,W)\\) equals \\(P_m(U,V)\\). The difficulty is now concentrated in the analyticity domain and coefficient signs of the canonical map itself.",
  "两个输运数组组成对数辛坐标": "The two transport arrays form log-symplectic coordinates",
  "两者的二次首项都是 \\(ZW\\)。在次数 \\(n>2\\) 上，未知项前的系数是 \\(n-2\\)，右侧只含更低次数。因此逐次唯一性给出 \\(\\{U,V\\}=UV\\)。": "Both quadratic leading terms are \\(ZW\\). At degree \\(n>2\\), the unknown has coefficient \\(n-2\\), while the right-hand side contains only lower degrees. Degree-by-degree uniqueness therefore gives \\(\\{U,V\\}=UV\\).",
  "令 \\(B=\\log Z-\\log W\\)，则 \\(\\{B,F\\}=\\mathcal L F\\)。输运方程和对数辛恒等式共同给出": "Let \\(B=\\log Z-\\log W\\). Then \\(\\{B,F\\}=\\mathcal L F\\), and the transport equations together with the log-symplectic identity give",
  "令 \\(X=Z\\partial_Z\\)、\\(Y=W\\partial_W\\)、\\(\\mathcal L=X+Y\\)，并取": "Set \\(X=Z\\partial_Z\\), \\(Y=W\\partial_W\\), and \\(\\mathcal L=X+Y\\), and define",
