  "R0.30 已经把全部电荷层压缩到两个标量卷积不等式：": "R0.30 had already compressed every charge layer into two scalar convolution inequalities:",
  "R0.30：全阶解析主控与共同解析域": "R0.30: all-order analytic majorant and common analytic domain",
  "R0.31 · 有限精确段与解析尾段分开记录": "R0.31 · exact finite segment recorded separately from the analytic tail segment",
  "R0.31 达到了上一笔记设定的最低交付标准：不是简单增加递推次数，而是严格扩大了全阶解析域。更重要的是，证明把有限计算与无限尾估计拼接成一个可复核证书，避免把有限曲线外推成定理。": "R0.31 meets the minimum deliverable set in the preceding note: it does not merely increase the recurrence depth, but rigorously enlarges the all-order analytic domain. More importantly, the proof joins finite computation to an infinite tail estimate in a checkable certificate instead of extrapolating a finite curve into a theorem.",
  "R0.31 精确卷积核、解析尾界与改进保证半径": "R0.31 exact convolution kernel, analytic tail bound, and improved guaranteed radius",
  "R0.31｜改进主控与统一解析域": "R0.31｜Improved majorant and unified analytic domain",
  "R0.32 已经定义与端点抽取相容的固定荷级数，并为 22 个输运 D-log Padé 逼近给出精确根盒、留数包围和双精度复核。约 \\(-0.7495\\) 的聚集仍只称为有限候选，因为覆盖该位置的解析延拓与余项界尚未证明。": "R0.32 defines the fixed-charge series compatible with endpoint extraction and gives exact root boxes, residue enclosures, and two-precision checks for 22 transport D-log Pade approximants. The cluster near \\(-0.7495\\) is still called only a finite candidate because analytic continuation and a remainder bound reaching that location have not been proved.",
  "。提供端点系数比值的有限先验迹象。": ". Provides finite prior evidence from endpoint coefficient ratios.",
  "。提供固定荷解析小圆盘的全阶输入。": ". Provides the all-order input for the small fixed-charge analytic disc.",
  "\\(D_1=p_*U_1+q_*V_1\\) 的对数导数在约 \\(-0.723449\\) 出现一个更靠近原点的稳定分母根。若只按距离排序，它似乎比输运候选更重要；但其留数接近 \\(+1\\)，正是一个简单零点的局部信号。": "The logarithmic derivative of \\(D_1=p_*U_1+q_*V_1\\) has a stable denominator root near \\(-0.723449\\), closer to the origin. Ranked by distance alone, it would appear more important than the transport candidate; but its residue is near \\(+1\\), the local signature of a simple zero.",
  "\\(F_q(R)=[\\Xi^q]F(R,\\Xi)\\)，其中 \\(R=Z^2W\\)、\\(\\Xi=Z^{-1}\\)。": "\\(F_q(R)=[\\Xi^q]F(R,\\Xi)\\), where \\(R=Z^2W\\) and \\(\\Xi=Z^{-1}\\).",
