  "保证半径 \\(64/531441\\)": "Guaranteed radius \\(64/531441\\)",
  "不能声称收敛半径约为 0.7495，不能声称最近复奇点已定位，不能声称 D-log Padé 极点必然收敛，也不能从该有限诊断推出 Navier–Stokes 解的奇性。": "I cannot claim that the convergence radius is about 0.7495, that the nearest complex singularity has been located, or that the D-log Pade poles must converge; nor can this finite diagnostic imply singularity of a Navier-Stokes solution.",
  "查看数学说明": "Read the mathematical note",
  "从最终检查点重启，比较端点系数、诊断、摘要和交互作用计数，确认结果逐项一致。": "Restart from the final checkpoint and compare endpoint coefficients, diagnostics, summaries, and interaction counts to confirm exact agreement.",
