  "对每个偶数截断 \\(30,32,\\ldots,50\\) 构造对角 \\([m/m]\\) D-log Padé 逼近，其中 \\(m=(N-2)/2\\)；": "For each even cut \\(30,32,\\ldots,50\\), construct the diagonal \\([m/m]\\) D-log Pade approximant with \\(m=(N-2)/2\\);",
  "对象": "Object",
  "多截断、精确隔根和双精度复核": "Multiple cuts, exact root isolation, and two-precision checks",
