  "截断": "Cut",
  "精确根隔离证明的是有限 D-log Padé 分母的根，不是原固定荷级数的奇点。该边缘约化系统也不是完整三维 Navier–Stokes 方程。": "Exact root isolation proves roots of finite D-log Pade denominators, not singularities of the original fixed-charge series. This edge-reduced system is also not the full three-dimensional Navier-Stokes equation.",
  "精确认证结果": "Exact certified result",
