  "八十阶中心之外的修正 \\(h\\) 支持在 \\(i>N=80\\)。在 \\(x=-1\\) 端点，严格尾乘子是": "The correction \\(h\\) beyond the degree-80 center is supported on \\(i>N=80\\). At the \\(x=-1\\) endpoint, the strict-tail multiplier is",
  "把 \\(257/1000\\) 固定为首个成功判据，并保留更近的有理失败探针；": "Fix \\(257/1000\\) as the first success test and retain a closer rational failure probe;",
