  "版本 v0.42 · 2026-08-19": "Version v0.42 · 2026-08-19",
  "半径增长、旧障碍、新证明门与相邻边界统一归档": "Radius gain, old barrier, new proof gates, and adjacent boundary in one archive",
  "保留大荷解析界中共同的荷比与次数变量，检查是否再次发生独立最大化；": "Retain the common charge-ratio and degree variables in the analytic large-charge bound, and test whether they are again maximized independently;",
