  "指数重构有限": "Exponential reconstruction is finite",
  "主动递推": "Active recurrence",
  "主动尾、伸缩逆与指数重构均在同一开多圆盘闭合。": "The active tail, stretch inverse, and exponential reconstruction all close on the same open polydisc.",
  "总次数 10 内 3055 对单项式": "3055 monomial pairs through total degree 10",
  "r = 0.282 上的量": "Quantity at r = 0.282",
  "R0.29 的全阶形式恒等式给出 \\(\\{U,V\\}=UV\\) 和 \\(U/V=(Z/W)e^{-a}\\)。定义": "The R0.29 all-order formal identities give \\(\\{U,V\\}=UV\\) and \\(U/V=(Z/W)e^{-a}\\). Define",
  "R0.29：正则输运约化": "R0.29: canonical transport reduction",
  "R0.41：次数分辨主动尾": "R0.41: degree-resolved active tail",
  "R0.42 的核心进展不是把 \\(0.28125\\) 改成 \\(0.329\\)，而是确认旧障碍为精确算子范数后，通过已有正则恒等式改变逆问题。在新算子中，\\(\\mathcal L^{-1}\\) 的输出次数与加权范数完全抵消，因而一个保持正性的凸两端点公式同时控制无穷多个输入次数和荷。它不是靠未经证明的符号抵消降低界。": "The central advance in R0.42 is not changing \\(0.28125\\) to \\(0.329\\). After confirming that the old barrier is an exact operator norm, the inverse problem is changed through an existing canonical identity. In the new operator, the output degree from \\(\\mathcal L^{-1}\\) cancels exactly against the weighted norm, so one positivity-preserving convex two-endpoint formula controls infinitely many input degrees and charges at once. The bound is not lowered by an unproved signed cancellation.",
  "R0.42 正则伸缩输运的半径阶梯、0.282 旧障碍分解、0.329 证明门与 0.330 相邻控制": "R0.42 canonical-stretch transport: radius ladder, old barrier decomposition at 0.282, proof gates at 0.329, and adjacent control at 0.330",
  "R0.42｜正则伸缩输运": "R0.42 | Canonical-stretch transport",
  "R0.43：分解 \\(s\\ge241\\) 的大荷主动扇区": "R0.43: decompose the large-charge active sector \\(s\\ge241\\)",
  "。成功计算耗时 37.889746 秒；监控历时 38.028696 秒、采样 255 次，峰值 CPU 为 100.0%，峰值常驻内存为 44.312 MiB。没有使用 GPU、随机种子或浮点判号，22 项正式检查全部通过。": ". The successful computation took 37.889746 seconds; monitoring ran for 38.028696 seconds with 255 samples, peak CPU usage of 100.0%, and peak resident memory of 44.312 MiB. No GPU, random seed, or floating-point sign decision was used, and all 22 formal checks passed.",
  "。给出本阶段保留的无限大荷逐项界。": ". Gives the termwise infinite-large-charge bound retained at this stage.",
  "。固定 0.330 验收点并提供正则场重构。": ". Fixes 0.330 as the acceptance point and provides the regular-field reconstruction.",
  "。提供未改变的有限荷共同端点列。": ". Provides the unchanged common endpoint columns for finite charges.",
