  "证明允许域上的单调性、凸性或有限端点归约，保留所有中心项共享的 \\(j\\)；": "Prove monotonicity, convexity, or a finite endpoint reduction on the allowed domain while retaining the \\(j\\) shared by all center terms;",
  "中心次数与荷记为 \\((i,q)\\)，尾输入记为 \\((j,s)\\)。精确加权列贡献为": "Write the center degree and charge as \\((i,q)\\) and the tail input as \\((j,s)\\). The exact weighted column contribution is",
  "中心项不能各自选择不同的输入斜率，消除了 R0.43 的主要松弛。": "Center terms cannot each choose a different input slope; this removes the main R0.43 relaxation.",
