  "最大扇区为 \\(s=-1\\)": "Maximal sector is \\(s=-1\\)",
  "R0.43 把 \\(r=0.331\\) 的大正荷界留在 1.003896。我不再让中心项各自选择最坏输入斜率，而是保留同一尾列共享的 \\(x=s/j\\)。完整正和成为凸函数，只需两个端点；这一次不仅通过 0.331，还把共同认证半径推进到 0.370。": "R0.43 left the large-positive-charge bound at 1.003896 for \\(r=0.331\\). I no longer let the center terms choose their worst input slopes independently, but retain the \\(x=s/j\\) shared by one tail column. The complete positive sum becomes convex and needs only two endpoints; this not only passes 0.331 but advances the common certified radius to 0.370.",
  "R0.43 的大荷界让每个中心项选择了不同的最坏斜率": "The R0.43 large-charge bound let each center term choose a different worst slope",
  "R0.43 用支持条件 \\(s\\le2j\\) 把大正荷扇区的统一输入次数下界提高到 \\(j\\ge121\\)，并在 \\(r=0.330\\) 闭合。到了入口点 \\(r=0.331\\)，旧充分界仍为": "R0.43 used the support condition \\(s\\le2j\\) to raise the uniform input-degree floor in the large-positive-charge sector to \\(j\\ge121\\), closing at \\(r=0.330\\). At the entry point \\(r=0.331\\), the old sufficient bound is still",
  "R0.43：大荷支持耦合": "R0.43: large-charge support coupling",
  "R0.44 的实质是恢复“一个真实输入列只有一个斜率”这一确定性相关性。它把一个看似二维的大荷优化化为正凸函数的两个端点，不依赖符号抵消，也不依赖有限采样。这种证明结构简洁、可移植，适合作为约化生成系统论文中的独立引理。": "The substance of R0.44 is restoring the deterministic correlation that a genuine input column has only one slope. It reduces an apparently two-dimensional large-charge optimization to the two endpoints of a positive convex function, without sign cancellation or finite sampling. This proof structure is concise and portable enough to serve as an independent lemma in a paper on the reduced generating system.",
  "R0.44 共同斜率凸包络、逐项斜率损失消除、三个半径控制和 0.370 完整证明门": "R0.44 common-slope convex envelope, removal of termwise slope loss, three radius controls, and complete proof gates at 0.370",
  "R0.44｜共同斜率端点定理": "R0.44 | Common-slope endpoint theorem",
  "。把下一瓶颈定位到 \\(s=-1\\)。": ". This identifies the next bottleneck at \\(s=-1\\).",
  "。科学计算耗时 35.640978 秒；监控历时 35.747394 秒、采样 240 次，峰值 CPU 为 100.0%，峰值常驻内存为 42.766 MiB。没有使用 GPU、随机种子或浮点判号，33 项正式检查全部通过。": ". Scientific computation took 35.640978 seconds; monitoring lasted 35.747394 seconds with 240 samples, peak CPU use of 100.0%, and peak resident memory of 42.766 MiB. No GPU, random seed, or floating-point sign decision was used, and all 33 formal checks passed.",
  "。提供统一输入次数下界。": ". This supplies the uniform lower bound on input degree.",
  "\\(F_{0.371}\\) 在整个连续区间 \\([0,1/82]\\) 上严格递增。因此每个允许的 \\(j>80\\) 都有 \\(F_{0.371}(1/j)\\le F_{0.371}(1/82)\\)，真实最大值严格位于格点 \\(j=82\\)。证明不使用系数符号抵消，也不使用尾次数网格。": "\\(F_{0.371}\\) is strictly increasing throughout \\([0,1/82]\\). Therefore every admissible \\(j>80\\) satisfies \\(F_{0.371}(1/j)\\le F_{0.371}(1/82)\\), and the exact maximum occurs at the lattice point \\(j=82\\). The proof uses neither coefficient-sign cancellation nor a tail-degree grid.",
  "\\(r=0.371\\) 的精确 \\(s=-1\\) 列": "At \\(r=0.371\\), the exact \\(s=-1\\) column",
  "0.372 已在当前标量 ℓ1 列上真实失败，继续收紧同一公式没有空间。下一阶段把例外输出零荷通道与其余主动尾分成两个块，固定 0.372 为首个验收点，并预定 0.373 为相邻控制。": "The current scalar ℓ1 column genuinely fails at 0.372, so the same formula has no further slack to remove. The next stage separates the exceptional zero-output-charge channel from the remaining active tail into two blocks, fixes 0.372 as the first acceptance point, and preassigns 0.373 as the adjacent control.",
