  "度一、荷二种子的中心系数为一，其列贡献是 \\(r(1+t)(2+t)\\)，所以导数不小于 \\(3r\\)。丢掉其余全部正导数后仍有": "The degree-one, charge-two seed has center coefficient one, and its column contribution is \\(r(1+t)(2+t)\\), so its derivative is at least \\(3r\\). Discarding every other positive derivative still gives",
  "对 \\(q=1\\) 直接求导：": "Direct differentiation for \\(q=1\\) gives:",
  "对三维 Navier–Stokes 千禧年问题，直接价值仍然有限。当前没有定理把约化二元边生成系统的控制传递到完整速度场的尺度临界范数，也没有覆盖所有空间、螺旋和跨尺度相互作用。": "The direct value for the three-dimensional Navier–Stokes Millennium problem remains limited. No theorem currently transfers control of the reduced bivariate edge generating system to a scale-critical norm of the full velocity field, and the model does not cover all spatial, helical, and cross-scale interactions.",
  "非负": "nonnegative",
  "非正": "nonpositive",
  "覆盖每个允许的 \\(j>80\\)": "covers every admissible \\(j>80\\)",
