  "共同认证半径推进到 0.371": "The common certified radius advances to 0.371",
  "固定负荷": "Fixed negative charge",
  "固定输入荷 \\(s=-1\\) 后，允许次数满足 \\(j>80\\) 与 \\(j\\equiv1\\pmod3\\)，所以最低次数为 82。R0.44 在 \\(r=0.371\\) 上继承的统一充分界是": "After fixing the input charge at \\(s=-1\\), admissible degrees satisfy \\(j>80\\) and \\(j\\equiv1\\pmod3\\), so the minimum degree is 82. The inherited R0.44 uniform sufficient bound at \\(r=0.371\\) is",
  "恒为零": "identically zero",
  "价值在于精确全阶瓶颈与可证伪边界，不在于声称接近了 PDE 终点": "The value lies in an exact all-order bottleneck and a falsifiable boundary, not in claiming proximity to the PDE endpoint",
  "结论不是由分离上界或有限采样推断。": "The conclusion is not inferred from a separated upper bound or finite sampling.",
  "结论只适用于主动支持锥、约化典范边生成系统和本文的次数加权 Wiener 范数。它没有证明三维不可压 Navier–Stokes 全局正则性，没有构造有限时奇性，也没有把 \\(0.371\\) 解释成真实 PDE 的时空解析半径。": "The result applies only to the active support cone, the reduced canonical edge generating system, and the degree-weighted Wiener norm used here. It does not prove global regularity for three-dimensional incompressible Navier–Stokes, construct a finite-time singularity, or interpret \\(0.371\\) as a space-time analyticity radius of the actual PDE.",
