  "同一半径的真实 \\(j=82\\) 列为 0.997228。要把这一数值变成全阶结论，必须证明所有更大允许次数都不会更坏，而不能只多算几个格点。": "The exact \\(j=82\\) column at the same radius is 0.997228. Turning this value into an all-order conclusion requires proving that every larger admissible degree is no worse; computing a few more lattice points is insufficient.",
  "图 R0.45-1。左上显示 \\(r=0.371\\) 与 \\(0.372\\) 上精确 \\(s=-1\\) 列的展示采样与真实 \\(j=82\\) 端点；右上显示种子下界、\\(q=1\\) 阻碍和正导数余量；左下分离精确列、大荷扇区、正则伸缩与 R0.44 旧估计；右下列出目标半径的完整门槛。PDF、SVG、600 dpi PNG、精确数据、清单和 SHA-256 摘要一并归档，彩色、真实灰度和 PDF 渲染页均已检查。": "Figure R0.45-1. The upper left shows presentation samples at \\(r=0.371\\) and \\(0.372\\) of the exact \\(s=-1\\) column, together with the true \\(j=82\\) endpoints. The upper right shows the seed lower bound, the \\(q=1\\) obstruction, and the positive derivative margin. The lower left separates the exact column, large-charge sector, canonical stretch, and old R0.44 estimate. The lower right lists the complete gates at the target radius. The PDF, SVG, 600 dpi PNG, exact data, manifest, and SHA-256 digest are archived together; the color, true-grayscale, and PDF-rendered versions were all inspected.",
  "完整 \\(s=-1\\) 列是共同变量 \\(t=1/j\\) 的精确有理函数": "The complete \\(s=-1\\) column is an exact rational function of the shared variable \\(t=1/j\\)",
  "完整大正荷扇区": "complete large positive-charge sector",
  "完整列 \\(F_r(t)=\\sum_{i,q}C_{i,q}(t)\\)。在每个真实尾单项式上，\\(F_r(1/j)\\) 恰好等于诱导加权 ℓ1 列；没有额外上界。": "The complete column is \\(F_r(t)=\\sum_{i,q}C_{i,q}(t)\\). For every actual tail monomial, \\(F_r(1/j)\\) equals the induced weighted ℓ1 column exactly; there is no additional upper bound.",
  "完整审计还重建 2,161 项八十阶中心、计算 6,345 项 81–160 阶残差，并检查 1,113,168 个有序递推相互作用。所有阈值判定都使用 GMP 有理数。": "The complete audit also reconstructs the 2,161-term degree-80 center, computes the 6,345-term residual on degrees 81–160, and checks 1,113,168 ordered recurrence interactions. Every threshold decision uses GMP rationals.",
  "下一步检验例外零荷通道的二块加权范数": "The next step tests a two-block weighted norm for the exceptional zero-charge channel",
  "相对 R0.44：× 1.002703": "Relative to R0.44: × 1.002703",
  "相邻 \\(r=0.372\\) 的负向控制也更强：失败量已经是固定八十阶中心的真实最大诱导列。若要在当前约化模型中继续提高半径，不能只微调同一标量列估计，而需要改变范数、使用块结构，或重新组织中心与尾部的分割。": "The adjacent negative control at \\(r=0.372\\) is also stronger: the failed quantity is already the exact maximum induced column of the fixed degree-80 center. Any further radius gain in the current reduced model requires changing the norm, using block structure, or reorganizing the center-tail split rather than slightly tightening the same scalar column estimate.",
  "严格为正": "strictly positive",
  "研究笔记 R0.45 · 固定负荷与全阶主动尾": "Research note R0.45 · fixed negative charge and all-order active tail",
  "研究笔记 R0.45：把固定输入荷 s=-1 的完整尾列写成 t=1/j 的精确有理函数，以统一导数下界证明真实最大值位于 j=82，并把约化典范边生成系统的认证半径推进到 0.371。": "Research note R0.45: the complete fixed-input-charge s=-1 tail column is written as an exact rational function of t=1/j. A uniform derivative lower bound proves that the exact maximum occurs at j=82 and advances the certified radius of the reduced canonical edge generating system to 0.371.",
  "一个度一 \\(q=2\\) 种子足以压过全部 \\(q=1\\) 负导数": "One degree-one \\(q=2\\) seed dominates every negative \\(q=1\\) derivative",
  "因子 \\(|q+1|=0\\)": "the factor \\(|q+1|=0\\)",
  "有限次数只验证公式和实现，不承担无穷证明。": "Finite degrees validate only the formula and implementation; they do not carry the infinite proof.",
  "有限次数只验证实现，单调性来自导数定理": "Finite degrees validate the implementation only; monotonicity comes from the derivative theorem",
  "与此同时，大正荷扇区为 \\(0.9766138680187372<1\\)，多项式正则伸缩界为 \\(0.9654865726049067<1\\)。因此当前标量加权 ℓ1 方法的下一失败来自精确诱导列，而不再只是辅助上界。它仍不表示 0.372 存在奇性。": "Meanwhile, the large positive-charge sector is \\(0.9766138680187372<1\\), and the polynomial canonical-stretch bound is \\(0.9654865726049067<1\\). Thus the next failure of the current scalar weighted ℓ1 method comes from an exact induced column rather than merely an auxiliary upper bound. It still does not indicate a singularity at 0.372.",
  "原因": "reason",
  "在 \\(r=0.371\\) 上，27 个 \\(q=1\\) 中心项给出": "At \\(r=0.371\\), the 27 center terms with \\(q=1\\) give",
  "这里证明的是约化生成系统的一条精确全阶列定理": "This is an exact all-order column theorem for the reduced generating system",
  "真实 s=-1 列在 0≤t≤1/82 上严格递增；0.371 通过，0.372 的同一精确诱导列超过一。": "The exact s=-1 column is strictly increasing on 0≤t≤1/82; 0.371 passes, while the same exact induced column exceeds one at 0.372.",
  "正式检查：33 项全通过": "Formal checks: all 33 passed",
