  "中心次数和荷记为 \\((i,q)\\)，权重记为 \\(c_{i,q}(r)=|a_{i,q}|r^i\\)。令 \\(t=1/j\\)，则": "Write the center degree and charge as \\((i,q)\\), and the weight as \\(c_{i,q}(r)=|a_{i,q}|r^i\\). Let \\(t=1/j\\). Then",
  "中心荷": "center charge",
  "主动尾、球映射、正则伸缩和指数重构在同一半径闭合。": "The active tail, ball mapping, canonical stretch, and exponential reconstruction close at the same radius.",
  "最大值是真实列 \\(j=82\\)": "the maximum is the exact \\(j=82\\) column",
  "R0.42 的正则场方程 \\(\\mathcal L\\phi-\\{a,\\phi\\}=(X-Y)a/2\\) 与 \\(U=Z e^{\\phi-a/2},V=W e^{\\phi+a/2}\\) 因此继续在同一半径闭合。旧直接输运诊断仍大于一，但它不是正则分解后的构造门。": "The R0.42 regular-field equation \\(\\mathcal L\\phi-\\{a,\\phi\\}=(X-Y)a/2\\) and \\(U=Z e^{\\phi-a/2},V=W e^{\\phi+a/2}\\) therefore continue to close at the same radius. The old direct-transport diagnostic remains above one, but it is not a construction gate after the regular factorization.",
  "R0.44 的失败来自分离估计，不是 \\(j=82\\) 的真实诱导列": "The R0.44 failure came from a separated estimate, not the exact induced \\(j=82\\) column",
  "R0.44 在 \\(r=0.371\\) 留下的 \\(s=-1\\) 统一界为 1.000856，但真实最低次数列只有 0.997228。我把完整列保留为共同变量 \\(t=1/j\\) 的精确有理函数，并证明它在整个允许区间严格递增。最大值因此不是估计端点，而是真实格点 \\(j=82\\)。": "At \\(r=0.371\\), R0.44 left the uniform \\(s=-1\\) bound at 1.000856, while the exact minimum-degree column is only 0.997228. I retain the complete column as an exact rational function of the shared variable \\(t=1/j\\) and prove that it is strictly increasing throughout the admissible interval. The maximum is therefore not an estimated endpoint but the exact lattice point \\(j=82\\).",
  "R0.44：共同斜率端点": "R0.44: common-slope endpoint",
  "R0.45 把一个分离上界失败替换为完整固定荷列的精确端点定理。证明结构可复用：先穷尽负导数通道，再用一个显式低次种子给出统一正余量。它不依赖画图、有限采样或系数符号。": "R0.45 replaces a failed separated upper bound with an exact endpoint theorem for the complete fixed-charge column. The proof structure is reusable: first exhaust the negative-derivative channels, then use an explicit low-degree seed to obtain a uniform positive margin. It does not depend on plotting, finite sampling, or coefficient signs.",
  "R0.45 固定负荷精确列、统一导数证书、三个连续半径控制和 0.371 完整证明门": "R0.45 exact fixed-negative-charge column, uniform derivative certificate, three consecutive radius controls, and complete proof gates at 0.371",
  "R0.45｜固定负荷精确端点定理": "R0.45 | Exact fixed-negative-charge endpoint theorem",
