  "。科学计算耗时 39.158856 秒；监控历时 39.282190 秒、采样 264 次，峰值 CPU 为 100.0%，峰值常驻内存为 47.047 MiB。没有使用 GPU、随机种子或浮点判号，31 项正式检查全部通过。": ". The scientific computation took 39.158856 seconds; monitoring ran for 39.282190 seconds with 264 samples, a peak CPU load of 100.0%, and a peak resident memory of 47.047 MiB. No GPU, random seed, or floating-point threshold decision was used, and all 31 formal checks passed.",
