  "\\(E'_{\\mathrm e}\\) 的 319 个 Bernstein 系数全正；最小值 1.4232222955": "All 319 Bernstein coefficients of \\(E'_{\\mathrm e}\\) are positive; the minimum is 1.4232222955",
