  "活跃的 \\(s=162,j=81\\) 列是 \\(r\\) 的有限正系数有理多项式。R0.48 将用 Sturm 序列或等价的精确有理根隔离，把百万分位夹逼升级为当前范数的锐阈值定理，并同时证明全部竞争扇区在该根附近仍严格更小。": "The active \\(s=162,j=81\\) column is a finite rational polynomial in \\(r\\) with positive coefficients. R0.48 will use a Sturm sequence or equivalent exact rational root isolation to upgrade the millionth bracket to a sharp threshold theorem for the current norm, while proving that every competing sector remains strictly smaller near that root.",
