  "08 · 固定荷几何增益": "08 · Fixed-charge geometric gain",
  "11 · R0.50 验收题": "11 · Acceptance question for R0.50",
  "39 次精确十进制二分得到": "Thirty-nine exact decimal bisections give",
  "80 个非恒定系数全正，81 项 Sturm 序列独立计出一根。": "All 80 nonconstant coefficients are positive, and an independent 81-term Sturm sequence counts one root.",
  "把活跃列写成二元精确多项式或有理函数 \\(A(r,c)\\)，证明指定矩形内对 \\(r\\) 单调；": "Write the active column as an exact bivariate polynomial or rational function \\(A(r,c)\\), and prove monotonicity in \\(r\\) on the prescribed rectangle;",
  "版本 v0.49 · 2026-08-19": "Version v0.49 · 2026-08-19",
  "保守增益因子大于 \\(1.0459367903514846826\\)。": "The conservative gain factor is greater than \\(1.0459367903514846826\\).",
  "便有精确等距关系": "This gives the exact isometry",
  "不能把 \\(r_*^{(4/5)}\\) 解释成 PDE 正则时间、奇性位置或临界雷诺数；不能把新双圆盘说成旧双圆盘的超集；不能声称 \\(c=4/5\\) 最优；不能声称已经证明或反驳三维 Navier–Stokes 正则性。": "Do not interpret \\(r_*^{(4/5)}\\) as a PDE regularity time, singularity location, or critical Reynolds number; do not claim that the new bidisk contains the old one; do not claim that \\(c=4/5\\) is optimal; and do not claim a proof or disproof of three-dimensional Navier–Stokes regularity.",
  "等价双圆盘半径为": "The equivalent bidisk radii are",
  "对 243 个竞争记录建立统一的 \\((r,c)\\) 支配余量，而不是逐点扫描；": "Establish a uniform dominance margin for all 243 competitor records on a \\((r,c)\\) rectangle, rather than using a pointwise scan;",
  "对单项式 \\(Z^mW^n\\)，定义总次数和荷": "For the monomial \\(Z^mW^n\\), define total degree and charge by",
  "对三维 Navier–Stokes 千禧年问题，直接价值仍有限。当前没有把任意散度为零三维初值嵌入这个二元约化系统，没有传播尺度临界 PDE 范数，也没有控制完整 Fourier 相互作用几何。": "The direct value for the three-dimensional Navier–Stokes Millennium Problem remains limited. I have not embedded arbitrary divergence-free three-dimensional initial data into this two-variable reduction, propagated a scale-critical PDE norm, or controlled the full Fourier interaction geometry.",
  "覆盖机制": "Coverage mechanism",
  "各向异性": "Anisotropic",
  "固定荷覆盖全部尾次数，大荷由奇偶 Bernstein 证书覆盖。": "Fixed-charge records cover every tail degree, while the large-charge sector is covered by odd and even Bernstein certificates.",
  "固定荷增益": "Fixed-charge gain",
  "固定荷增益：> 4.5936%": "Fixed-charge gain: > 4.5936%",
  "荷的可加性让整个约化方程精确共轭": "Charge additivity gives an exact conjugacy of the reduced equation",
  "荷权重 \\(\\omega_s=c^s\\) 把各向异性写成精确相似变换": "The charge weight \\(\\omega_s=c^s\\) turns anisotropy into an exact similarity transform",
  "荷权重是精确乘法特征": "The charge weight is an exact multiplicative character",
  "荷缩放还与伸缩方程中的 \\(\\mathcal L,X-Y\\)、括号及指数重构交换。伸缩算子界为 \\(0.98796898781173256118<1\\)，所以约化固定点、伸缩场与典范场都在同一各向异性空间闭合。": "Charge scaling also commutes with \\(\\mathcal L,X-Y\\), the bracket, and exponential reconstruction in the stretching equation. The stretching-operator bound is \\(0.98796898781173256118<1\\), so the reduced fixed point, stretching fields, and canonical fields all close in the same anisotropic space.",
  "荷特征范数": "Charge-character norm",
  "荷在乘法和非零对数典范括号下相加；\\(X,Y,\\mathcal L\\)、荷算子与荷投影在同一单项式基中对角。因此": "Charge is additive under multiplication and the nonzero logarithmic canonical bracket; \\(X,Y,\\mathcal L\\), the charge operator, and the charge projections are diagonal in the same monomial basis. Hence",
  "活跃列占比": "Share of the active column",
  "几何增益": "Geometric gain",
  "价值在于首次用代数兼容权重获得严格固定荷增益": "The value is the first strict fixed-charge gain obtained with an algebra-compatible weight",
