  "。科学计算耗时 137.928040 秒；监控历时 138.1 秒、采样 70 次，峰值 CPU 为 100.0%，峰值常驻内存为 104.234 MiB。没有使用 GPU、随机数或浮点符号判定，33 项精确检查全部通过。": ". The scientific computation took 137.928040 seconds; monitoring covered 138.1 seconds with 70 samples, a peak CPU load of 100.0%, and a peak resident memory of 104.234 MiB. No GPU, randomness, or floating-point sign decision was used, and all 33 exact checks passed.",
