  "半径宽度 \\(10^{-15}\\)，荷参数宽度 \\(10^{-10}\\)。": "Radius width \\(10^{-15}\\), charge-parameter width \\(10^{-10}\\).",
  "表内都是严格正的完整 GMP 有理数的显示值。\\(P\\) 在两个半径边界异号，\\(Q\\) 在两个荷参数边界异号；Poincaré–Miranda 定理给出矩形内的同时零点。上一节的全局结构随后给出唯一性和全局最优性。没有使用浮点符号判定。": "Every displayed value in the table comes from a complete strictly positive GMP rational. \\(P\\) has opposite signs on the two radius faces, and \\(Q\\) has opposite signs on the two charge-parameter faces; the Poincaré–Miranda theorem gives a simultaneous zero inside the rectangle. The global structure from the preceding section then gives uniqueness and global optimality. No floating-point sign decision is used.",
  "不能把 \\(r_*(c_*)\\) 解释成 PDE 正则时间、奇性位置或临界雷诺数；不能声称已经在所有 Banach 范数中最优；不能声称已经证明或反驳三维 Navier–Stokes 正则性。": "One cannot interpret \\(r_*(c_*)\\) as a PDE regularity time, singularity location, or critical Reynolds number; claim optimality among all Banach norms; or claim a proof or disproof of three-dimensional Navier–Stokes regularity.",
  "不是局部采样最大值，而是严格凸性与精确存在性共同给出的全局结论。": "This is not a maximum found by local sampling, but a global conclusion obtained from strict convexity and exact existence.",
  "不同中心荷": "Distinct central charges",
