  "最后一个比值接近 R0.64 的零时间特征值 \\(25.1515893341\\ldots\\)，但二十四个点不能证明其极限。": "The final ratio is close to the R0.64 zero-time eigenvalue \\(25.1515893341\\ldots\\), but twenty-four points cannot prove its limit.",
  "最终尺度为 \\(M_{24}=79228162514264337593543950336\\)。其严格区间蕴含": "The final scale is \\(M_{24}=79228162514264337593543950336\\). Its rigorous interval implies",
  "R0.64 只证明零时间完整状态超临界；R0.65 进一步证明，在真正的 Navier--Stokes 四次目标泛函上，保留高斯权和完整时间积分之后仍存在十个连续超临界块。这排除了“每个 \\(0100\\) 块都被热核压到 \\(16\\) 以下”的命题。": "R0.64 proved only that the complete zero-time state is supercritical. R0.65 further proves that ten consecutive supercritical blocks remain in the actual Navier--Stokes quartic target functional after retaining Gaussian weights and the complete time integral. This excludes the claim that the heat kernel pushes every \\(0100\\) block below \\(16\\).",
  "R0.65 热加权周期目标的变号和连续超临界块": "R0.65 sign change and consecutive supercritical blocks in the heat-weighted periodic target",
