  "\\(q_4\\) 的四个实根分别落在 \\((-208,-192)\\)、\\((48,64)\\)、\\((128,144)\\)、\\((400,416)\\)。对十次因子连续执行十次严格 Schur 变换，证明其全部复根满足 \\(|z|<300\\)。因此 \\(q_4\\) 在 \\((400,416)\\) 中的根 \\(\\mu\\) 是唯一主根，并且": "The four real roots of \\(q_4\\) lie in \\((-208,-192)\\), \\((48,64)\\), \\((128,144)\\), and \\((400,416)\\), respectively. Ten successive strict Schur transforms of the degree-ten factor prove that all its complex roots satisfy \\(|z|<300\\). Hence the root of \\(q_4\\) in \\((400,416)\\), namely \\(\\mu\\), is the unique dominant root, and",
