  "横向耦合精确地出现在 \\((w\\cdot\\nabla)U_r\\) 中": "The transverse coupling appears exactly in \\((w\\cdot\\nabla)U_r\\)",
  "精确主根区间给出 \\(\\rho<1\\)。": "The exact dominant-root interval gives \\(\\rho<1\\).",
