  "单向性": "One-way control",
  "定义中心固定的外部动能 Morrey 包络": "Define the centered exterior kinetic Morrey envelope",
  "对 \\(q_0=\\partial_i\\partial_j(\\eta_0u_i u_j)\\)，不可压条件给出精确展开": "For \\(q_0=\\partial_i\\partial_j(\\eta_0u_i u_j)\\), incompressibility gives the exact expansion",
  "附图同时保存可用的远场界与必须淘汰的近场假设": "The figure records both the useful far bound and the near-field hypothesis that must be rejected",
