  "近场缺口": "Near-field gap",
  "绝对值形式要求 \\(u|q|\\) 与 \\(u|\\nabla p|\\) 的额外可积性。": "The absolute-value form requires extra integrability of \\(u|q|\\) and \\(u|\\nabla p|\\).",
  "两次分部积分后的绝对值量比标准局部能量压力通量更强": "The absolute quantity after two integrations by parts is stronger than the standard local-energy pressure flux",
  "能量正则性只保证首项属于 \\(L^1_x\\)。而": "Energy regularity guarantees only that the leading term belongs to \\(L^1_x\\). Yet",
