  "当 \\(q\\) 从 \\(4\\) 增至 \\(6\\) 时，\\(\\sigma_v\\) 的幂从 \\(3\\) 严格增至 \\(4\\)。因此最佳端点是": "As \\(q\\) increases from \\(4\\) to \\(6\\), the power of \\(\\sigma_v\\) increases strictly from \\(3\\) to \\(4\\). Thus the best endpoint is",
