  "光滑时间轮廓可以逼近这个尖峰。该例只是否定纯函数空间控制的指数见证，不是 Navier–Stokes 解；它说明下一步必须使用方程的时间方向结构，不能只对当前估计再做一次 Hölder 插值。": "Smooth time profiles can approximate this spike. The example is only an exponent witness against purely function-space control, not a Navier–Stokes solution; it shows that the next step must use the equation's time-direction structure rather than another Hölder interpolation of the present estimate.",
  "交换子": "Commutator",
