  "第一行是本版本的主推进：可吸收二阶导数之后，只剩带尺度不变局部动能系数的二次涡量。第二行是显式低阶、过渡与远场代价。把 \\(\\mathsf F_v\\) 换回扩大球耗散时，还要加入上一节列出的截断项。": "The first line is the main advance in this version: after absorbing the second derivative, only quadratic enstrophy remains, with a scale-invariant local kinetic-energy coefficient. The second line contains explicit lower-order, transition, and far-field costs. Replacing \\(\\mathsf F_v\\) by enlarged-ball dissipation also requires the cutoff terms listed in the preceding section.",
  "对集中在波数 \\(k\\) 的 Fourier 波包，\\(\\|\\nabla v\\|_2\\asymp k\\|v\\|_2\\)、\\(\\|\\nabla^2v\\|_2\\asymp k^2\\|v\\|_2\\)，所以该插值在频率幂上不能改进。": "For a Fourier packet concentrated at wavenumber \\(k\\), \\(\\|\\nabla v\\|_2\\asymp k\\|v\\|_2\\) and \\(\\|\\nabla^2v\\|_2\\asymp k^2\\|v\\|_2\\), so this interpolation cannot be improved at the level of frequency powers.",
  "附图把尖锐代价、尖峰回测与剩余指数放在同一证据链中": "The figure places the sharp cost, spike replay, and remaining exponent in one evidence chain",
