  "过渡应力与远程壳层仍停留在二次时间预算内": "The transition stress and remote shells remain within a quadratic time budget",
  "合并并把 \\(2\\delta\\) 重命名为 \\(\\varepsilon\\)，即得主结果。二阶导数既作为被吸收项出现，又通过 Hilbert 插值降低余项的 \\(\\sigma\\) 次数；这正是纯时间不等式遗漏的信息。": "Combining the two inequalities and renaming \\(2\\delta\\) as \\(\\varepsilon\\) gives the main result. The second derivative appears both as the absorbed term and as the interpolation input that lowers the power of \\(\\sigma\\) in the remainder; this is precisely the information omitted by a time-only inequality.",
