  "尖峰回测": "Spike replay",
  "简写 \\(\\mu=\\mu_v\\)、\\(\\sigma=\\sigma_v\\)、\\(\\mathcal D=\\mathcal D_v\\)。第一次 Young 不等式给出": "Write \\(\\mu=\\mu_v\\), \\(\\sigma=\\sigma_v\\), and \\(\\mathcal D=\\mathcal D_v\\). The first Young inequality gives",
  "结合 \\(\\nabla^2(\\eta u)\\) 的乘积法则，得到": "Combining this with the product rule for \\(\\nabla^2(\\eta u)\\) gives",
  "截断环带 \\(A_\\phi\\subset B_r\\) 位于 \\(v=u\\) 的区域，因此 \\(D_A\\le\\mathcal D_v\\)。R0.69N 的领先压力项由下式控制：": "The cutoff annulus \\(A_\\phi\\subset B_r\\) lies where \\(v=u\\), so \\(D_A\\le\\mathcal D_v\\). The leading pressure term from R0.69N is therefore controlled by",
  "仅使用这条插值时，\\(\\mu^4\\varepsilon^{-3}\\) 是必要代价": "Using only this interpolation, the \\(\\mu^4\\varepsilon^{-3}\\) cost is necessary",
