  "可吸收二阶导数同时提供缺失的空间插值": "The absorbable second derivative also supplies the missing spatial interpolation",
  "两个低阶项成为有限动能幂，而不是新的临界耗散": "The two lower-order terms become finite powers of kinetic energy rather than new critical dissipation terms",
  "领先压力交换子的时间余项可以降回二次涡量": "The time remainder of the leading pressure commutator can be reduced to quadratic enstrophy",
  "令 \\(\\mathsf H=\\|e_{\\mathrm{tr}}+B_\\infty\\|_{L^\\infty_\\tau(I)}\\)，Cauchy 与 Young 给出": "Let \\(\\mathsf H=\\|e_{\\mathrm{tr}}+B_\\infty\\|_{L^\\infty_\\tau(I)}\\). Cauchy and Young give",
  "令插值取等并参数化为": "Saturate the interpolation and parameterize it by",
  "其极大点与极大值分别为": "Its maximizer and maximum are",
  "若把 Hilbert 插值直接代入，\\(\\mathcal D\\) 的幂反而超过一，不能吸收。因此 R0.69P 不再继续优化压力，而是比较三个可能真正降低拉伸项的结构：应变特征架的有符号代数、涡量方向相干性、以及时空交换子。接受标准是不预设已有 Serrin 或几何正则性判据，却把六次余项降到可由能量层级控制的量；失败则形成明确的无增益命题。": "Direct substitution of the Hilbert interpolation instead makes the power of \\(\\mathcal D\\) exceed one, so it cannot be absorbed. R0.69P therefore stops optimizing pressure and compares three structures that could genuinely reduce the stretching term: signed algebra in the strain eigenframe, vorticity-direction coherence, and a space-time commutator. Acceptance requires lowering the sextic remainder to an energy-level quantity without presupposing a known Serrin or geometric regularity criterion; failure will produce a precise no-gain statement.",
  "若希望右端为 \\(\\varepsilon\\mathcal D+C_\\varepsilon\\mu^\\alpha\\sigma^2\\)，除以 \\(\\mu^2z^2\\) 后必须控制": "If the desired right side is \\(\\varepsilon\\mathcal D+C_\\varepsilon\\mu^\\alpha\\sigma^2\\), division by \\(\\mu^2z^2\\) requires control of",
  "声明边界：本页证明压力交换子的耗散辅助时间指数降阶、该代数机制的尖锐 \\(\\mu^4\\varepsilon^{-3}\\) 代价、旧尖峰的耗散回测与剩余的六次拉伸障碍。它没有构造 Navier–Stokes 奇性解，不给出全局正则性或奇性结论，也没有解决千禧年问题。": "Claim boundary: this page proves the dissipation-assisted time-exponent reduction for the pressure commutator, the sharp \\(\\mu^4\\varepsilon^{-3}\\) cost within this algebraic mechanism, the dissipation replay of the old spike, and the remaining sextic stretching obstruction. It does not construct a Navier–Stokes singular solution, gives no global regularity or singularity conclusion, and does not solve the Millennium Problem.",
  "时间积分后得到": "Time integration gives",
  "时间积分后的压力预算已不再含三次涡量余项": "The time-integrated pressure budget no longer contains a cubic enstrophy remainder",
  "使用 \\(\\sigma\\le C\\mu^{1/2}\\mathcal D^{1/4}\\)，R0.69N 的其余近场项满足": "Using \\(\\sigma\\le C\\mu^{1/2}\\mathcal D^{1/4}\\), the remaining near-field terms from R0.69N satisfy",
  "数学源、形式证书与期刊图分别锁定到完整提交": "The mathematical source, formal certificate, and journal figure are locked to separate full commits",
  "它确实满足": "It indeed satisfies",
  "它仍不是千禧年问题的解答。首先，适当弱解本身没有先验的 \\(L^2_{t,x}\\) 二阶导数，完整证明必须从光滑逼近或强解区间建立可统一传递的局部 \\(H^1\\) 估计。其次，即使压力项完全处理，三维非线性仍含真正的拉伸机制。": "This is still not a solution of the Millennium Problem. First, a suitable weak solution has no a priori \\(L^2_{t,x}\\) second derivative; a complete proof must establish a uniformly transferable localized \\(H^1\\) estimate from smooth approximations or strong-solution intervals. Second, even after pressure is fully handled, the three-dimensional nonlinearity still contains the genuine stretching mechanism.",
  "它仍然否定只从 \\(\\int\\sigma^2\\) 出发的纯时间闭合，却不能否定允许吸收二阶耗散的估计。": "It still rules out time-only closure from \\(\\int\\sigma^2\\), but it does not rule out an estimate that permits second-derivative absorption.",
  "图 R0.69O。左图给出 Hilbert 插值取等后的普适 Young 优化曲线，极大值精确为 \\(27\\mu^4/(256\\varepsilon^3)\\)；中图显示旧尖峰的二次质量保持为一、三次代价按 \\(A\\) 增长，但所需二阶耗散质量按 \\(A^2\\) 增长；右图对比压力余项的 \\(\\sigma^2\\) 与拉伸余项的 \\(\\sigma^6\\)。线型、标记、纹理与数值标签保证灰度可辨。": "Figure R0.69O. The left panel gives the universal Young-optimization curve after saturating the Hilbert interpolation, with exact maximum \\(27\\mu^4/(256\\varepsilon^3)\\). The middle panel shows that the old spike keeps its quadratic mass equal to one and makes its cubic cost grow like \\(A\\), while the required second-derivative dissipation mass grows like \\(A^2\\). The right panel compares the \\(\\sigma^2\\) pressure remainder with the \\(\\sigma^6\\) stretching remainder. Line styles, markers, hatches, and value labels remain distinguishable in grayscale.",
  "吸收": "Absorption",
  "压力不再是当前估计链的主瓶颈，但核心三维困难没有消失": "Pressure is no longer the main bottleneck in the current estimate chain, but the core three-dimensional difficulty remains",
  "压力交换子的三次时间代价可被二阶耗散修复；完整正则性仍卡在产生六次余项的三维拉伸非线性。": "Second-derivative dissipation repairs the cubic time cost of the pressure commutator; full regularity still stops at the three-dimensional stretching nonlinearity that produces a sextic remainder.",
  "压力时间幂修复，拉伸仍开放": "Pressure time power repaired; stretching remains open",
