  "压力预算": "Pressure budget",
  "沿用 R0.69N 的紧支撑无散局部化 \\(v\\)，定义": "Using the compactly supported solenoidal localization \\(v\\) from R0.69N, define",
  "研究笔记 R0.69O · 压力交换子的耗散辅助时间闭合": "Research note R0.69O · Dissipation-assisted time closure of the pressure commutator",
  "研究笔记 R0.69O：利用可吸收二阶耗散与 Hilbert 插值，把领先压力交换子的时间余项降回二次涡量，并定位剩余的涡量拉伸障碍。": "Research note R0.69O: using absorbable second-derivative dissipation and Hilbert interpolation to reduce the leading pressure-commutator time remainder to quadratic enstrophy and locate the remaining vortex-stretching obstruction.",
  "因此在这个纯代数机制内必须有 \\(\\alpha\\ge4\\)，临界情形的 \\(\\varepsilon^{-3}\\) 也不能降低。这里的尖锐性不声称真实 Navier–Stokes 压力场同时饱和前面每一步。": "Therefore \\(\\alpha\\ge4\\) is necessary within this purely algebraic mechanism, and at the critical value the \\(\\varepsilon^{-3}\\) dependence cannot be reduced. This sharpness statement does not assert that an actual Navier–Stokes pressure field simultaneously saturates every preceding estimate.",
  "由于 \\(v\\) 紧支撑，分部积分与 Cauchy–Schwarz 给出": "Because \\(v\\) has compact support, integration by parts and Cauchy–Schwarz give",
  "远场": "Far field",
  "在单位归一化时间区间，它们分别只贡献 \\(\\mathsf A_v^{7/3}\\) 与 \\(\\mathsf A_v^{9/5}\\)。这些是 Caccioppoli 型截断代价，不会重新引入三次涡量时间积分。": "On a unit normalized time interval, these contribute only \\(\\mathsf A_v^{7/3}\\) and \\(\\mathsf A_v^{9/5}\\), respectively. They are Caccioppoli-type cutoff costs and do not reintroduce a cubic enstrophy time integral.",
  "在长度为一的归一化时间区间 \\(I\\) 上，令": "On a normalized time interval \\(I\\) of length one, set",
  "这是可用于后续局部高阶估计的压力引理，也是对 R0.69N 时间障碍的严格修正；它把研究资源从压力重新集中到三维涡量拉伸。它不是正则性定理。": "This is a pressure lemma available for subsequent localized higher-order estimates and a rigorous correction of the temporal obstruction in R0.69N; it redirects attention from pressure to three-dimensional vortex stretching. It is not a regularity theorem.",
  "这条估计修复了领先压力交换子的时间指数。它尚未推导完整的局部 \\(H^1\\) 不等式，也没有推出全局正则性、奇性或千禧年问题的结论。": "This estimate repairs the time exponent of the leading pressure commutator. It has not yet derived the complete localized \\(H^1\\) inequality and gives no global regularity, singularity, or Millennium Problem conclusion.",
  "这一步的价值是排除一个真实的技术疑点：R0.69N 的 \\(\\mu_v\\sigma_v^3\\) 不是压力机制不可避免的超二次时间代价。把空间插值与可吸收耗散联用后，压力项与 CKN 二次时间量兼容。": "The value of this step is that it removes a genuine technical uncertainty: the \\(\\mu_v\\sigma_v^3\\) term in R0.69N is not an unavoidable superquadratic time cost of the pressure mechanism. Combining spatial interpolation with absorbable dissipation makes the pressure term compatible with quadratic CKN time quantities.",
  "这只进行一次半径扩大，但后续完整局部估计仍必须执行半径迭代并追踪局部化产生的全部方程；本页没有省略这一接口。": "This enlarges the radius only once, but the later complete local estimate must still perform the radius iteration and track every equation produced by localization; this page does not suppress that interface.",
