  "R0.69N 留下的 \\(\\mu_v\\sigma_v^3\\) 并非最终时间指数。我把同一个可吸收二阶导数量再次用于 Hilbert 插值，得到 \\(\\varepsilon\\mathcal D_v+C\\varepsilon^{-3}\\mu_v^4\\sigma_v^2\\)。因此领先压力余项回到二次涡量时间积分；旧尖峰因必须支付 \\(A^2\\) 的二阶耗散而失效。这个修复不等于完整正则性闭合：三维应变或涡量拉伸仍产生 \\(\\sigma^6\\)。": "The \\(\\mu_v\\sigma_v^3\\) term left by R0.69N is not the final time exponent. I reuse the same absorbable second-derivative quantity in the Hilbert interpolation to obtain \\(\\varepsilon\\mathcal D_v+C\\varepsilon^{-3}\\mu_v^4\\sigma_v^2\\). The leading pressure remainder therefore returns to a quadratic enstrophy time integral, and the old spike fails because it must pay \\(A^2\\) in second-derivative dissipation. This repair is not full regularity closure: three-dimensional strain or vortex stretching still produces \\(\\sigma^6\\).",
