  "常数 \\(\\sqrt{2/3}\\) 不能降低。更强的是：对任意 \\(s,w>0\\)，存在光滑、紧支撑、散度为零的速度场，在一个开球上同时满足": "The constant \\(\\sqrt{2/3}\\) cannot be reduced. More strongly, for every \\(s,w>0\\), there is a smooth, compactly supported, divergence-free velocity field satisfying the following identities on an open ball:",
