  "设 \\(\\lambda_1\\le\\lambda_2\\le\\lambda_3\\) 且 \\(\\lambda_1+\\lambda_2+\\lambda_3=0\\)。Rayleigh 商与无迹条件给出": "Let \\(\\lambda_1\\le\\lambda_2\\le\\lambda_3\\) and \\(\\lambda_1+\\lambda_2+\\lambda_3=0\\). The Rayleigh quotient and the trace-free condition give",
  "声明边界：本页证明点态拉伸常数与中间特征值界的尖锐性、紧支撑无散局部实现、Betchov 重写以及能量层级六次余项的持续存在。它没有推出无条件方向相干、时空耗散、全局正则性或奇性，也没有解决千禧年问题。": "Claim boundary: this page proves the sharpness of the pointwise stretching constant and middle-eigenvalue bound, the compactly supported local solenoidal realization, the Betchov reformulation, and the persistence of the sextic energy-level remainder. It proves no unconditional direction coherence, spacetime depletion, global regularity, or singularity, and it does not solve the Millennium Problem.",
  "图 R0.69P。左图给出轴对称伸长应变中的精确角度曲线，正端点 \\(\\sqrt{2/3}\\) 可在小球内实现；中图显示 \\((-4\\det S)/(\\lambda_2|S|^2)\\) 单调逼近尖锐上确界二；右图给出能量层级 Young 优化，极大余项为 \\(27\\varepsilon^{-3}\\sigma^6/256\\)。颜色、纹理、线型与端点标记保证灰度可辨。": "Figure R0.69P. The left panel gives the exact angular curve for axisymmetric extensional strain, with the positive endpoint \\(\\sqrt{2/3}\\) realizable on a ball. The middle panel shows \\((-4\\det S)/(\\lambda_2|S|^2)\\) increasing to the sharp supremum two. The right panel gives the energy-level Young optimization, whose maximal remainder is \\(27\\varepsilon^{-3}\\sigma^6/256\\). Color, hatching, line styles, and endpoint markers preserve grayscale legibility.",
  "下一步从 \\(\\xi=\\omega/|\\omega|\\) 的运输—扩散方程与 \\(\\lambda_2^+\\) 集合的局部预算出发，逐项检查旋转、扩散与压力 Hessian 是否能在 \\(Q_r\\) 内产生可积时间幂或真实小尺度因子。": "The next step begins with the transport-diffusion equation for \\(\\xi=\\omega/|\\omega|\\) and a local budget for the set where \\(\\lambda_2^+\\) is positive. I will test rotation, diffusion, and the pressure Hessian term by term for an integrable time power or a genuine small-scale factor in \\(Q_r\\).",
  "下一条有意义的估计必须控制时空亏损，而不是再做矩阵代数": "The next meaningful estimate must control a spacetime deficit, not repeat matrix algebra",
  "限制同样明确：这些结论是运动学与能量代数，不包含 Navier–Stokes 演化对相干结构的动态约束。六次余项仍远超 Leray–Hopf 或 CKN 的先验时间可积性。": "The limitation is equally clear: these are kinematic and energy-algebraic conclusions, not dynamical constraints imposed by Navier–Stokes evolution on coherent structure. The sextic remainder remains far beyond the a priori time integrability of Leray–Hopf or CKN theory.",
  "相应的涡量与应变能量恒等式为": "The corresponding vorticity and strain energy identities are",
  "新靶点": "New target",
  "形式检查：20 / 20 通过": "Formal checks: 20 / 20 passed",
  "研究笔记 R0.69P · 涡量拉伸的尖锐符号结构": "Research note R0.69P · sharp sign structure of vortex stretching",
  "研究笔记 R0.69P：求出涡量拉伸与中间应变特征值的尖锐常数，构造局部饱和的紧支撑无散场，并证明仅靠能量信息仍留下六次余项。": "Research note R0.69P: derive the sharp constants for vortex stretching and the middle strain eigenvalue, construct a compactly supported solenoidal field that locally saturates them, and prove that energy information alone still leaves a sextic remainder.",
  "也为尖锐等式，其见证是 \\(S=|S|\\operatorname{diag}(-2,1,1)/\\sqrt6\\)，并可由上一节的紧支撑构造在小球内实现。正的中间特征值因此不是不可压性自动压低的量。": "is also sharp, witnessed by \\(S=|S|\\operatorname{diag}(-2,1,1)/\\sqrt6\\), and the compactly supported construction from the preceding section realizes it on a ball. Positive middle strain is therefore not automatically reduced by incompressibility.",
  "因此 R0.69O 与本版本把预算分开了：压力余项是 \\(\\mathsf A_v^2\\mathsf E_v\\) 的二次时间量，拉伸余项仍是 \\(\\int\\sigma^6dt\\)。": "R0.69O and this release therefore separate the budget: the pressure remainder is the quadratic time quantity \\(\\mathsf A_v^2\\mathsf E_v\\), while the stretching remainder remains \\(\\int\\sigma^6dt\\).",
  "由中间特征值界只能得到": "The middle-eigenvalue bound gives only",
  "源笔记、形式证书和期刊图分别锁定到完整提交": "The source note, formal certificate, and journal figure are locked to separate full commits",
  "则 \\(v_A\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^3)\\)、\\(\\nabla\\cdot v_A=0\\)，并在整个 \\(B_1\\) 内等于 \\(Ax\\)。所以尖锐矩阵对不是不可实现的局部喷射；它确实存在于光滑有限能量无散场的一个开集上。外部截断环带承担全局积分恒等式要求的补偿。": "Then \\(v_A\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^3)\\), \\(\\nabla\\cdot v_A=0\\), and throughout \\(B_1\\) the field equals \\(Ax\\). Thus the sharp matrix pair is not an unrealizable local jet; it occurs on an open set in a smooth finite-energy solenoidal field. The outer cutoff annulus supplies the compensation required by global integral identities.",
  "这里关闭的是“不可压性自动改善点态拉伸几何”这条路线。它不排除 Navier–Stokes 动力学在时空平均、非局部耦合或条件几何假设下产生耗散，也没有解决千禧年问题。": "This closes the route claiming that incompressibility automatically improves pointwise stretching geometry. It does not exclude depletion generated by Navier–Stokes dynamics through spacetime averaging, nonlocal coupling, or conditional geometric assumptions, and it does not solve the Millennium Problem.",
  "这是高质量的无增益定理和路线筛选结果，而不构成全局正则性结论。它减少了模糊搜索空间，并把下一阶段的成功标准明确为无条件、尺度临界的时空亏损。": "This is a rigorous no-gain theorem and a route-screening result, not a regularity theorem. It reduces an ambiguous search space and defines the next success criterion as an unconditional, scale-critical spacetime deficit.",
  "正产生只来自正的中间应变特征值": "Positive production comes only from a positive middle strain eigenvalue",
  "证书运行：0.42 秒": "Certificate run: 0.42 seconds",
  "中的常数二是尖锐上确界。另一方面，": "has sharp supremum two. On the other hand,",
  "中间特征值": "Middle eigenvalue",
