  "仍开放：": "Still open:",
  "它没有把一般奇性问题变成结论。下一项有信息量的门槛，是判断 growing-dimensional roots 或更强 coupling 能否在支付 exact operator norm 和完整 slope energy 后改变这个边界。": "It does not turn the general singularity problem into a conclusion. The next informative threshold is whether growing-dimensional roots or stronger coupling can change this boundary after paying the exact operator norm and complete slope energy.",
  "图 R0.71X-1。有限 retained-coset 数据显示 \\(D\\) 约为 \\(q^6\\)、complete two-root atomProxy 约为 \\(q^2\\)；独立高精度 ledger 显示 atomProxy 除以 \\(D^{1/3}\\) 的平台与 \\(\\delta^{4/3}\\) collapse。atomProxy 不是 \\(J_*\\)，\\(\\delta=1/128\\) 不是已认证的 continuum IFT 半径，图只作可复现 corroboration。": "Figure R0.71X-1. Finite retained-coset data show \\(D\\) scaling approximately as \\(q^6\\) and the complete two-root atomProxy approximately as \\(q^2\\); an independent high-precision ledger shows the plateau of atomProxy divided by \\(D^{1/3}\\) and its \\(\\delta^{4/3}\\) collapse. atomProxy is not \\(J_*\\), \\(\\delta=1/128\\) is not a certified continuum IFT radius, and the figure is reproducible corroboration only.",
  "图和 retained-coset JSON 中的": "In the figure and retained-coset JSON,",
  "完整 prescribed-root atom sum 达到 D^(1/3) Lambda1 尺度；根完备性由 ECT、紧区间 C1 分离和半直线积分因子证明。": "The complete prescribed-root atom sum reaches the D^(1/3) Lambda1 scale; root completeness is proved by ECT, compact-interval C1 separation, and a half-line integrating factor.",
  "文献中的三分之一次方、空间迹和时间解析性没有直接给出本节账本": "The one-third powers, spatial traces, and time analyticity in the literature do not directly provide the ledger in this section",
  "物理振幅是 \\(q^2\\) 阶，小量仍是固定的 rescaled coupling": "The physical amplitude is of order \\(q^2\\), while the small quantity remains the fixed rescaled coupling",
  "下一对象：growing-dimensional ECT / IFT": "Next object: growing-dimensional ECT / IFT",
  "下一节先量化随 \\(N\\) 增长的 exponential-Chebyshev inverse、coefficient curve 与 IFT 半径，再把 weighted slope-energy 和 full charge observability 放进同一账本。只有这些量同时闭合，\\(\\varepsilon_N^{4/3}\\mathcal Q_N\\) 才能被解释。": "The next section first quantifies the exponential-Chebyshev inverse, coefficient curve, and IFT radius as \\(N\\) grows, and then places weighted slope-energy and full-charge observability in the same ledger. Only if all of these quantities close together can \\(\\varepsilon_N^{4/3}\\mathcal Q_N\\) be interpreted.",
  "研究笔记 R0.71X · FIXED SMALL COUPLING · ONE-THIRD ENDPOINT": "Research note R0.71X · FIXED SMALL COUPLING · ONE-THIRD ENDPOINT",
  "研究笔记 R0.71X：固定充分小耦合的 exact triangular 2.5D 家族在完整实时间根集上达到 D 的三分之一次方尺度；这是族内端点饱和，不是普适估计或正则性定理。": "Research note R0.71X: an exact triangular 2.5D family with fixed sufficiently small coupling reaches the one-third power of D over the complete real-time root set; this is family-internal endpoint saturation, not a universal estimate or regularity theorem.",
  "研究极端 enstrophy growth；": "study extreme enstrophy growth;",
  "隐含常数可以依赖固定的几何、黏性、观察区间与 \\(\\delta_*\\)，但不依赖声明范围内的 \\(q\\) 和 \\(\\delta\\)。": "The implicit constants may depend on the fixed geometry, viscosity, observation interval, and \\(\\delta_*\\), but not on \\(q\\) and \\(\\delta\\) within the declared range.",
  "在 \\(x=q^2(t-\\sigma_q)\\) 的 Fourier lattice 上，演化写成": "On the Fourier lattice with \\(x=q^2(t-\\sigma_q)\\), the evolution becomes",
  "这不是三维 Navier–Stokes 全局正则性问题的解答，也不是对全部 triangular solutions 的 \\(D^{1/3}\\) 上界。": "This is not a solution of the three-dimensional Navier–Stokes global-regularity problem, nor an upper bound by \\(D^{1/3}\\) for all triangular solutions.",
