  "90 位 Decimal producer 通过 13/13：包括 amplitude optimizer、multiplier bound、\\(N^{-1}\\) 与 \\(N^{-2}\\) envelopes、临界 \\(N^{3/4}\\) coupling、heat-weighted correction 和 equal-grid inverse lower bound。": "The 90-digit Decimal producer passes 13/13, covering the amplitude optimizer, multiplier bound, \\(N^{-1}\\) and \\(N^{-2}\\) envelopes, critical \\(N^{3/4}\\) coupling, the heat-weighted correction, and the equal-grid inverse lower bound.",
  "把 inverse Jacobian 与 Lipschitz data 放进 certified IFT radius；": "place the inverse Jacobian and Lipschitz data in the certified IFT radius;",
  "版本 v0.71Y · 2026-08-26": "Version v0.71Y · 2026-08-26",
  "本节检查 R0.71X 留下的 growing-dimensional 路线。对 \\(M=2N+1\\) 个单位模 carrier phases、实 shear、固定 target、完整数据与根时刻 enstrophy floors，exact triangular evolution 的 \\(\\ell^2\\) 收缩和根坐标恒等式给出 \\(\\mathcal J_N^{\\rm sel}/(D_N^{1/3}\\Lambda_1)\\le C\\nu^{-2}\\delta_{\\rm obs,N}^{4/3}/N\\)。所以 uniformly bounded observation coupling 不能保留预设根增益。这里控制的是 selected exact roots，不是全部 nonlinear roots。": "This section examines the growing-dimensional route left by R0.71X. For \\(M=2N+1\\) unit-modulus carrier phases, real shear, a fixed target, and full data and root-time enstrophy floors, the \\(\\ell^2\\) contraction and root-coordinate identity of the exact triangular evolution give \\(\\mathcal J_N^{\\rm sel}/(D_N^{1/3}\\Lambda_1)\\le C\\nu^{-2}\\delta_{\\rm obs,N}^{4/3}/N\\). Thus uniformly bounded observation coupling cannot preserve the prescribed-root gain. The result controls selected exact roots, not all nonlinear roots.",
  "并行检查 matched background 是否可以移除，或被 weak-solution / full-ledger quantity 自动替代。strong coupling、\\(A_0\\to0\\) 与不同 geometry 仍按独立接口处理。": "In parallel, test whether the matched background can be removed or replaced automatically by a weak-solution / full-ledger quantity. Strong coupling, \\(A_0\\to0\\), and different geometries remain separate interfaces.",
  "代价": "Cost",
  "定理使用实 shear、单位载波相位和完整增长成本": "The theorem uses real shear, unit carrier phases, and the full growing cost",
  "独立 NumPy/SciPy finite-matrix reconstruction 通过 12/12：skew defect 为零，semigroup contraction、root slope、multiplier、optimized envelope、separated bound、determinant factorization 与 inverse lower bound 全部通过。它们是 finite algebraic corroboration，不是 DNS，也不构造 growing exact-root family。": "The independent NumPy/SciPy finite-matrix reconstruction passes 12/12: zero skew defect, semigroup contraction, root slope, multiplier, optimized envelope, separated bound, determinant factorization, and inverse lower bound all pass. These are finite algebraic corroborations, not DNS, and they do not construct a growing exact-root family.",
  "额外根": "Additional roots",
  "非消失需要 \\(\\delta_{\\rm obs}\\gtrsim N^{3/4}\\)；一般 \\(R/M\\) 账本下，bounded-coupling escape 至少需要 \\(R\\gtrsim M^2\\)。": "Nonvanishing requires \\(\\delta_{\\rm obs}\\gtrsim N^{3/4}\\); under the general \\(R/M\\) ledger, bounded-coupling escape requires at least \\(R\\gtrsim M^2\\).",
  "附图只画 analytic bounds、证书 envelope 与 conditioning lower bound": "The figure shows only analytic bounds, certificate envelopes, and a conditioning lower bound",
  "给 exponential-sum sampling inequalities；": "give exponential-sum sampling inequalities;",
  "根间隔可以把 bound 从 \\(N^{-1}\\) 改善到 \\(1/(h_NN^2)\\)": "Root separation improves the bound from \\(N^{-1}\\) to \\(1/(h_NN^2)\\)",
  "观测耦合、Dyson exposure 与 IFT certificate 必须分开": "Observation coupling, Dyson exposure, and the IFT certificate must be kept separate",
  "互异正整数和单位相位强制": "Distinct positive integers and unit phases force",
  "假设存在与 \\(q,N,S,P,z\\) 无关的 \\(c_D,c_Y>0\\)，使 \\(D_N\\ge c_Dq^2E_N\\)，并在每个 counted root 有 \\(Y_N(t_{m,q})\\ge c_Yq^2E_N\\)。则": "Suppose, independently of \\(q,N,S,P,z\\), that constants \\(c_D,c_Y>0\\) satisfy \\(D_N\\ge c_Dq^2E_N\\), and each counted root satisfies \\(Y_N(t_{m,q})\\ge c_Yq^2E_N\\). Then",
  "间隔": "Separation",
  "结果关闭 uniformly small Dyson/IFT corridor 内的 selected prescribed-root 增益，也关闭 bounded coupling 下每个至多线性增长的 sampled-root 集。它不控制未知的全部 nonlinear roots。": "The result closes the selected prescribed-root gain inside the uniformly small Dyson/IFT corridor, and also every sampled-root family growing at most linearly under bounded coupling. It does not control the unknown set of all nonlinear roots.",
  "解析链和两个独立计算层已分别核对": "The analytic chain and two independent computational layers were checked separately",
