  "量化 moment-method 的时间与 gap 代价；": "quantify the time and gap costs in the moment method;",
  "令 \\(M=2N+1\\)，取互不相同的正整数 \\(r_1,\\ldots,r_M\\)，launch vector 的 \\(M\\) 个非零系数均为单位模。scaled active sector 满足": "Let \\(M=2N+1\\), choose pairwise distinct positive integers \\(r_1,\\ldots,r_M\\), and give each of the \\(M\\) nonzero launch-vector coefficients unit modulus. The scaled active sector satisfies",
  "没有统一的 unweighted \\(\\|z\\|_2\\) lower bound。R0.71X 的 fixed-dimensional endpoint theorem 没有使用这个错误比较，因此其定理不受影响。": "There is no uniform unweighted lower bound by \\(\\|z\\|_2\\). The fixed-dimensional endpoint theorem in R0.71X did not use this incorrect comparison, so that theorem is unaffected.",
  "设 \\(F_0(\\tau_m)=0\\)，并定义": "Suppose \\(F_0(\\tau_m)=0\\), and define",
  "设 \\(h_N\\) 是 scaled roots 与左边界之间的最小间隔，并令 \\(W_N^2=\\sum_l|z_l|^2e^{-2\\nu d^2r_l^2A_0}\\)。exact finite-\\(q\\) estimate 为": "Let \\(h_N\\) be the minimum separation between the scaled roots and the left boundary, and put \\(W_N^2=\\sum_l|z_l|^2e^{-2\\nu d^2r_l^2A_0}\\). The exact finite-\\(q\\) estimate is",
  "设定": "Setting",
