  "\\(Q\\) 只取 \\(F_{\\pm r_l}\\)，精确系数含 \\(-2\\nu d^2r_l^2\\mp2\\nu dr_lK_y/q\\)。一个 \\(r_l\\) 由 shear heat decay 支付，另一个由 \\(-\\langle D_qF,F\\rangle\\) 支付，得到": "\\(Q\\) uses only \\(F_{\\pm r_l}\\), with exact coefficients containing \\(-2\\nu d^2r_l^2\\mp2\\nu dr_lK_y/q\\). One factor of \\(r_l\\) is paid by shear heat decay and the other by \\(-\\langle D_qF,F\\rangle\\), giving",
  "\\(V_z'\\) 与 \\(V_z(D_q+\\lambda_0)\\) 必须合并后估计": "\\(V_z'\\) and \\(V_z(D_q+\\lambda_0)\\) must be estimated together",
