  "研究笔记 R0.72E：精确单载波三角形 NSE 家族在完整负 Sobolev 旋转电荷有界时，使 complete-root ledger 相对 D^{1/3}Λ₁ 以 R^{4/3} 发散。": "Research note R0.72E: an exact one-carrier triangular NSE family makes the complete-root ledger relative to D^{1/3}Λ₁ diverge as R^{4/3} while the complete negative-Sobolev rotational charge remains bounded.",
