  "05 · 带限数据的 N^{-1/2} 门槛": "05 · The N^{-1/2} gate for band-limited data",
  "06 · 混合范数与低高频尾部证书": "06 · Mixed norms and a low-/high-frequency tail certificate",
  "07 · 统一最终正则与延迟同步": "07 · Uniform eventual regularity and delayed synchronization",
