  "09 · 一手文献边界与研究价值": "09 · Primary-literature boundaries and research value",
  "10 · 解析附图与证据层级": "10 · Analytical figures and evidence levels",
  "11 · 可直接发布的中文短文": "11 · Publication-ready Chinese short article",
