  "\\(u_L\\) 与 \\(-u_L\\) 有完全相同的标量 \\(C\\)，并且": "\\(u_L\\) and \\(-u_L\\) have exactly the same scalar \\(C\\), and",
  "02 · 精确自相关演化": "02 · Exact autocorrelation evolution",
