  "把 (2.1) 乘以 \\(2w\\) 并积分。输运项因无散度而严格抵消，得到": "Multiply (2.1) by \\(2w\\) and integrate. The transport term cancels exactly by incompressibility, giving",
  "版本 R0.73T · 2026-08-31": "Version R0.73T · 2026-08-31",
  "保留下来的正结果是式 (1.2)：二次自相关确实能支付压力估计中的 六次矩。": "The retained positive result is (1.2): quadratic autocorrelation can indeed pay for the sixth moment in the pressure estimate.",
  "被排除的幻想是“只跟踪标量 \\(C\\) 就能自治”。载频与进入压力配对的 带符号速度相位都有精确反例；一般压力重建另需完整张量，则由 \\(p=R_iR_j(u_i u_j)\\) 直接给出，不能归功于符号对本身。": "The excluded hope is that tracking only the scalar \\(C\\) yields an autonomous system. Exact counterexamples exist for both the carrier frequency and the signed velocity phase entering the pressure pairing; the further need for the full tensor in general pressure reconstruction follows directly from \\(p=R_iR_j(u_i u_j)\\) and cannot be attributed to the sign pair itself.",
  "本地解析综合：式 (2.2)、(1.2)、逐壳 Duhamel 形式和 heat-plane 恒等式的同一归一化重建。": "Local analytic synthesis: a consistently normalized reconstruction of (2.2), (1.2), the shellwise Duhamel form, and the heat-plane identity.",
  "本节保留四层证据。": "This section retains four layers of evidence.",
  "标量定理逐分量应用即可得到这里的向量结论。结合 R0.73S，得到": "Applying the scalar theorem componentwise gives the vector conclusion used here. Combined with R0.73S, this yields",
  "不等式是经典压力估计、": "The inequality follows from the classical pressure estimate,",
  "不用 Fourier 支撑可以退回一个分辨率一致的局部估计": "Without Fourier support, one can fall back to a resolution-consistent local estimate",
  "但控制 \\(A\\) 的导数不会关闭问题。其上 Dini 导数引入 \\(|\\nabla u|^2\\) 的 Wiener 范数和带一阶导数的三次压力通量，严格强于 \\((A,Q,\\|u\\|_2)\\) 所含信息。": "But differentiating the quantity controlling \\(A\\) does not close the problem. Its upper Dini derivative introduces the Wiener norm of \\(|\\nabla u|^2\\) and a cubic pressure flux with one derivative, strictly more information than is contained in \\((A,Q,\\|u\\|_2)\\).",
  "得到能量密度方程": "This gives the energy-density equation",
  "第二个见证针对进入压力配对的带符号速度相位。取": "The second witness targets the signed velocity phase entering the pressure pairing. Take",
  "第二条边界是，完整的标量自相关也不是自治变量。式 (2.2) 仍需要 带符号向量通量 \\(u(w+2p)\\)，而标量 \\(C\\) 不保留其中的速度相位； 另一方面，一般的压力重建还需要完整张量 \\(\\widehat{u_i u_j}\\)，而 \\(C\\) 只给出它的迹。这是两个不同的信息 缺口。": "The second boundary is that even the complete scalar autocorrelation is not an autonomous variable. Equation (2.2) still requires the signed vector flux \\(u(w+2p)\\), while the scalar \\(C\\) does not retain the velocity phase in that flux. Separately, general pressure reconstruction requires the full tensor \\(\\widehat{u_i u_j}\\), whereas \\(C\\) supplies only its trace. These are two distinct information gaps.",
  "第一条边界是，式 (1.2) 仍需要 \\(\\int A(t)dt\\)。这个积分在 Navier--Stokes 缩放下临界，而且": "The first boundary is that (1.2) still requires \\(\\int A(t)dt\\). This integral is critical under Navier--Stokes scaling, and",
  "第一条重新引入正在输运的全场 \\(L_x^4\\) 强量；它对应的 Serrin 临界时空预算是 \\(u\\in L_t^8L_x^4\\)，等价于 \\(\\|u\\|_4^2\\in L_t^4\\)。第二条虽然只用能量，却在高频超临界。这就是 逐壳入口目前尚未闭合的精确位置。": "The first option reintroduces the strong full-field quantity \\(L_x^4\\) being transported; its Serrin-critical spacetime budget is \\(u\\in L_t^8L_x^4\\), equivalently \\(\\|u\\|_4^2\\in L_t^4\\). The second uses only energy but is supercritical at high frequency. This is the exact point at which the shellwise entry remains unclosed.",
  "第一族已经在线性热流中出现：": "The first family already appears in the linear heat flow:",
  "动态": "Dynamic",
  "对 \\(v_s=e^{s\\Delta}u\\)，还有二维 heat-plane 恒等式": "For \\(v_s=e^{s\\Delta}u\\), there is also the two-dimensional heat-plane identity",
  "而精确解 \\(e^{-\\nu N^2t}v_N\\) 给出": "while the exact solution \\(e^{-\\nu N^2t}v_N\\) gives",
  "附图只展示解析公式与有限精确复算，并且所有有限数据都在": "The figure displays only analytic formulas and finite exact recomputations, and all finite data are in",
  "后者正是经典 Prodi--Serrin 缩放线上“时间指数 \\(2\\)、空间指数 \\(\\infty\\)”的端点，而不是较微妙的 \\(L_t^\\infty L_x^3\\) 端点。因此本节的正结果应这样评价：它把静态 证书接到了动力学，但把真正的难点原样暴露为一个经典强度的临界积分。": "The latter is precisely the endpoint with time exponent \\(2\\) and space exponent \\(\\infty\\) on the classical Prodi--Serrin scaling line, not the subtler \\(L_t^\\infty L_x^3\\) endpoint. The positive result in this section should therefore be assessed as follows: it connects the static certificate to the dynamics, but exposes the real difficulty unchanged as a critical integral of classical strength.",
  "经典输入：Serrin 的时空正则性门槛、Kato 的 \\(L^p\\) 耗散结构、 周期 Riesz 估计，以及 Li、Li--Sire 的频率局部化 Bernstein 理论。": "Classical inputs: Serrin's spacetime regularity threshold, Kato's \\(L^p\\) dissipation structure, periodic Riesz estimates, and the frequency-localized Bernstein theory of Li and Li--Sire.",
