  "令 \\(u_L(x)=u(Lx)\\)。式 (5.3) 四个量保持不变，所有速度模态仍在 \\([L,\\sqrt2L]\\) 固定宽比环带中，而": "Let \\(u_L(x)=u(Lx)\\). The four quantities in (5.3) remain unchanged, and all velocity modes still lie in a fixed-ratio annulus \\([L,\\sqrt2L]\\), while",
  "平衡和自相关证书的本地综合，不是新的正则性判据。完整标量自相关仍非自治；下一对象是带尺度张量相关与可控带符号通量。NOT CLAY。": "A local synthesis of the balance and autocorrelation certificates, not a new regularity criterion. The complete scalar autocorrelation remains non-autonomous; the next object is scale-aware tensor correlation together with a controllable signed flux. NOT CLAY.",
  "评价。它不是 Navier--Stokes 仿真、奇性或爆破解。": "Assessment. This is not a Navier--Stokes simulation, a singularity, or a blow-up solution.",
  "剩余强迫只有两个朴素选择：": "Only two elementary choices remain for the forcing:",
  "所以 \\(A\\in L_t^1\\) 至少具有经典端点条件 \\(u\\in L_t^2L_x^\\infty\\) 的强度，并且直接蕴含该条件。它没有绕开 Serrin 门槛。": "Thus \\(A\\in L_t^1\\) is at least as strong as the classical endpoint condition \\(u\\in L_t^2L_x^\\infty\\), and directly implies it. It does not bypass the Serrin threshold.",
  "所以缺失的 \\(\\int A\\) 不是低阶余量，而是临界预算。又因为 \\(\\||u|^2\\|_\\infty\\le\\sum_h|C(h)|\\)，": "Hence the missing \\(\\int A\\) is not a lower-order remainder but a critical budget. Moreover, since \\(\\||u|^2\\|_\\infty\\le\\sum_h|C(h)|\\),",
  "所以完整无权自相关丢失载频。": "Thus the complete unweighted autocorrelation loses the carrier frequency.",
  "它的比较 ODE 本身可以有限时爆破，所以只给局部控制，不给全局正则性。": "Its comparison ODE can itself blow up in finite time, so it provides only local control, not global regularity.",
