  "下，": "under,",
  "限定式碰撞检索没有发现与“标量能量密度自相关 \\(A Q\\) + 两个精确 非自治见证”完全相同的打包，但有限检索不是新颖性或优先权证明。本站 只把它称为可审计的本地综合。": "A targeted collision search found no packaging identical to “scalar energy-density autocorrelation \\(A Q\\) + two exact non-autonomy witnesses,” but a finite search is not proof of novelty or priority. This site describes the result only as an auditable local synthesis.",
  "项检查，数据账本共有 28 行。": "checks; the data ledger contains 28 rows.",
  "项检查。配套正式附图通过": "checks. The accompanying formal figure passed",
  "研究笔记 R0.73T · DYNAMIC AUTOCORRELATION / PRESSURE-TENSOR BARRIER": "RESEARCH NOTE R0.73T · DYNAMIC AUTOCORRELATION / PRESSURE-TENSOR BARRIER",
  "研究笔记 R0.73T：能量密度自相关的精确演化、一侧动态 AQ 估计、载频与带符号速度相位的非自治见证，以及压力张量障碍。": "Research Note R0.73T: exact evolution of the energy-density autocorrelation, a one-sided dynamic AQ estimate, non-autonomy witnesses for carrier frequency and signed velocity phase, and the pressure-tensor barrier.",
  "研究价值与下一步": "Research value and next step",
  "一侧动态估计": "One-sided dynamic estimate",
  "以及": "and",
  "以及固定环境差集分支": "and the fixed ambient difference-set branch",
  "因此式 (5.5) 的变号只来自 \\(p\\,u\\cdot\\nabla|u|^2\\) 中带符号的 速度因子。这个证书隔离的是标量 \\(C\\) 丢失的速度相位；由于这对场的 张量和压力完全相同，它本身不构成“压力张量极化不可辨识”的证明。 一般压力重建需要 \\(\\widehat{u_i u_j}\\) 的事实来自 \\(p=R_iR_j(u_i u_j)\\)，必须与该符号对证书分开陈述。它们的共同粘性 项按 \\(-16536\\nu L^2\\) 衰减，因此绝不与一侧上界矛盾。": "Therefore the sign change in (5.5) comes only from the signed velocity factor in \\(p\\,u\\cdot\\nabla|u|^2\\). This certificate isolates the velocity phase lost by the scalar \\(C\\). Because the two fields have exactly the same tensor and pressure, the pair itself is not a proof of “pressure-tensor polarization non-identifiability.” The fact that general pressure reconstruction requires \\(\\widehat{u_i u_j}\\) follows from \\(p=R_iR_j(u_i u_j)\\) and must be stated separately from the sign-pair certificate. Their common viscous term decays as \\(-16536\\nu L^2\\), so there is no contradiction with the one-sided upper bound.",
  "由": "By",
  "再代入 R0.73S 的 \\(\\|u\\|_6^6\\le A Q\\)，就得到式 (1.2)。若 \\(A\\in L^1(0,T)\\)，Gronwall 给出": "Substituting the R0.73S estimate \\(\\|u\\|_6^6\\le A Q\\) then gives (1.2). If \\(A\\in L^1(0,T)\\), Gronwall gives",
  "在标准缩放": "Under the standard scaling",
  "在这条新引理出现之前，任意三维初值的全局光滑性与 Clay 千禧年问题 保持 OPEN。": "Before this new lemma, global smoothness for arbitrary three-dimensional initial data and the Clay Millennium Problem remain OPEN.",
  "这里 \\(A_j\\le\\overline D_j^{1/2}Q_j^{1/2}\\)。固定的 \\(\\overline D_j\\) 很重要：若 \\(v_j=0\\)，则瞬时自相关支撑为空，但 \\(D^+\\|v_j\\|_4\\) 仍可能由壳外强迫产生；此时 \\(\\|\\mathcal F_j\\|_4\\le\\overline D_j^{1/4}F_j\\) 使式 (6.4) 仍然成立。 这两条都有显式 Duhamel 形式，且固定因子 \\(\\overline D_j^{1/4}\\) 可以安全地放在时间积分外。": "Here \\(A_j\\le\\overline D_j^{1/2}Q_j^{1/2}\\). The fixed \\(\\overline D_j\\) is important: if \\(v_j=0\\), the instantaneous autocorrelation support is empty, but \\(D^+\\|v_j\\|_4\\) can still be generated by forcing from outside the shell. In that case, \\(\\|\\mathcal F_j\\|_4\\le\\overline D_j^{1/4}F_j\\) keeps (6.4) valid. Both estimates have explicit Duhamel forms, and the fixed factor \\(\\overline D_j^{1/4}\\) can safely remain outside the time integral.",
  "这两个见证都是光滑三角多项式。它们不是奇性、近奇性或爆破解。": "Both witnesses are smooth trigonometric polynomials. They are not singularities, near-singularities, or blow-up solutions.",
  "这是经典 \\(L^4\\) 平衡的自相关重建，不是新的 \\(L^p\\) 能量定理。": "This is an autocorrelation reconstruction of the classical \\(L^4\\) balance, not a new \\(L^p\\) energy theorem.",
  "这是真正的动态化：R0.73S 的二次自相关证书已经出现在一个正确的 \\(L^4\\) 微分不等式里。": "This is the genuine dynamical step: the quadratic autocorrelation certificate from R0.73S now appears in a correct \\(L^4\\) differential inequality.",
  "这条式子已经说明标量 \\(C\\) 为什么不闭合。粘性部分除了 \\(-\\nu|h|^2C(h)\\)，还需要带绝对频率权重的梯度相关；非线性部分还 需要 \\(u(w+2p)\\)。即使给定 \\(p\\)，\\(C\\) 也不能恢复其中带符号的 速度因子；同时 \\(p=R_iR_j(u_i u_j)\\) 的一般重建另需完整张量，而 \\(C=\\widehat{|u|^2}\\) 只记录其迹。": "This formula already shows why the scalar \\(C\\) does not close. Besides \\(-\\nu|h|^2C(h)\\), the viscous part requires a gradient correlation weighted by absolute frequency; the nonlinear part also requires \\(u(w+2p)\\). Even with \\(p\\) given, \\(C\\) cannot recover the signed velocity factor in that flux. At the same time, general reconstruction through \\(p=R_iR_j(u_i u_j)\\) separately requires the full tensor, whereas \\(C=\\widehat{|u|^2}\\) records only its trace.",
  "这一节的价值不在于把 Clay 问题向“已解决”推进了多少百分比，而在于 把一条看似可闭合的路线分解得足够精确。": "The value of this section is not a percentage by which the Clay problem has moved toward “solved,” but the precision with which a seemingly closable route has been decomposed.",
  "真正的下一对象不再是更多标量摘要，而是带尺度的张量相关 \\(T_{ij}(h)=\\widehat{u_i u_j}(h)\\)，再配合能被耗散吸收的带符号 heat commutator 或壳通量估计。": "The next genuine object is not another scalar summary but the scale-aware tensor correlation \\(T_{ij}(h)=\\widehat{u_i u_j}(h)\\), coupled to a signed heat commutator or shell-flux estimate that can be absorbed by dissipation.",
  "正结果是": "The positive result is",
  "周期频率局部化 nonlinear Bernstein 不等式在 \\(p=4\\) 给出": "The periodic frequency-localized nonlinear Bernstein inequality at \\(p=4\\) gives",
