  "R0.73S 得到静态证书": "R0.73S established the static certificate",
  "R0.73T 问的是：它能不能进入 Navier--Stokes 动力学？答案仍然分成 一条正结果和两条边界。": "R0.73T asks whether it can enter the Navier--Stokes dynamics. The answer still separates into one positive result and two boundaries.",
