  "保留 tensor-only 无符号 envelope，检验式 (8.8) 能否与式 (1.2) 的 carré-du-champ 正项配对，并把 \\(s^{-1/2}\\) 损失放进可积的时间结构。": "Retain the tensor-only unsigned envelope, test whether equation (8.8) can be paired with the positive carré-du-champ term in equation (1.2), and place the \\(s^{-1/2}\\) loss inside an integrable time structure.",
  "并且 Jensen 不等式给出": "Jensen's inequality also gives",
  "不假设这个强范数时，能量仍给每个固定正尺度的估计。固定光滑寿命内的 \\(0<T<T_*\\)，并记": "Without assuming this strong norm, energy still yields an estimate at every fixed positive scale. Fix \\(0<T<T_*\\) within the smooth lifespan and write",
  "不同 heat 层之间还有": "Between different heat levels one also has",
  "但二者的 tensor time tangent 不同。这排除的是“只由偶次二次张量组成的 自治等式”。它不排除一侧上界，也不排除加入 \\(v_s\\) 或三阶有符号对象。": "but their tensor time tangents differ. This rules out an autonomous equality composed only of even quadratic tensors. It does not rule out one-sided upper bounds, nor does it rule out adding \\(v_s\\) or signed third-order objects.",
  "第二，完整张量确实恢复了压力：": "Second, the full tensor does recover the pressure:",
  "第三，stress 没有超出 R0.73Q/R 的临界指数。若 \\(E=L_t^4L_x^6\\)，则": "Third, the stress does not exceed the critical exponent from R0.73Q/R. If \\(E=L_t^4L_x^6\\), then",
  "第四，把压力按 \\(|u|^2\\) 加权居中后，可以严格收紧 R0.73T 的一侧 \\(AQ\\) 估计。这条改进与已有的 velocity--pressure correlation 文献有 直接公式碰撞，因此不承担新颖性声明。": "Fourth, centering the pressure with weight \\(|u|^2\\) strictly sharpens the one-sided \\(AQ\\) estimate from R0.73T. This improvement directly overlaps at the formula level with the existing velocity--pressure correlation literature, so no novelty claim is made.",
  "第一，\\(\\Theta_s\\) 和 \\(\\tau_s\\) 都逐点半正定，而且 \\(\\tau_s\\) 是严格的 heat covariance。它满足": "First, \\(\\Theta_s\\) and \\(\\tau_s\\) are both pointwise positive semidefinite, and \\(\\tau_s\\) is precisely the heat covariance. It satisfies",
  "对 \\(-u\\)，\\(T,p,V\\) 完全相同，\\(K\\) 反号。以下 \\(\\partial_t\\) 都指相应光滑初值在 \\(t=0\\) 的 Navier--Stokes 切向量。 因此": "For \\(-u\\), \\(T,p,V\\) are identical and \\(K\\) changes sign. Every \\(\\partial_t\\) below denotes the Navier--Stokes tangent at \\(t=0\\) for the corresponding smooth initial datum. Therefore",
  "对半正定矩阵 \\(A\\)，\\(|A|_F\\le\\operatorname{tr}A\\)。因此": "For a positive semidefinite matrix \\(A\\), \\(|A|_F\\le\\operatorname{tr}A\\). Therefore",
  "而非线性 tensor tangent 为": "whereas the nonlinear tensor tangent is",
  "而仅用能量时，每一个固定 \\(s>0\\) 仍有": "With energy alone, however, every fixed \\(s>0\\) still satisfies",
  "二次张量可能控制某些无符号大小，只是不能决定这个 signed tangent。": "Quadratic tensors may control some unsigned magnitudes, but they cannot determine this signed tangent.",
  "反过来，经典 scalar KHM 方程在周期或齐次平均后可以让 pressure trace 抵消，但它仍含三阶速度增量。压力从一条方程里消失，并不等于二阶统计 已经自治。R0.73U 的正负结果都针对式 (2.1)，不应被改写成对式 (2.2) 的优先权主张。": "Conversely, the classical scalar KHM equation can cancel the pressure trace after periodic or homogeneous averaging, but it still contains third-order velocity increments. The disappearance of pressure from one equation does not mean that second-order statistics are autonomous. The positive and negative results in R0.73U both concern equation (2.1) and must not be rewritten as priority claims about equation (2.2).",
  "负结果也变得更准确。完整二次张量可以恢复压力，却不能恢复其时间方程中 的三次带符号通量。一个四 Fourier 站点的精确见证给出": "The negative result also becomes more precise. The full quadratic tensor can recover pressure but cannot recover the signed cubic flux in its physical-time equation. An exact four-Fourier-site witness gives",
  "附图只展示解析公式与有限精确稀疏 Fourier 复算。四站点场是光滑平面三角多项式；它不是 Navier--Stokes 仿真、奇性、近奇性或爆破解。": "The figure shows only analytic formulas and a finite exact sparse-Fourier recomputation. The four-site field is a smooth planar trigonometric polynomial; it is not a Navier--Stokes simulation, singularity, near-singularity, or blow-up solution.",
  "该常数与 \\(T<T_*\\) 无关。在三维短 heat 尺度， \\(H_3(s)\\lesssim s^{-1}\\)，所以得到式 (1.5)。 这条式子把下一步的难点定位得很具体：正尺度 stress 已有能量控制，缺的是 把 \\(s^{-1/2}\\) 损失消掉，或在物理时间积分中证明足够的抵消。": "The constant is independent of \\(T<T_*\\). At short heat scales in three dimensions, \\(H_3(s)\\lesssim s^{-1}\\), giving equation (1.5). This formula locates the next difficulty precisely: positive-scale stress is already controlled by energy, but the \\(s^{-1/2}\\) loss must either be removed or shown to cancel sufficiently after integration in physical time.",
  "更不能从式 (8.5) 推出“tensor-only 上界都不可能”。例如": "Still less can equation (8.5) imply that all tensor-only upper bounds are impossible. For example,",
  "故 \\(\\tau_s\\) 的 Duhamel 输出仍回到同一个 \\(L_t^4L_x^6\\) 空间。这个 指数匹配是正确的，但式 (5.2) 已经假设 \\(u\\in L_t^4L_x^6\\)，所以不能 把它写成任意初值的先验收益。": "Thus the Duhamel output for \\(\\tau_s\\) returns to the same \\(L_t^4L_x^6\\) space. This exponent matching is correct, but equation (5.2) already assumes \\(u\\in L_t^4L_x^6\\), so it cannot be presented as an a priori gain for arbitrary initial data.",
  "归一化 profile 在 \\(\\theta=1/10\\) 取峰值。这与式 (1.5) 的 \\(s^{-1/2}\\) loss 在指数上对齐：heat 能选择尺度，却不能凭偶次张量 恢复方向。这个指数匹配不证明能量唯一估计已经达到 sharp 常数或普适 最优阶。": "The normalized profile attains its maximum at \\(\\theta=1/10\\). Its exponent matches the \\(s^{-1/2}\\) loss in equation (1.5): heat can select a scale, but even tensors alone cannot recover orientation. This exponent matching does not prove that the energy-only estimate has a sharp constant or a universally optimal order.",
  "记 R0.73T 的 Wiener 量 \\(A=\\sum_h|\\widehat{|u|^2}(h)|\\)，并令 \\(C_R\\) 表示周期 double-Riesz 算子在这里所用空间上的有界性常数。同时": "Let \\(A=\\sum_h|\\widehat{|u|^2}(h)|\\) be the Wiener quantity from R0.73T, and let \\(C_R\\) denote the boundedness constant of the periodic double-Riesz operator on the space used here. Also set",
  "加权中心压力方差收紧 R0.73T": "Weighted centered pressure variance sharpens R0.73T",
  "加入最小的 signed third-order lift，寻找其 physical-time 方程中可被 \\(\\nu\\partial_s\\) 或 Stokes smoothing 吸收的组合；": "Add the minimal signed third-order lift and seek combinations in its physical-time equation that can be absorbed by \\(\\nu\\partial_s\\) or Stokes smoothing;",
  "经典 Kármán--Howarth--Monin 对象则是": "The classical Kármán--Howarth--Monin object is instead",
  "经典 KHM 层级来自 von Kármán--Howarth 1938，Hill 2001 给出了任意 阶 exact structure-function equations：": "The classical KHM hierarchy originates with von Kármán--Howarth 1938, and Hill 2001 derived exact structure-function equations of arbitrary order:",
  "两条临界 stress 估计": "Two critical stress estimates",
