  "版本 R0.73V · 2026-09-01": "Version R0.73V · 2026-09-01",
  "并以 \\(a\\odot b=a\\otimes b+b\\otimes a\\) 记对称张量积。R0.73V 的 方程槽压缩对象是": "and write the symmetric tensor product as \\(a\\odot b=a\\otimes b+b\\otimes a\\). The equation-slot compressed object in R0.73V is",
  "从而": "hence",
