  "确定 exterior gradient tail 是否可由 R0.73X 的 velocity/pressure tail 推出，或必须作为新独立债务；": "Determine whether the exterior gradient tail follows from the R0.73X velocity/pressure tail or must be introduced as an independent debt;",
