  "所以 \\(D_{ii,s}^{3/2}=O(s^{3/2})\\)，\\(s=0\\) 端点可积。": "Thus \\(D_{ii,s}^{3/2}=O(s^{3/2})\\), and the \\(s=0\\) endpoint is integrable.",
  "所以存在 compact nonnegative bump \\(\\chi\\)，使": "Hence there is a compact nonnegative bump \\(\\chi\\) such that",
