  "图中 201 行是解析公式的确定性取值，不是 DNS、simulation、奇性候选或有限采样证明。NOT CLAY。": "The 201 plotted rows are deterministic evaluations of analytic formulas, not DNS, simulation, a singularity candidate, or proof by finite sampling. NOT CLAY.",
  "完全不依赖 \\(n\\)。因此没有只依赖 bare energy、又能统一穿过初始端点的 有限三次上界。": "Both quantities are independent of \\(n\\). Therefore no finite cubic upper bound depending only on bare energy can pass uniformly through the initial endpoint.",
  "无限求和得到 (1.2)。": "Summing infinitely many disjoint contributions yields (1.2).",
  "下一节只攻击一个接口：": "The next section attacks only one interface:",
  "先看光滑高频族": "First consider the smooth high-frequency family",
