  "这条反例的边界必须保留：任意 \\(\\delta>0\\) 后，解在 \\([\\delta,T_*]\\) 上解析，原 functional 有限。R0.73X 的 interior cylinder 假设没有被一个已知奇解击穿。": "The boundary of this counterexample must be preserved: after any \\(\\delta>0\\), the solution is analytic on \\([\\delta,T_*]\\), and the original functional is finite. The interior-cylinder assumption of R0.73X has not been broken by a known singular solution.",
