  "本笔记没有证明三维 Navier--Stokes 解的紧致性、epsilon regularity、光滑性或全局正则性。": "Nothing in this note proves compactness, epsilon regularity, smoothness, or global regularity for three-dimensional Navier--Stokes solutions.",
  "本笔记只新引入 \\(\\mathcal U_{\\rm ext}^{\\infty,\\square}\\)。下文继续使用 \\(\\mathcal D_{\\rm ext}^{\\square}\\) 的记号。": "Only \\(\\mathcal U_{\\rm ext}^{\\infty,\\square}\\) is newly introduced in this note. The notation \\(\\mathcal D_{\\rm ext}^{\\square}\\) is used from now on.",
  "本节只证明一个正尺度 size lemma：core--core 由 clock-matched local energy 支付，其余三块由显式 exterior velocity/gradient tails 支付。它不证明尾项小、可吸收、紧致，也不证明 epsilon regularity、奇性或任意三维全局正则性。NOT CLAY。": "This section proves only a positive-scale size lemma: clock-matched local energy pays core--core, while explicit exterior velocity/gradient tails pay the other three blocks. It does not prove that the tails are small, absorbable, or compact, nor does it prove epsilon regularity, singularity formation, or arbitrary three-dimensional global regularity. NOT CLAY.",
  "本文不主张存在精确的四项 covariance 恒等式。若在 covariance 内直接分解 \\(u=1_{C_R}u+1_{E_R}u\\)，会产生如下交叉项：": "There is no claimed exact four-term covariance identity. Directly splitting \\(u=1_{C_R}u+1_{E_R}u\\) inside a covariance creates cross terms such as",
