  "奇对称性严格锁定局部中心": "Odd symmetry strictly locks the local center",
  "桥恒等式按整数 winding 精确求和。主 winding 的正概率由固定 tube 事件控制；其他 winding 不是删除，而是进入统一可求和上界。累计 drift-shift 小于冻结终端 lobe 的几何余量；反向 packet 的到达概率带有更强指数。": "Bridge identities sum exactly over integers winding. The positive probability of the main winding is controlled by the fixed tube event; other windings are not deleted but enter the uniform summable upper bound. The cumulative drift-shift is less than the geometric margin of the frozen terminal lobe; the arrival probability of the reverse packet has a stronger exponent.",
  "全反演奇性与偶匹配 mollifier 使选定局部轨迹、速度与加速度全部消失：": "Full inversion odd and even matching mollifier makes selected local trajectories, velocities and accelerations disappear:",
  "任意 NSE 解的端点与所有正则性后果。": "The endpoints of any NSE solution with all regularity consequences.",
