  "算术证书 30/30 PASS，只核对有理恒等式、指数余量、离散阈值和条件 annular geometry。图 validator 50/50 PASS，SVG/PDF/600 dpi PNG、灰度和最终尺寸均通过。": "Arithmetic Certificate 30/30 PASS, checking rational identities, exponential remainders, discrete thresholds, and conditional annual geometry only. Figure validator 50/50 PASS, SVG/PDF/600 dpi PNG, grayscale and final size all pass.",
  "图上明确写明：有限兼容性不能认证解析 bridge 或 packet survival；图不是 DNS、仿真或数值证明。": "The diagram clearly states: Limited compatibility cannot authenticate the resolution of bridge or packet survival; the diagram is not DNS, simulation or numerical proof.",
  "完整 denominator / amplitude：OPEN": "full denominator/amplitude: OPEN",
  "完整周期 Brownian bridge 门": "Complete cycle Brownian bridge door",
  "文献与开放边界": "Documentation and open borders",
  "研究笔记 R0.74F · 完整中文版本": "Research Notes R0.74F · Full Chinese version",
  "一个闭合完整 denominator 的振幅 \\(\\mathfrak a_j\\)；": "The amplitude of a closed complete denominator is \\(\\mathfrak a_j\\);",
  "因此 frame 本身没有漂移误差，packet 是否存活成为纯解析问题，而不是坐标选择问题。": "Therefore, the frame itself has no drift error, and whether the packet survives becomes a purely analytical problem, not a coordinate selection problem.",
  "有限算术门从 \\(j=13\\) 开始，但解析定理有多个渐近估计，所以公开量词保留“充分大”，不把 \\(j=13\\) 偷换成全部解析步骤的统一阈值。": "The finite arithmetic gate starts with \\(j=13\\), but the analytic theorem has multiple asymptotic estimates, so the public quantifier remains \"sufficiently large\" and does not replace \\(j=13\\) with a unified threshold for all analytic steps.",
  "有限证书 30/30：FINITE": "Limited Certificate 30/30: FINITE",
  "有限证书与图件边界": "Limited Certificates and Figure Boundaries",
  "这里的随机表示只服务于解析下界，没有 Monte Carlo、DNS 或经验拟合。": "The stochastic representation here only serves analytical lower bounds, without Monte Carlo, DNS or empirical fitting.",
  "正 packet 的反向 Feynman--Kac 表示": "Reverse Feynman--Kac representation of positive packet",
  "证明把终端 packet 值写成时间反向随机表示。周期流形上的 Brownian path 不能只保留中央复制；所有 winding 都必须纳入。正 packet 的主桥事件、drift shift 和横向扩散分别估计，负 packet 则用严格的相反侧指数抑制。": "Prove that the terminal packet value is written as a time-reverse random representation. A Brownian path on a periodic manifold cannot retain just the central replication; all windings must be incorporated. Main bridge events, drift shift, and lateral diffusion are estimated separately for positive packets, and with strict opposite-side exponential suppression for negative packets.",
  "终端 lobe 在指定 dyadic annulus 内具有正测度，这把路径概率下界转成确定性的 \\(L^2\\) 外环带下界。": "The terminal lobe has a positive measure within the specified dyadic annulus, which turns the path probability lower bound into a deterministic \\(L^2\\) outer band lower bound.",
  "周期桥独立审计": "Cycle Bridge Independent Audit",
  "周期桥审计逐行复核全 winding 恒等式、drift shift 与 bridge tube 概率；双包存活审计独立复核 packet 符号、终端几何和最终指数。两份审计绑定同一最终主报告 SHA；状态提升前后的主体 1--6 节经字节比较保持一致。": "Periodic bridge audits line-by-line review of full winding identities, drift shifts, and bridge tube probabilities; dual-packet survival audits independently review packet symbols, terminal geometry, and final exponents. The two audits are bound to the same final main report SHA; the body 1--6 byte comparisons before and after the status promotion are consistent.",
  "状态 · R0.74F": "Status · R0.74F",
  "Feynman--Kac、Brownian bridge、2D3C passive scalar、shear dispersion 和 mollified trajectory 各有直接先例。限定检索未定位同一组合定理，但这不是 priority/novelty proof。": "Feynman--Kac, Brownian bridge, 2D3C passive scalar, shear dispersion and mollified trajectory each have direct precedents. The restricted search did not locate the same combination theorem, but this is not a priority/novelty proof.",
  "transition、background、packet、mixed \\(G_u\\)、pressure gauge 与 all-copy \\(H_u\\) 行；": "transition, background, packet, mixed \\(G_u\\), pressure gauge and all-copy \\(H_u\\) lines;",
