  "70 项验证记录": "70 verification records",
  "本节没有构造奇点，也没有推出正则性，更不是 Clay 问题的解答。": "This section does not construct singularities, nor does it derive regularity, nor is it the answer to Clay's problem.",
  "表示本节不构成 Clay 千禧年问题的解答。": "To indicate that this section does not constitute a solution to Clay's Millennium Question.",
  "不存在一个与解和尺度无关的常数，使 R0.74E 的式 (3.11) 或式 (4.17) 对该精确解族成立。原先冻结的右端不能支付 travelling two-packet 机制，因此从当前路线中退出。": "There is no solution- and scale-independent constant such that Equation (3.11) or Equation (4.17) of R0.74E holds for this family of exact solutions. The originally frozen right end cannot pay for the traveling two-packet mechanism and is therefore exited from the current route.",
  "对选定振幅和所有充分大的 \\(j\\)，两种冻结版本都有": "For selected amplitudes and all sufficiently large \\(j\\), both frozen versions have",
  "二次和规范压力行都由同一尺度支付": "Both secondary and normative pressure lines are paid by the same scale",
  "规范主文": "Standard text",
  "缓冲局部能量证明显式排除 packet 梯度进入内球，并保留背景、过渡区和所有周期复制。虽然物理压力 \\(p=0\\)，移动与减法坐标仍产生规范压力；Riesz/Newton 分解和局部平均估计证明该压力行由同一缓冲能量控制。": "The buffered local energy proof explicitly excludes packet gradients from entering the inner sphere, and preserves the background, transition regions, and all period replications. Although physical pressure \\(p=0\\), shifting and subtracting coordinates still produce gauge pressure; Riesz/Newton decomposition and local mean estimation prove that this pressure line is controlled by the same buffer energy.",
  "缓冲能量、规范压力、全时间全复制 occupation、完整 velocity/harmonic 支付、分母上界及两种比值发散均为解析结果；三份独立解析审计分别复核这些部分。": "Buffer energy, gauge pressure, full-time full-replicate occupation, full velocity/harmonic payoff, upper denominator bounds, and both ratio divergences are analytical results; three independent analytical audits reviewed these components.",
  "解析证明与有限复算严格分开": "Analytical proofs are strictly separated from finite complex computations",
  "精确 source-data.csv": "Exact source-data.csv",
  "局部能量、Feynman--Kac、Brownian bridge、Riesz/Newton、Peetre 与 2D3C 被动标量机制各有直接先例。有限检索没有穷尽文献，因此不声明“首次”、新颖性或优先权。": "Local energy, Feynman--Kac, Brownian bridge, Riesz/Newton, Peetre and 2D3C passive scalar mechanisms each have direct precedents. A limited search does not exhaust the literature and therefore does not claim \"first time\", novelty or priority.",
  "两条冻结不等式被否定": "Two frozen inequalities are negated",
  "能量—压力独立审计": "Energy-Stress Independent Audit",
  "能量与压力不是被省略或声明为“低阶”，而是逐项进入最终 denominator 上界。": "Rather than being omitted or declared as \"lower order\", energy and pressure are itemized into the final denominator upper bound.",
  "能支付该双包族且不循环的新尺度不变 denominator；": "A new scale-invariant denominator that can pay for this two-pack family without looping;",
  "奇对称局部 frame 使 Version-M 与 Version-F 的中心都固定。R0.74F 的全 winding 周期 Brownian bridge 定理给出，对所有充分大的 \\(j\\)，": "The oddly symmetrical partial frame makes the centers of Version-M and Version-F fixed. The full winding period Brownian bridge theorem of R0.74F gives that, for all sufficiently large \\(j\\),",
  "全时间 occupation 引理同时处理两个 packet、全部 dyadic annuli 和全部周期复制。归一化周期桥、单边路径几何与 Peetre 卷积给出 \\(p=2,3\\) 的统一上界。": "The full-time occupation lemma handles both packets, full dyadic annuli, and full period replication simultaneously. Normalized periodic bridges, one-sided path geometry and Peetre convolution give a unified upper bound on \\(p=2,3\\).",
  "确定性证书 31/31 PASS，独立精确算术实现逐行一致；它只核对有理恒等式、指数余量和几何门。图件 validator 70/70 PASS；图是公式账本，不是 DNS、随机仿真或测量数据。": "Certification of Certainty 31/31 PASS, independent exact arithmetic achieves line-by-line consistency; it only checks rational identities, exponential remainders, and geometric gates. Figure validator 70/70 PASS; Figure is a formula ledger, not DNS, random simulation, or measured data.",
  "任意三维全局正则性、blow-up 或 Clay 结论。": "Arbitrary three-dimensional global regularity, blow-up or clay conclusions.",
  "三份解析审计：PASS": "Three analytical audits: PASS",
