  "完整支付账本闭合；显式光滑 2D3C 解族使 R0.74E 两条冻结不等式的比值至少按 L_j 发散": "Complete payments ledger closure; explicitly smooth 2D3C family of solutions such that R0.74E The ratio of the two frozen inequalities diverges by at least L_j",
  "完整支付账本已经闭合": "The complete payment ledger has been closed",
  "先提出一个能支付精确双包族、保持尺度不变且不把目标量循环写回右端的新 denominator；随后再检查任意解定理。": "I first propose a new denominator that pays for the exact two-bag family, keeps the scale constant, and does not write the target quantity cyclically back to the right; then I check the arbitrary solution theorem.",
  "修正 denominator 对任意解的定理；": "Modify denominator theorem for arbitrary solutions;",
  "修正 denominator：OPEN": "Fix denominator: OPEN",
  "研究笔记 R0.74G · 完整中文版本": "Research Notes R0.74G · Full Chinese version",
  "有界检索不承担新颖性声明": "Bounded searches do not bear a claim of novelty",
  "有限证书 31/31：FINITE": "Limited Certificate 31/31: FINITE",
  "与双包存活下界合并后，R0.74E 的式 (3.11) 和式 (4.17) 都不能由解与尺度无关的常数成立。结论是严格的路线淘汰，不是奇性或正则性定理。": "Combined with the two-bag survival lower bound, neither Equation (3.11) nor Equation (4.17) of R0.74E can be established by a scale-independent constant. The conclusion is strict route elimination, not a singularity or regularity theorem.",
  "原始 JSON": "Raw JSON",
  "这不表示每一种局部 frame、每一种 denominator 或每一种入口 flux 设计都失败。下一步必须提出新的尺度不变分母，并先用本解族压力测试，避免把待证结论直接放入分母。": "This does not mean that every local frame, every denominator, or every inlet flux design fails. The next step must be to propose a new scale-invariant denominator, and first use this solution family for stress testing to avoid directly putting unproven conclusions into the denominator.",
  "这个发散同时包含缓冲能量的 \\(3/2\\) 次幂、规范压力、速度三次项和代数调和项；它不是“不完整分母”的伪反例。": "This divergence also contains buffer energy \\(3/2\\) Powers, gauge pressure, velocity cubic terms, and algebraic harmonic terms; it is not a pseudo-counterexample to \"incomplete denominator\".",
  "这里 \\(B_j\\) 是统一支付尺度；振幅选择与全部分母项在同一账本中处理，没有只保留有利项。": "Here \\(B_j\\) is the unified payment scale; the amplitude selection is processed in the same ledger as all parent items, and only favorable items are not retained.",
  "这一步仍是解析定理；有限证书从某个离散层级开始通过，不能替代“充分大”的渐近量词。": "This step is still an analytic theorem; finite certificates start from some discrete level and cannot replace \"sufficiently large\" asymptotic quantifiers.",
  "这一节没有解决三维 Navier--Stokes 千禧年问题。它研究同一个精确、光滑、周期、零均值、无外力的 2D3C 解族，并补齐 R0.74F 尚未估计的缓冲局部能量、规范压力、速度三次项和代数调和项。": "This section does not address the three-dimensional Navier--Stokes Millennium Problem. It studies the same family of exact, smooth, periodic, zero-mean, no external forces 2D3C solutions and completes the buffered local energies, gauge pressures, velocity cubic terms and algebraic harmonic terms that have not yet been estimated for R0.74F.",
  "这一节完成双包族的完整分母账本，并严格否定 R0.74E 中两条已经冻结的候选不等式。": "This section completes the complete denominator ledger of the two-pack family and strictly denies the two frozen candidate inequalities in R0.74E.",
  "这一行支付 velocity cubic 与 algebraic harmonic packet 项，也保留 background、transition 和 mixed \\(G_u\\) 项；没有把有限时间窗替换成单点估计。": "This line pays for the velocity cubic and algebraic harmonic packet terms, and also retains the background, transition, and mixed \\(G_u\\) terms; it does not replace the finite time window with a single-point estimate.",
  "振幅选为": "The amplitude is selected as",
  "证据与缺口矩阵": "Evidence and Gap Matrix",
