  "只表示指定的两条内部候选估计被反例排除，不表示所有局部坐标估计都失败。": "It only means that the two specified internal candidate estimates are eliminated by counterexamples, but it does not mean that all local coordinate estimates have failed.",
  "主文、三份解析审计与证书": "Main text, three analytical audits and certificates",
