  "当 (P_R^\\alpha>1) 时，定理保留 (+P_R^\\alpha)。这正是上一节反例要求支付的大量区间，而不是证明缺口。": "When (P_R^\\alpha>1), the theorem retains (+P_R^\\alpha). This is precisely the large-payment regime required by the preceding counterexample, not a proof gap.",
