  "冻结局部坐标中的环带通量修复、双区间闭合与小支付端点": "Collar-flux repair, two-regime closure, and the small-payment endpoint in the frozen local frames",
  "独立 Ruby 实现": "Independent Ruby implementation",
  "独立复算 150 字段：FINITE": "Independent recomputation of 150 fields: FINITE",
  "对 R0.74E 冻结的两种局部 frame、每个声明范围内的光滑周期无外力解、尺度与柱体，存在统一常数 (C)，使": "For the two local frames frozen in R0.74E, every smooth periodic unforced solution, scale, and cylinder in the declared scope share a uniform constant (C) such that",
  "恒等式中的通量付款仍不是一个可独立控制的正则性量。把它替换成可由弱解数据稳定支付的量，仍是下一门槛。": "The flux payment in the identity is still not an independently controllable regularity quantity. Replacing it with an amount that can be stably paid by weak solution data is still the next threshold.",
  "环带通量从局部能量恒等式进入": "The collar flux enters through the local energy identity",
  "环带通量修复：PROVED": "Collar-flux repair: PROVED",
  "记正环带通量为 \\(\\mathfrak C_R^\\alpha\\)。精确修复是": "Write the positive collar flux as \\(\\mathfrak C_R^\\alpha\\). The exact repair is",
  "解析定理、有限复算与文献边界": "Analytic theorem, finite recomputation, and literature boundary",
  "两种冻结坐标中的加权局部能量恒等式、有限 shell 极限与压力规范转移均逐项保留。二次 cutoff row 给出 (2/3) 次幂；剩余有符号项由正环带通量支付。": "The weighted local energy identities, finite-shell limits, and pressure-gauge transfers in both frozen frames are retained term by term. The quadratic cutoff row gives the (2/3) power; the remaining signed term is paid by the positive collar flux.",
  "两种加权局部能量恒等式、finite-shell 与 pressure-gauge 转移、(2/3) cutoff row、正环带通量修复、双区间闭合、小支付端点，以及双包族上的单边通量下界。": "The two weighted local energy identities, finite-shell and pressure-gauge transfers, the (2/3) cutoff row, positive collar-flux repair, two-regime closure, the small-payment endpoint, and the one-sided flux lower bound for the two-packet family.",
  "没有反向比较，也没有尺度迭代": "No reverse comparison and no scale iteration",
  "门槛在 (P=1)": "The threshold is (P=1)",
  "能量恒等式独立审计": "Independent Audit of Energy Identities",
  "全文对抗审计": "Full-text adversarial audit",
  "任意三维全局正则性、blow-up 与 Clay 结论；": "Arbitrary three-dimensional global regularity, blow-up and Clay conclusions;",
  "若定义": "If defined",
  "弱解稳定与尺度迭代：OPEN": "Weak solution stability and scale iteration: OPEN",
  "上一节排除了把任意大支付量统一压成 (P^{2/3}) 的估计。本节从局部能量恒等式找回正环带通量，并证明对任意光滑周期无外力解成立的双区间闭合。": "The preceding section ruled out uniformly compressing arbitrarily large payments into (P^{2/3}). This section recovers the positive collar flux from the local energy identity and proves two-regime closure for every smooth periodic unforced solution.",
  "适用于 suitable weak-solution approximation 的稳定版本；": "Stable version suitable for suitable weak-solution approximation;",
  "双包通量独立审计": "Independent two-packet flux audit",
  "双区间闭合：PROVED": "Two-regime closure: PROVED",
  "四篇主源边界": "Four main source boundaries",
  "替代恒等式级 collar flux、且可独立控制的支付量；": "A payment amount that replaces the identity-level collar flux and can be independently controlled;",
  "通量修复与双区间账本": "Flux repair and two-regime ledger",
  "图件 69/69：FINITE": "Figure 69/69: FINITE",
  "完整报告源": "Full report source",
  "文献独立审计": "Independent audit of literature",
  "下一步必须独立控制通量": "The next step must be to independently control the flux",
  "限定核对四篇相邻主源，没有定位到完全相同的组合。这只是有限语料中的 non-hit，不支持新颖性或优先权声明。": "After checking only four adjacent primary sources, no identical combination was found. This is just a non-hit in a limited corpus and does not support claims of novelty or priority.",
  "新颖性或发表优先权。": "Novelty or publication priority.",
  "寻找可独立控制、适合弱解极限的 collar-flux 替代量，并先验证它能否支持尺度迭代；在此之前不作正则性外推。": "Find a collar-flux surrogate that can be independently controlled and suitable for the weak solution limit, and first verify whether it can support scale iteration; no regularity extrapolation is performed before this.",
  "研究笔记 R0.74H · 完整中文版本": "Research Notes R0.74H · Full Chinese version",
  "因此，修复项确实看见上一节暴露的缺失尺度。": "Therefore, the repair term does see the missing scale exposed in the previous section.",
  "在 R0.74F--G 的精确双包解族上，对所有充分大的 (j)，": "For the exact R0.74F--G two-packet solution family and every sufficiently large (j),",
  "则得到同次齐性的形式": "This yields the homogeneous form",
  "这里得到的是一尺度能量估计，不是 epsilon 正则性、延拓判据或千禧年问题解答。": "This is a one-scale energy estimate, not epsilon regularity, a continuation criterion, or a solution of the Millennium Problem.",
  "这里只证明 collar flux 的单边下界与双区间上界；没有证明反向比较、渐近等价、匹配的 (B_j^3R_j^3) 下界或 logarithmic-frontier theorem。": "Only a one-sided collar-flux lower bound and a two-regime upper bound are proved here; no reverse comparison, asymptotic equivalence, matching (B_j^3R_j^3) lower bound, or logarithmic-frontier theorem is claimed.",
  "正环带通量承担缺失的 (L_j) 尺度": "The positive collar flux pays the missing (L_j) scale",
