  "主文、解析审计、精确证书与文献边界": "Main note, analytic audits, exact certificate, and literature boundary",
  "状态 · R0.74H": "Status · R0.74H",
  "最终源文件重绑定审计": "Final source file rebinding audit",
  "epsilon 正则性、延拓或奇性排除；": "epsilon regularity, continuation or singularity exclusion;",
  "Python 实现": "Python implementation",
  "Python 证书 25/25 PASS；独立 Ruby 精确实现核对 150 个字段，零差异。图件 validator 69/69 PASS，23 项 SHA 全通过，物理图包共 24 个文件。有限结果只复核代数与图件，不替代解析证明。": "The Python certificate returns 25/25 PASS; an independent exact Ruby implementation checks 150 fields with zero discrepancies. The figure validator returns 69/69 PASS, all 23 SHA entries pass, and the physical package contains 24 files. These finite checks cover algebra and figure assets only; they do not replace the analytic proof.",
  "SVG 是网页主图；PNG 是回退与 600 dpi 归档，PDF 是矢量下载。图是精确指数图，不是 DNS、仿真或测量数据。": "SVG is the primary web figure; PNG is the fallback and 600 dpi archive, and PDF is the vector download. The figure is an exact exponent diagram, not DNS, simulation, or measured data.",
  "Version-F 的 acceleration row 没有被隐藏或改写成有利符号，而是先进入 (P_{0,R}^F)，再由完整非负账本比较到 (P_R^F)。": "The acceleration row of Version-F is not hidden or rewritten to a favorable symbol, but first enters (P_{0,R}^F), and then is compared to (P_R^F) by the complete non-negative ledger.",
  "\\(\\gamma=1/2\\) 未被否定，也没有被证明": "\\(\\gamma=1/2\\) is neither refuted nor proved",
  "\\[\\boxed{\\mathcal E^{M,R}(z_0,8R)\\le\\varepsilon_{\\rm tube}\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad z_0\\text{ 是正则点}.}\\]": "\\[\\boxed{\\mathcal E^{M,R}(z_0,8R)\\le\\varepsilon_{\\rm tube}\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad z_0\\text{ is regular}.}\\]",
  "\\[\\boxed{P_R^M\\le\\varepsilon_P\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad z_0\\text{ 是正则点}.}\\]": "\\[\\boxed{P_R^M\\le\\varepsilon_P\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad z_0\\text{ is regular}.}\\]",
