  "12.1 从 cubic payment 反推一般有效壳层 packing": "12.1 Derive general effective-shell packing from the cubic payment",
  "12.2 优化非 equal-target 振幅，而不是预设每壳同高": "12.2 Optimize non-equal-target amplitudes instead of imposing equal shell heights",
  "12.3 单独处理 signed flux 与完整 \\(Y_2\\)": "12.3 Treat signed flux and the complete \\(Y_2\\) separately",
  "13 / 完整正文": "13 / Complete text",
