  "若还能证明": "If one could also prove",
  "若未来另有有符号通量分析证明第一条，那么本节的支付下界只会说明这个 equal-target 解族不能反驳固定尺度不等式。反过来，当前构造失败也不 能推出固定尺度不等式对任意周期适合弱解成立。两种逻辑方向都不能 越过。": "If a future signed-flux analysis proves the first statement, the payment lower bound here would show only that this equal-target family cannot refute the fixed-scale inequality. Conversely, failure of the current construction cannot imply that the fixed-scale inequality holds for every periodic suitable weak solution. Neither logical direction may be crossed.",
  "三次支付阻断：PROVED": "Cubic-payment obstruction: PROVED",
  "时间长度是 \\(|J|=R^3\\)，空间体积是 \\(L_NR^3/16\\)，归一化为 \\((2R)^{-2}\\)。利用已经证明的点态 dominance，可得真正的下界": "The time length is \\(|J|=R^3\\), the spatial volume is \\(L_NR^3/16\\), and the normalization is \\((2R)^{-2}\\). Using the proved pointwise dominance gives the genuine lower bound",
  "所以 relaxed geometry 真正通过了共同剪切、共同终端窗口、统一 bridge survival、反演配对、周期 copies 和不同物理壳层六道门。": "Thus the relaxed geometry passes all six gates: common shear, common terminal window, uniform bridge survival, reflection pairing, periodic copies, and distinct physical shells.",
