  "所有显示的有理指数余量、dyadic 恒等式、公式标签与 确定性证书检查。有限计算不替代 stochastic tail、annular geometry 或 payment lower bound 的解析证明。": "All displayed rational exponent margins, dyadic identities, formula labels, and deterministic certificate checks. Finite computation does not replace the analytic proof of the stochastic tail, annular geometry, or payment lower bound.",
  "同样，完整 \\(Y_{2,R}^{\\rm sf}\\) 必须核对所有 off-target 壳层和早期 正变差。只有得到上界，\\(\\sqrt N\\,T\\) 才能被当作精确族的真实平方 函数尺度，而不是目标分量的下方检出。": "Likewise, the complete \\(Y_{2,R}^{\\rm sf}\\) must account for every off-target shell and all earlier positive variation. Only an upper bound would make \\(\\sqrt N\\,T\\) the true square-function scale of the exact family rather than a lower detection from the target components.",
  "完整 Version-M 支付包含非负的外部速度三次项。在半径 \\(2R\\) 上，": "The complete Version-M payment contains the nonnegative exterior velocity-cubic term. At radius \\(2R\\),",
