  "一个可操作目标是：除去至多 \\(N_0\\) 个终端例外后，构造 \\(a_{k,R,\\tau}\\ge0\\)，使": "One operational target is to remove at most \\(N_0\\) terminal exceptions and construct \\(a_{k,R,\\tau}\\ge0\\) such that",
  "一致有界。这个数才是抽象序列意义上的有效壳层数。因为壳层权重已经 包含在 \\(v_{k,R}\\) 里面，\\(\\sum_k\\gamma_k<\\infty\\) 本身不能再替我 完成压缩。": "is uniformly bounded. This is the effective shell count in the abstract sequence sense. Because the shell weights are already included in \\(v_{k,R}\\), the fact that \\(\\sum_k\\gamma_k<\\infty\\) cannot by itself perform the compression.",
