  "于是下一步必须让 PDE 说话。最直接的检验是：方程是否真的允许很多 物理壳层在同一终端时刻都留下尺度相同的时钟？": "The PDE must therefore speak next. The most direct test is whether the equation truly allows many physical shells to retain clocks of comparable size at the same terminal time.",
  "与 \\(\\ell\\) 无关。困难在于 \\(\\Gamma_\\ell\\) 随壳层指数下降，所以 \\(\\mathfrak a_\\ell\\) 向外增长得非常快。仅仅说未加权包彼此远离， 不能排除大振幅外包的微小热尾抵消内包。": "independent of \\(\\ell\\). The difficulty is that \\(\\Gamma_\\ell\\) decreases with the shell index, so \\(\\mathfrak a_\\ell\\) grows extremely quickly outward. Merely separating the unweighted packets cannot rule out a tiny heat tail from a large-amplitude outer packet cancelling an inner packet.",
