  "：两因子的任意 suitable-weak 构造、耗散替代、signed upcrossing 支付、\\(Q.1\\)、尺度收缩与正则性；": ": construction of the two factors for arbitrary suitable weak solutions, dissipation substitutes, signed-upcrossing payment, \\(Q.1\\), scale contraction, and regularity;",
  "：两因子条件推出固定尺度不等式；": ": the two-factor hypothesis conditionally implies the fixed-scale inequality;",
