  "). 二者截至本节冻结时 均为预印本，不能当作已同行评审结论；它们也都没有给出本节所需的任意 completed-clock 两因子提取。": "). At this section's freeze both are preprints, not peer-reviewed conclusions, and neither supplies the arbitrary completed-clock two-factor extraction required here.",
  "). Huang 则在终端能量 测度已经含点原子的假设下，构造 same-state constrained/passive 比较， 得到非负累计压力功与局部压力集中 (": "). Huang assumes that the terminal energy measure already contains a point atom and constructs a same-state constrained/passive comparison, obtaining nonnegative accumulated pressure work and local pressure concentration (",
  "\\(E\\) 是端点局部动能，\\(D\\) 是从起始时刻累计的非负黏性与缺陷耗散， \\(Q\\) 是二次源项原函数，\\(F\\) 是有符号通量原函数。\\(D\\) 单调不减， \\(K(s_R)=0\\)，且 \\(K\\ge0\\)。继承的绝对账本给出": "\\(E\\) is terminal local kinetic energy, \\(D\\) is the nonnegative accumulated viscous and defect dissipation from the launch time, \\(Q\\) is the primitive of the quadratic source, and \\(F\\) is the primitive of signed flux. \\(D\\) is nondecreasing, \\(K(s_R)=0\\), and \\(K\\ge0\\). The inherited absolute ledger gives",
  "1. 先去掉 equal-target 假设": "1. First remove the equal-target assumption",
  "10. 审计状态": "10. Audit status",
  "2. 三次支付先相加，再体现凸性": "2. Add the cubic payments first, then expose convexity",
  "2026 年有两个特别邻近、但仍不同的预印本。Yu 在有限 coarse-grained 链上证明了 active signed-work 提取和带 leakage/backscatter 的加权 telescoping，但把从 CKN badness 到 coarse observability 的困难步骤明确 留作独立问题 (": "Two especially nearby 2026 preprints remain different. Yu proves active signed-work extraction and weighted telescoping with leakage/backscatter on a finite coarse-grained chain, while explicitly leaving the passage from CKN badness to coarse observability as a separate problem (",
