  "；它没有把整棵树实现为同一个 Navier--Stokes solution 的 clocks。": "; it does not realize the whole tree as clocks of one Navier--Stokes solution.",
  "；它们排除只靠 scalar \\(\\ell^1/\\ell^2\\) ledgers 的推导，不否定 (S.243)。exact minimal target 是": "; they rule out derivations using only scalar \\(\\ell^1/\\ell^2\\) ledgers and do not refute (S.243). The exact minimal target is",
