  "按 elapsed time \\(O(R^2)\\) 或 accumulated path variation \\(O(2^kR)\\) 贪心停时，可用至多": "Stopping greedily by elapsed time \\(O(R^2)\\) or accumulated path variation \\(O(2^kR)\\), one needs at most",
  "八分之一、八分之一、四分之一优先三分法；": "The one-eighth/one-eighth/one-quarter priority trichotomy;",
