  "对 \\(\\mathcal D\\in\\{I_R,\\mathcal T_R\\}\\) 定义 good-terminal residual gate": "For \\(\\mathcal D\\in\\{I_R,\\mathcal T_R\\}\\), define the good-terminal residual gate",
