  "对固定 \\(R_*>0\\)，\\(\\sup_{0<R\\le R_*}T_K(R)\\to0\\)，但 energy bracket 没有可用的统一 bound。因此 S.349 不是 uniform-in-\\(R\\) payment theorem。": "For each fixed maximum scale, the index tail tends to zero, but the energy bracket has no available uniform bound. Thus S.349 is not a uniform-in-scale payment theorem. \\(R_*>0\\) \\(\\sup_{0<R\\le R_*}T_K(R)\\to0\\) \\(R\\)",
