  "若 (S.243) 成立，则 (S.238) 推出 full Q.12，再由 inherited Q.9 推出 Q.1。只在 \\(I_R\\) 证明 residual bound 能直接给 plateau Q.1，但不能升级成 full Q.12。": "If (S.243) holds, then (S.238) gives full Q.12, and inherited Q.9 then gives Q.1. A residual bound proved only on \\(I_R\\) can give plateau Q.1 directly, but it cannot be upgraded to full Q.12.",
