  "若要 refute 某个固定 \\(N\\)，新的 smooth exact family 必须提供 \\(N+1\\) 个不同 target shells，且": "To refute a fixed \\(N\\), a new smooth exact family must supply \\(N+1\\) distinct target shells such that",
