  "三项合起来给出 \\(\\sum_{\\rm incidences}c_\\nu^3\\le M_{\\rm inc}C_{\\rm root}C_D\\)，从而提供 S.340 所需的 \\(C_c\\)。Uniform \\(\\theta_d\\le\\theta<1\\) 是简单特例。S.335 的 critical tree 有 \\(\\theta_d=1\\)，其 finite-depth Dini constant 按 \\(L=m^3\\) 增长，因而不能提供 uniform coefficient bound。": "Together the three inputs give \\(\\sum_{\\rm incidences}c_\\nu^3\\le M_{\\rm inc}C_{\\rm root}C_D\\), supplying the \\(C_c\\) required by S.340. Uniform \\(\\theta_d\\le\\theta<1\\) is a simple special case. The critical tree in S.335 has \\(\\theta_d=1\\), and its finite-depth Dini constant grows like \\(L=m^3\\), so it cannot supply a uniform coefficient bound.",
