  "所有 clock sums 都有限，因为共同零起点给出 \\(K_k(t)\\le o_{k,R}^F+\\operatorname{TV}_I Q_{k,R}\\)，故 \\(\\sum_k\\sup_tK_k(t)\\le B_{F,R}+B_{Q,R}<\\infty\\)。": "All clock sums are finite: the common zero start bounds every completed clock by positive flux excursion plus Q-variation, so the sum of coordinatewise clock suprema is bounded by the two finite variation ledgers. \\(K_k(t)\\le o_{k,R}^F+\\operatorname{__I18N_TEXT__}_I Q_{k,R}\\) \\(\\sum_k\\sup_tK_k(t)\\le B_{F,R}+B_{Q,R}<\\infty\\)",
