  "下述陈述对 bare periodic suitable-weak class": "The following statement for the bare periodic suitable-weak class is",
  "下一 PDE 阶段保留两个工作包：short terminal trace 检验 (S.261)；selected-excess packing 检验 (S.269)，并分开 anomalous measure 与 high-Rayleigh viscous mass。任何 adversarial exact family 先通过 (S.270)，不能只展示多个 terminal lobes。": "The next PDE stage retains two work packages: test short terminal trace through (S.261), and test selected-excess packing through (S.269) while separating anomalous measure from high-Rayleigh viscous mass. Any adversarial exact family must first pass (S.270), not merely display several terminal lobes.",
  "下一步不再尝试 no-exception supremum。唯一冻结方向是回到 R0.74Q (Q.7)--(Q.12) 的 fixed best-\\(N\\)、terminal-dependent exceptions，并保留 \\(\\sqrt N,Y_{2,R}^{\\rm sf}\\) 付款。": "The next step will not attempt another no-exception supremum. The only frozen direction is to return to the fixed best-\\(N\\), terminal-dependent exceptions of R0.74Q (Q.7)--(Q.12), retaining payment by \\(\\sqrt N,Y_{2,R}^{\\rm sf}\\).",
