  "以 backward time \\(s=(\\tau-t)/R^2\\) 定义 \\(M_I(s)=\\sum_{k\\in I,d_k>s}r_k^{\\rm sh}\\)、 \\(V_I(s)=\\sum_{k\\in I,d_k>s}a_k\\)。所有 last-exit intervals 共用 terminal endpoint，故其 indicator 精确为 \\(\\mathbf1_{\\{s<d_k\\}}\\)。weighted Hölder、(R.214) 与 (R.211) 给出": "In backward time \\(s=(\\tau-t)/R^2\\), define \\(M_I(s)=\\sum_{k\\in I,d_k>s}r_k^{\\rm sh}\\) and \\(V_I(s)=\\sum_{k\\in I,d_k>s}a_k\\). All last-exit intervals share the terminal endpoint, so their indicator is exactly \\(\\mathbf1_{\\{s<d_k\\}}\\). Weighted Holder, (R.214), and (R.211) give",
