  "在正终端壳层中，按 \\(d_k\\gtreqless\\lambda_k^{-3/2}\\)、\\(|\\Delta Q_k|\\gtreqless T_k/6\\)、\\(D_{k,R}(\\tau)\\gtreqless T_k/2\\) 分出 long/short、\\(Q+\\)/\\(Q-\\)、\\(D\\)/non-\\(D\\)。等号分别放入 long、absolute-\\(Q\\)-large 与 \\(D\\)-dominated 一侧。": "Among positive-terminal shells, use \\(d_k\\gtreqless\\lambda_k^{-3/2}\\), \\(|\\Delta Q_k|\\gtreqless T_k/6\\), and \\(D_{k,R}(\\tau)\\gtreqless T_k/2\\) to split into long/short, \\(Q+\\)/\\(Q-\\), and \\(D\\)/non-\\(D\\). Equality is assigned to the long, absolute-\\(Q\\)-large, and \\(D\\)-dominated sides.",
  "在终端时刻，前 \\(N\\) 个 shell positive variations 都等于 1，于是": "At the terminal time, the positive variations of the first \\(N\\) shells all equal 1, so",
