  "persistence 或 dwell-time，使高 clock aggregate 占据足够 parabolic time 并由 cubic payment 支付；": "Persistence or dwell time, forcing a high clock aggregate to occupy enough parabolic time to be paid by the cubic ledger;",
  "Primary analytic audit 对 S.445--S.475 的 closed-orbit topology、periodic averaging、dimensionless \\(L_t^p\\) normalization、complete payment、fixed deletion、signed integration by parts 与 completed-clock inequalities 逐项复核，结论为 PASS。Independent adversarial audit 保留并关闭五项修复记录，最终也为 PASS。Literature audit 逐条检查 Taylor、Yang、Dascaliuc--Grujić、Wolf 与 Duchon--Robert 的来源、适用范围与 non-implication 边界；有限检索不构成 novelty 或 priority claim。": "The primary analytic audit checks the closed-orbit topology, periodic averaging, dimensionless time normalization, complete payment, fixed deletion, signed integration by parts, and completed-clock inequalities in S.445–S.475. The independent adversarial audit retains and closes five repairs. The literature audit checks the sources and non-implication boundaries for Taylor, Yang, Dascaliuc--Grujić, Wolf, and Duchon--Robert. The bounded search makes no novelty or priority claim. \\(L_t^p\\)",
