  "Proposition 5.1 是 conditional payment-dependent Morrey envelope：若一个 universal \\(C_B\\) 对所有 solution 与 scale 满足": "Proposition 5.1 is a conditional payment-dependent Morrey envelope: suppose one universal \\(C_B\\) satisfies, for every solution and scale,",
