  "S.476–S.485、S.488–S.493 为 PROVED；triangular clocks 仅为 ABSTRACT；S.486、S.487、direct hybrid、S.472、S.407、Q.12、Q.1 与正则性仍 OPEN。NOT CLAY.": "S.476–S.485 and S.488–S.493 are PROVED; the triangular clocks are ABSTRACT only; the fixed-deletion, simultaneous-height, direct-hybrid, positive-excursion, terminal-crown, Q.12, Q.1, and regularity problems remain OPEN. NOT CLAY.",
  "S.486 为": "S.486 is",
