  "这就是 X.52。它不要求 (t_r=t_s)，但必须把两个 undeletable clock heights 与 outer exterior cubic payment 解耦。改变 amplitude law、shell placement、weight interaction 或 packet geometry 都需要新的 exact normalization、survival proof 与 all-cross-packet audit。": "This is X.52. It does not require equal witness times, but it must decouple two undeletable clock heights from the outer exterior cubic payment. Any change to amplitude law, shell placement, weight interaction, or packet geometry requires a new exact normalization, survival proof, and all-cross-packet audit.",
  "这是 exact smooth periodic unforced Navier--Stokes solution。equal target-clock normalization 不等于 equal raw-energy normalization；改变共同振幅 (A_*) 不能修复后文的 payment ratio。": "This is an exact smooth periodic unforced Navier--Stokes solution. Equal target-clock normalization is not equal raw-energy normalization; changing the common amplitude cannot repair the payment ratio below.",
