  "figure archive：25 files、3,032,354 bytes，18/18 deterministic rerender，SVG/PNG/PDF 与 greyscale QA PASS；": "Figure archive: 25 files and 3,032,354 bytes; 18/18 deterministic rerender; SVG, PNG, PDF, and greyscale QA PASS;",
