  "把 \\(I_{2R}\\) 分成 \\(R^3\\) blocks，并以各 block payment \\(p_m\\) 定义": "Split the interval into blocks of volume scale R cubed and define the effective count from each block payment. \\(I_{2R}\\) \\(R^3\\) \\(p_m\\)",
  "本站在 R0.75B Step 27 停止。下一命题必须证明有效 temporal packing threshold，或构造 accounting 完整的 exact smooth counterexample；二者均未完成。不得把 adverse upper-bound coefficient 写成反例，也不得把 strip lower 写成 whole-shell upper。full K、fixed deletion、arbitrary suitable weak extension、regularity 与 singularity 均未证明。R0.75C/D/E 与其他后续工作未读取、未公开。": "This site stops at R0.75B Step 27. The next proposition must prove an effective temporal-packing threshold or construct an exact smooth counterexample with complete accounting; neither is complete. The adverse upper-bound coefficient may not be called a counterexample, and a strip lower bound may not be written as a whole-shell upper bound. Full K, fixed deletion, arbitrary suitable-weak extension, regularity, and singularity remain unproved. R0.75C/D/E and other later work were neither read nor published.",
  "不得把 strip lower 改写为 whole-shell upper。正式图件：NOT APPLICABLE。本节纯解析，没有 Navier--Stokes 数值仿真、DNS、DGX 或正式图件。NO NOVELTY CLAIM. NOT CLAY.": "A strip lower bound may not be rewritten as a whole-shell upper bound. Formal figure: NOT APPLICABLE. This section is purely analytic and contains no Navier--Stokes simulation, DNS, DGX, or formal figure. NO NOVELTY CLAIM. NOT CLAY.",
  "充分条件精确化为": "The sufficient condition is exactly",
  "冻结 shell cutoff 被分成 safe cutoff \\(\\chi_k^R\\) 与 outer-collar cutoff \\(\\xi_k^R\\)。safe support 在 doubled-radius shell 上保有 \\(W_{2R}\\ge\\omega^{1/4}\\)，outer half 只能统一使用 \\(W_{2R}\\ge\\omega\\)。这一 index shift 决定了 safe rate 与 outer accumulated rate 的符号差异。": "The frozen shell cutoff is split into a safe cutoff and an outer-collar cutoff. The safe support retains the stronger doubled-radius weight, while the outer half has only the weaker uniform weight. This index shift determines the sign difference between the safe rate and the outer accumulated rate. \\(\\chi_k^R\\) \\(\\xi_k^R\\) \\(W_{2R}\\ge\\omega^{1/4}\\) \\(W_{2R}\\ge\\omega\\)",
  "冻结参数下的 exact rate 为": "The exact frozen-parameter rate is",
  "冻结精确族与尺度": "Frozen exact family and scales",
  "对 terminal \\(R^3\\) 回看窗使用与 Step 26 相同的穷尽二分：outer localized energy 要么持续，要么 rapid rise 强制同一 collar 的 spacetime mass。由较小的 collar volume 得到": "Apply the same exhaustive dichotomy as in Step 26 on the terminal R-cubed lookback window: outer localized energy either persists or a rapid rise forces spacetime mass in the same collar. The smaller collar volume gives \\(R^3\\)",
  "对空间 cutoff \\(\\chi\\) 与冻结时间 cutoff \\(\\eta_R\\) 做精确分部积分，同时保留 \\(F\\) 与 shear \\(b\\) 的耗散，得到": "Integrate by parts exactly with a spatial cutoff and the frozen time cutoff, retaining dissipation from both the passive field and shear, to obtain \\(\\chi\\) \\(\\eta_R\\) \\(F\\) \\(b\\)",
  "结论先行：完整时钟只剩 outer accumulated dissipation": "Conclusion first: only outer accumulated dissipation remains on the complete clock",
  "结论只对 inversion-paired exact family 成立；此时 Version-M mollified trajectory 恒为零。它不是任意 suitable weak solution 的定理。": "The conclusion applies only to the inversion-paired exact family, for which the Version-M mollified trajectory is identically zero. It is not a theorem for arbitrary suitable weak solutions.",
  "精确剩余量是 temporal packing": "The exact remainder is temporal packing",
  "令 \\(k=k_2-1\\)、\\(L=L_2\\)、\\(\\omega=\\Gamma^{1/4}\\)、\\(pL=2^{k_2}\\)。速度场保持": "Set the frozen indices and scales as displayed. The velocity field remains \\(k=k_2-1\\) \\(L=L_2\\) \\(\\omega=\\Gamma^{1/4}\\) \\(pL=2^{k_2}\\)",
