  "下一命题必须二选一：证明 outer-dissipation packing condition，或构造 accounting 完整的 exact smooth counterexample。两者均未完成。": "The next proposition has two possible forms: prove the outer-dissipation packing condition or construct an exact smooth counterexample with complete accounting. Neither is complete.",
