  "exact passive Caccioppoli ledger 给出 P^(2/3)+P fallback，并严格支付 P_R^M ≤ 1 的 small-payment regime。": "The exact passive Caccioppoli ledger gives a P^(2/3)+P fallback and rigorously pays the P_R^M ≤ 1 small-payment regime.",
