  "本站在 R0.75E Step 30 停止。下一命题必须控制正 signed cross-mode flux，或建立 difference-frequency decay / localized observability，且不得把 complex singleton 当作物理实场、不得把 finite witness 当作完整 trajectory。complete clock、fixed deletion、suitable-weak transfer、regularity 与 singularity 均未闭合。R0.75F/G/H 与其他后续工作未读取、未公开。": "This site stops at R0.75E Step 30. The next proposition must control the positive signed cross-mode flux or establish difference-frequency decay or localized observability. The complex singleton may not be treated as a physical real field, and the finite witness may not be treated as a complete trajectory. The complete clock, fixed deletion, suitable-weak transfer, regularity, and singularity remain unresolved. R0.75F/G/H and other later work were neither read nor published.",
  "带终端项和正确符号的 localized energy identity": "Localized energy identity with the endpoint and correct sign",
  "当 transport flux 为零时，time/Laplacian cutoff rows 与 spacetime Hölder 给出": "When the transport flux vanishes, the time/Laplacian cutoff rows and spacetime Hölder give",
  "定义目标归一化下的正 signed cross-mode flux": "Define the positive signed cross-mode flux at the target normalization",
  "冻结有限 witness": "Frozen finite witness",
  "冻结证据、文献边界与停止线": "Frozen evidence, literature boundary, and stop line",
  "对 frozen common-shear equation": "For the frozen common-shear equation",
  "该 witness 只验证 signed convolution 的代数归一化；它不是完整 spacetime trajectory，也不是 geometric collar 的有限模型。": "This witness verifies only the algebraic normalization of the signed convolution; it is neither a complete spacetime trajectory nor a finite model of the geometric collar.",
  "该结论不要求 \\(P_R^M\\le1\\)，也允许任意高 vertical frequency。R0.75D 的高 vertical-frequency zero mode 只阻止 horizontal-to-full Rayleigh inference，并不阻止目标耗散估计。": "The conclusion imposes no small-payment restriction and permits arbitrarily high vertical frequency. The high-vertical-frequency zero mode from R0.75D blocks only a horizontal-to-full Rayleigh inference, not the target dissipation estimate. \\(P_R^M\\le1\\)",
  "固定 physical collar cutoff 产生的 transport flux 只含不同 horizontal modes 之间的差频耦合。所有 diagonal terms \\(n=m\\) 精确消失。因此，对任意 admissible real horizontal zero mode，": "The fixed physical-collar cutoff creates transport flux only through difference-frequency coupling between distinct horizontal modes. Every diagonal term vanishes exactly. Therefore, for every admissible real horizontal zero mode, \\(n=m\\)",
  "结论先行：大背景不等于大通量，实零模已获得全支付闭合": "Conclusion first: a large background is not a large flux, and the real zero mode is closed for all payment",
  "精确的 horizontal difference-frequency identity": "Exact horizontal difference-frequency identity",
  "零通量扇区的 pure two-thirds payment": "Pure two-thirds payment on a zero-flux sector",
  "令 \\(\\xi=\\xi_k^R(x_1,x_2,x_3)\\)，并保留 frozen time cutoff \\(\\eta_R\\)。乘以 \\(\\eta_R\\xi\\overline F\\)、积分并取实部，得到": "Let the displayed function be the spatial cutoff and retain the frozen time cutoff. Multiply by the localized conjugate field, integrate, and take the real part to obtain \\(\\xi=\\xi_k^R(x_1,x_2,x_3)\\) \\(\\eta_R\\) \\(\\eta_R\\xi\\overline F\\)",
  "任意实场的精确剩余 gate": "Exact remaining gate for arbitrary real fields",
  "任意实场所需的下一命题是": "The next proposition required for arbitrary real fields is",
  "实 horizontal zero mode 在任意 payment 下已闭合；complex singleton 仅是代数诊断；任意实场的 signed cross-mode aggregation 仍 OPEN。NO NOVELTY CLAIM. NOT CLAY.": "The real horizontal zero mode is closed for all payment; the complex singleton is only an algebraic diagnostic; signed cross-mode aggregation for arbitrary real fields remains OPEN. NO NOVELTY CLAIM. NOT CLAY.",
  "特别地，\\(S=\\{0\\}\\) 是真实可容许的不变子空间；此时 \\(|F|^2\\) 与 \\(x_2\\) 无关，周期积分直接消去 \\(\\partial_2\\xi\\)。这包括任意高 vertical sine modes。": "In particular, the zero support sector is a genuinely admissible invariant subspace. The squared amplitude is independent of the horizontal coordinate, so periodic integration directly cancels the cutoff derivative. This includes arbitrarily high vertical sine modes. \\(S=\\{0\\}\\) \\(|F|^2\\) \\(x_2\\) \\(\\partial_2\\xi\\)",
  "同时由直接 Laurent multiplication 与 ordered off-diagonal sum 得到": "Both direct Laurent multiplication and the ordered off-diagonal sum give",
  "现实性边界：complex singleton 不是物理实场": "Reality boundary: a complex singleton is not a physical real field",
  "研究笔记 R0.75E · Step 30 · HORIZONTAL CROSS-MODE FLUX": "Research note R0.75E · Step 30 · HORIZONTAL CROSS-MODE FLUX",
  "以 \\(\\Xi_\\ell(x_3)=\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}\\widehat\\xi_\\ell(x_1,x_3)\\,dx_1\\) 表示 cutoff 的 \\(x_1\\)-平均，transport flux 精确写成": "Using the x1-average of the cutoff coefficient, the transport flux has the exact representation \\(\\Xi_\\ell(x_3)=\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}\\widehat\\xi_\\ell(x_1,x_3)\\,dx_1\\) \\(x_1\\)",
  "因 multiplier \\(i(m-n)\\) 在 \\(n=m\\) 时为零，通量是纯 off-diagonal difference-frequency quantity。大 background cubic atom \\(p_b\\) 本身不能推出大 localized transport flux。": "Because the multiplier vanishes on the diagonal, the flux is a purely off-diagonal difference-frequency quantity. A large background cubic atom alone cannot imply a large localized transport flux. \\(i(m-n)\\) \\(n=m\\) \\(p_b\\)",
  "因为 \\(b=b(t,x_3)\\) 与 \\(x_2\\) 无关，每个 horizontal mode 独立演化：": "Because the shear is independent of the horizontal coordinate, every horizontal mode evolves independently: \\(b=b(t,x_3)\\) \\(x_2\\)",
  "又因 \\(L^{2/3}\\omega^{1/3}=L^{2/3}\\exp[-(c_\\gamma/12)L^2]\\to0\\)，故充分大的 \\(L\\) 上得到全支付 \\(P^{2/3}\\) bound；无需 R0.75D 的 interaction hypothesis。": "The mixed coefficient tends to zero exponentially, so sufficiently large L yields the all-payment P^(2/3) bound without the R0.75D interaction hypothesis. \\(L^{2/3}\\omega^{1/3}=L^{2/3}\\exp[-(c_\\gamma/12)L^2]\\to0\\) \\(L\\) \\(P^{2/3}\\)",
  "右侧 transport sign 为正；终端 endpoint 非负，只能在上界中丢弃，不能暗中等同于 payment row。": "The transport sign on the right is positive; the terminal endpoint is nonnegative and may be discarded only in an upper bound, not silently identified with a payment row.",
  "则 exact reduction 为": "The exact reduction is",
  "则所有 off-diagonal summands 消失，\\(\\mathcal T_\\xi(F,b)=0\\)。这是充分的 spectral-orthogonality condition，不声称 generic radial collar 对非平凡实支撑都满足它。": "Then every off-diagonal summand vanishes and the transport flux is zero. This is a sufficient spectral-orthogonality condition; it is not claimed for every nontrivial real support with a generic radial collar. \\(\\mathcal T_\\xi(F,b)=0\\)",
  "这一 signed phase-mixing / difference-frequency gate 尚未证明。general real \\(\\pm n\\) pairs、cross-mode aggregation、cutoff Fourier tails 与 localized observability 都保持 OPEN。": "This signed phase-mixing and difference-frequency gate is not proved. General real paired modes, cross-mode aggregation, cutoff Fourier tails, and localized observability all remain OPEN. \\(\\pm n\\)",
