  "时间窗长为 \\(O(R^2)\\)，collar 体积为 \\(O(L^2R^3)\\)，且 \\(|b|\\le C R^{-2}\\)，所以": "The time window has length O(R^2), the collar has volume O(L^2R^3), and the calibrated shear satisfies the displayed bound, so \\(O(R^2)\\) \\(O(L^2R^3)\\) \\(|b|\\le C R^{-2}\\)",
  "数值上有余量的目标现在可以精确写成": "The numerically comfortable target can now be written exactly as",
  "所以 \\(R^{1/3}\\) gain 在条件上足够。代入 \\(\\alpha=1/4\\) 则为": "Thus an R^(1/3) gain is conditionally sufficient. Substituting alpha=1/4 gives \\(R^{1/3}\\) \\(\\alpha=1/4\\)",
  "所以 \\(R^{1/4}\\) 对这条 reduction 不充分；这不是反例，也不排除其他可能的证明机制。": "Thus R^(1/4) is insufficient for this reduction; this is not a counterexample and does not exclude another proof mechanism. \\(R^{1/4}\\)",
  "相对于完整 \\(O(R^2)\\) window，这只是 \\(O(R)\\) fraction，形式上对应 \\(\\beta=1\\)、\\(\\alpha=1/3\\)。它解释 (G.3) 的 favorable margin，却不证明 arbitrary diffusing and interfering passive field 满足 (G.18)。": "Relative to the full O(R^2) window, this is an O(R) fraction and formally corresponds to beta=1 and alpha=1/3. It explains the favorable margin in G.3 but does not prove G.18 for an arbitrary diffusing and interfering passive field. \\(O(R^2)\\) \\(O(R)\\) \\(\\beta=1\\) \\(\\alpha=1/3\\)",
