  "允许的下一结果只有三类：证明 (G.24)，证明某个 \\(\\alpha>\\alpha_*\\) 的较弱 (G.1)，或构造 exact frozen-family sequence 使 \\(R^{-\\alpha_*}\\mathscr C_R\\) 无界。本节三者都没有建立。": "The next result may take one of three forms: prove G.24, prove the weaker G.1 for any alpha above alpha star, or construct an exact frozen-family sequence for which the scaled correlation is unbounded. None is established here. \\(\\alpha>\\alpha_*\\) \\(R^{-\\alpha_*}\\mathscr C_R\\)",
  "在 outer collar cylinder 上定义": "On the outer collar cylinder, define",
  "在 passive-field amplitude scaling 下不变；signed numerator 为零时约定 \\(\\mathscr C_R=0\\)。缺失的小因子必须来自 sign、phase、dynamics 或 geometry，不能来自 passive amplitude 的重新归一化。R0.75E 的 horizontal zero sector 恰有 \\(\\mathscr C_R=0\\)。": "It is invariant under passive-field amplitude scaling; set the correlation ratio to zero when the signed numerator vanishes. The missing small factor must come from sign, phase, dynamics, or geometry, not from rescaling passive amplitude. The horizontal zero sector of R0.75E has zero correlation ratio exactly. \\(\\mathscr C_R=0\\) \\(\\mathscr C_R=0\\)",
  "在等号处指数率为零，但 \\(L^{2/3}\\) 仍增长；因此对这个未精炼估计，(G.2) 必须保持 strict。与 R0.75E (E.22) 合并只得到条件蕴含": "At equality the exponential rate is zero, but the L^(2/3) factor still grows. Strictness in G.2 is therefore essential for this unrefined estimate. Combined with R0.75E E.22, this yields only the conditional implication \\(L^{2/3}\\)",
  "则 \\(\\alpha=\\beta/3\\)，阈值等价于": "Then alpha=beta/3, and the threshold is equivalent to \\(\\alpha=\\beta/3\\)",
  "则精确充分阈值为": "Then the exact sufficient threshold is",
  "这只是一条针对 (G.1) 的 conditional sufficient threshold：本节没有证明任何正的 \\(R^\\alpha\\) gain，也没有证明这是所有可能路线的必要条件，更没有在阈值处或阈值以下构造 counterexample。": "This is only a conditional sufficient threshold for G.1. It proves no positive gain, does not establish necessity for all conceivable proofs, and constructs no counterexample at or below the threshold. \\(R^\\alpha\\)",
  "正增益、G.24 与 E.24 仍 OPEN；NO NOVELTY CLAIM. NOT CLAY.": "The positive gain, G.24, and E.24 remain OPEN. NO NOVELTY CLAIM. NOT CLAY.",
  "状态 · R0.75G STEP 32": "Status · R0.75G STEP 32",
