  "R0.75F 已证明 direct modal phase substitution 只会重建同一个 localized energy ledger；R0.75G 因而把剩余问题改写成一个可证伪的定量门槛。若独立的动力学论证能够证明": "R0.75F proves that direct modal phase substitution only reconstructs the same localized energy ledger. R0.75G therefore rewrites the remaining problem as a falsifiable quantitative threshold. If an independent dynamical argument proves",
