  "本站在 R0.75S Step 44 停止。S 只证明 complete-clock physical-collar payment 对一个 real constant-drift harmonic 的全频率估计；它不适用于 Fourier projection、两个及以上 harmonics、nonconstant shear、arbitrary vertical structure 或 arbitrary-field E.24。Version-M admissibility/aggregation、fixed deletion、suitable-weak transfer、regularity 与 singularity 仍开放。后续工作未授权、未读取、未公开。": "This site stops at R0.75S Step 44. S proves a full-frequency complete-clock physical-collar payment only for one real constant-drift harmonic. It does not apply to a Fourier projection, two or more harmonics, nonconstant shear, arbitrary vertical structure, or arbitrary-field E.24. Version-M admissibility and aggregation, fixed deletion, suitable-weak transfer, regularity, and singularity remain open. Later work was not authorized, read, or published.",
  "上，每个整数频率、任意振幅、相位和常 shear 的 single real harmonic 都满足 physical radial-collar 付款。证明用 exact radial reduction、moving-phase node lemma 与 high-frequency Fourier decay 覆盖全部频率；它不是 multimode 或 arbitrary-field 估计。": "On it, every integer frequency and arbitrary amplitude, phase, and constant shear satisfy the physical radial-collar payment. The proof covers all frequencies through exact radial reduction, a moving-phase node lemma, and high-frequency Fourier decay. It is not a multimode or arbitrary-field estimate.",
