  "R0.70A–R0.72Q 的 69 节已公开；45 节按当前 formal-figure 合同完整封存；24 节旧档仍待回补。": "Sixty-nine releases from R0.70A through R0.72Q are public; 45 are fully sealed under the current formal-figure contract, while 24 legacy archives still require backfill.",
  "R0.70A–R0.72Q 已公开版本": "Published releases from R0.70A through R0.72Q",
  "R0.72L 保留 actual ledger；R0.72M 给出零扩散 action-poor reference，R0.72N 才证明耗散一载波链不属于该安全分支。R0.72O 完成物理回填，R0.72P 在 fixed real-collinear static-phase 1:2 正类上关闭完整传播门。": "R0.72L retains the actual ledger; R0.72M gives a zero-diffusion action-poor reference, and R0.72N then proves that the dissipative one-carrier chain does not belong to that safe branch. R0.72O completes physical reinsertion, and R0.72P closes the full propagation gate on the fixed real-collinear static-phase 1:2 positive class.",
  "R0.72L–R0.72Q · strong-coupling、物理回填与相位鲁棒 shape gate": "R0.72L–R0.72Q · strong coupling, physical reinsertion, and the phase-robust shape gate",
  "R0.72P 的 ED 常数对声明的 \\(\\lambda\\) 区间一致；物理比较常数仍可依赖固定的 \\(\\lambda_->0\\)。R0.72Q 的 ED 只覆盖任意静态相位的热衰减路径，任意时变相位与任意快速变化振幅未证明。它的物理 cross-cubic/window 推论还要求 active modes 满足固定 \\(|\\beta_m|\\ge\\beta_->0\\)，隐常数依赖 \\((M,\\beta_-)\\)，不在 \\(\\beta_-\\downarrow0\\) 时一致。": "The enhanced-dissipation constants in R0.72P are uniform over the stated \\(\\lambda\\) interval, while the physical comparison constants may still depend on the fixed floor \\(\\lambda_->0\\). Enhanced dissipation in R0.72Q covers only the heat-decay path with arbitrary static phases; arbitrary time-dependent phases and arbitrarily fast amplitude variation are not proved. Its physical cross-cubic and window corollary additionally requires the active modes to satisfy a fixed floor \\(|\\beta_m|\\ge\\beta_->0\\); the implicit constants depend on \\((M,\\beta_-)\\) and are not uniform as \\(\\beta_-\\downarrow0\\).",
  "R0.72Q 的 fixed-\\(M\\) arbitrary-static-phase theorem：\\(Q_2\\le1/2\\) 保证恰有两个临界点；对声明热路径，物理 shear 在 \\(0\\le y\\le1\\) 的正式 shape 常数为 \\((\\pi/12,81,36)\\)；1:2 caustic 给出尖锐 phase-uniform disk 半径 \\(1/4\\)。": "The R0.72Q fixed-\\(M\\) arbitrary-static-phase theorem: \\(Q_2\\le1/2\\) guarantees exactly two critical points; along the stated heat path and on \\(0\\le y\\le1\\), the physical shear has formal shape constants \\((\\pi/12,81,36)\\), and the 1:2 caustic gives the sharp phase-uniform disk radius \\(1/4\\).",
  "R0.72Q 的点态 shape theorem 覆盖固定 \\(M\\)、任意静态相位与 \\(Q_2\\le1/2\\) 的 dominant-first-harmonic cone；ED 只对声明的固定相位热衰减路径成立。任意时变相位、任意快速变化振幅、增长 \\(M\\)、一般 carrier 集和 Clay 正式问题保持开放。": "The pointwise R0.72Q shape theorem covers the dominant-first-harmonic cone with fixed \\(M\\), arbitrary static phases, and \\(Q_2\\le1/2\\); enhanced dissipation is proved only for the stated fixed-phase heat-decay path. Arbitrary time-dependent phases, arbitrarily fast amplitude variation, growing \\(M\\), general carrier sets, and the formal Clay problem remain open.",
