  "A2 局部模型已经精确化，目标耗散估计仍未建立": "The A2 local model has been refined, but the target dissipation estimate has not yet been established.",
  "drift-only 模型有精确 \\(a^2T^5/720\\) 与 physical \\(T\\asymp|kA|^{-2/5}\\nu^{-3/5}\\)；combined \\(aSX+bX^3\\) 对固定 \\(f\\) 有 persistent-form identity。Viola 校准的 quadratic half-scale 属于错误模型。直接 CDZE black box 只到 \\(q=6/7\\)，这些结论都没有闭合 evolving-solution block contraction。": "The drift-only model has exact \\(a^2T^5/720\\) and physical \\(T\\asymp|kA|^{-2/5}\\nu^{-3/5}\\); combined \\(aSX+bX^3\\) has persistent-form identity against fixed \\(f\\). The quadratic half-scale calibrated by Viola is an incorrect model. Directly CDZE black box only to \\(q=6/7\\), these conclusions are not closed evolving-solution block contraction.",
