  "R0.70A–R0.72T 的 72 节已公开；48 节按当前 formal-figure 合同完整封存；24 节旧档仍待回补。": "The 72 releases from R0.70A through R0.72T are public; 48 are fully sealed under the current formal-figure contract, while 24 legacy archives remain in the backfill queue.",
  "R0.70A–R0.72T 已公开版本": "Public releases from R0.70A through R0.72T",
  "R0.72T · A2 spacetime normal form 与 nonautonomous observability 缺口": "R0.72T · A2 spacetime normal form and nonautonomous observability gap",
  "R0.72T 把 R0.72S 的 pure-second collision 积分回速度芽，并用 heat-polynomial basis 固定 exact spacetime expansion。四项联立唯一给出 \\(X=\\kappa^{1/5}x\\)、\\(S=\\kappa^{2/5}d\\) 与主模型 \\(H_3=X^3+6SX\\)。": "R0.72T integrates the pure-second collision of R0.72S back into the velocity bud and fixes the exact spacetime expansion on a heat-polynomial basis. The four combinations only give \\(X=\\kappa^{1/5}x\\), \\(S=\\kappa^{2/5}d\\) and the main model \\(H_3=X^3+6SX\\).",
  "R0.72T 的 A2 spacetime ledger：exact derivative-to-primitive correction、heat-polynomial germ 与唯一 \\(1/5,2/5\\) scaling 已闭合；drift-only \\(1/720\\)、inviscid mixing、CDZE \\(6/7\\) barrier 和 weighted step-five brackets 已核对。": "R0.72T's A2 spacetime ledger: exact derivative-to-primitive correction, heat-polynomial germ and only \\(1/5,2/5\\) scaling are closed; drift-only \\(1/720\\), inviscid mixing, CDZE \\(6/7\\) barrier and weighted step-five brackets are checked.",
  "R0.72T 附图": "R0.72T figure",
  "R0.72T 完成的是 exact local model 与明确负结果。它没有证明 block contraction、periodic transfer、一般三维 continuation 或 Clay 正式问题。": "R0.72T completes the exact local model with clear negative results. It does not prove block contraction, periodic transfer, general three-dimensional continuation, or Clay formal problems.",
