  "回顾截止节点：R0.72U": "Recap endpoint: R0.72U",
  "回顾截止时公开笔记：171": "Public notes at recap cutoff: 171",
  "截至 R0.72U，没有一般三维 continuation criterion，也没有证明有限时破裂或全局光滑性；不能把 111 个节点或 73 个公开版本解释成 Clay 问题完成比例。": "Through R0.72U, there is no general three-dimensional continuation criterion and no proof of finite-time breakdown or global smoothness. The 111 nodes or 73 public releases must not be interpreted as a completion percentage for the Clay problem.",
  "局部模型 observability 已闭合；全直线 transfer 是新的明确缺口": "Local-model observability is closed; whole-line transfer is the new explicit gap",
  "累计回顾 · R0.61–R0.72U · 2026-08-28": "Cumulative recap · R0.61–R0.72U · 2026-08-28",
  "目标是把 fixed-chart observability 延伸到全直线：控制 chart 外 tails、local energy boundary flux 与 spatial cutoff commutators。whole-line block estimate 闭合后，才进入 periodic exact-heat-path transfer。": "The target is to extend fixed-chart observability to the whole line by controlling tails outside the chart, local-energy boundary flux, and spatial-cutoff commutators. Transfer to the exact periodic heat path is deferred until the whole-line block estimate is closed.",
  "三十个阶段、111 个节点：从约化递推到 center-uniform local observability。": "Thirty stages and 111 nodes: from reduced recurrences to center-uniform local observability.",
  "收录节点：111": "Nodes included: 111",
  "完整节点索引保留历史编号；状态标签只描述证据类型。": "The complete node index retains the historical numbering; status labels describe only the evidence type.",
  "新的严格增量是 uncut fixed-chart graph coercivity、center uniformity 与 local actual-solution observability。whole-line tails、boundary flux、periodic transfer 仍开放。": "The new rigorous increment is uncut fixed-chart graph coercivity, center uniformity, and local observability for actual solutions. Whole-line tails, boundary flux, and periodic transfer remain open.",
  "这页接在 R0.00–R0.60 的阶段回顾之后，保留 R0.61 到 R0.72U 的 111 个研究节点。R0.72U 排除 spatial-cutoff 平凡化，并闭合未截断、center-uniform、fixed-chart graph coercivity 与 local actual-solution observability。节点状态描述证据类型，不把局部模型结果写成全局问题已经解决。": "This page follows the R0.00–R0.60 phase recap and retains the 111 research nodes from R0.61 through R0.72U. R0.72U excludes spatial-cutoff trivialization and closes uncut, center-uniform fixed-chart graph coercivity together with local observability for actual solutions. Node status describes the evidence type and does not misstate a local-model result as resolution of the global problem.",
  "bounded centers 用 compactness；escaping centers 用两个 scalar moments、保留端点的 \\(B'\\overline A\\) identity 与 scalar \\(H^1\\) trace inequality。常数对 interval center 一致，并直接给 actual solutions 的 local observability。": "Bounded centers are handled by compactness; escaping centers are handled by two scalar moments, the endpoint-retaining \\(B'\\overline A\\) identity, and the scalar \\(H^1\\) trace inequality. The constant is uniform in the interval center and directly gives local observability for actual solutions.",
  "R0.00–R0.60 的内容保留在上一份阶段回顾中。R0.70A–R0.72U 的 73 个版本已经公开，其中 49 个满足当前 formal-figure 完整封存合同。公开和封存不表示 Clay 问题已经解决。": "The R0.00–R0.60 material remains in the preceding phase recap. The 73 releases from R0.70A through R0.72U are public, of which 49 satisfy the current complete formal-figure archive contract. Publication and sealing do not mean that the Clay problem has been solved.",
  "R0.60 之后的路线分成三十个阶段": "The route after R0.60 is divided into thirty stages",
  "R0.60 之后的研究回顾：完整覆盖 R0.61 到 R0.72U 的 111 个节点；最新一节闭合 fixed-chart observability。": "Research recap after R0.60: complete coverage of the 111 nodes from R0.61 through R0.72U; the latest section closes fixed-chart observability.",
