  "R0.70A–R0.72U 已公开版本": "Public releases from R0.70A through R0.72U",
  "R0.72U 的 local observability：literal spatial cutoff 是 Poincare-trivial；uncut fixed-chart graph estimate 与 local actual-solution observability 已对 interval center 一致闭合。": "R0.72U local observability: the literal spatial cutoff is Poincaré-trivial; the uncut fixed-chart graph estimate and local observability for actual solutions are closed uniformly in the interval center.",
  "R0.72U 附图": "R0.72U figure",
  "R0.72U 完成的是线性 bounded-chart theorem。wholeLineBlockContraction、periodicTransfer、一般三维 continuation 与 Clay 正式问题仍开放。": "R0.72U completes a linear bounded-chart theorem. wholeLineBlockContraction, periodicTransfer, general three-dimensional continuation, and the formal Clay problem remain open.",
  "R0.72U 先证明原字面 spatial-cutoff target 只是普通 Poincare inequality，随后改成不设 temporal cutoff、也不设 spatial zero trace 的 fixed-chart graph estimate。": "R0.72U first proves that the original literal spatial-cutoff target is only an ordinary Poincaré inequality, then replaces it with a fixed-chart graph estimate having neither a temporal cutoff nor a zero spatial trace.",
