  "01 · 三十一个研究阶段": "01 · Thirty-one research phases",
  "02 · 112 节完整索引": "02 · Complete index of 112 notes",
  "保留 R0.72U 历史回顾": "Retain the R0.72U historical recap",
  "不能把 112 个节点或 74 个公开版本解释成 Clay 问题完成比例。严格增量是 whole-line graph theorem、另行构造的 all-L2 energy evolution 与 fixed-block contraction。": "The 112 nodes or 74 public releases cannot be interpreted as a completion percentage for the Clay problem. The strict increment is the whole-line graph theorem, the separately constructed all-L2 energy evolution, and fixed-block contraction.",
