  "打开最新节点 R0.72V": "Open the latest node R0.72V",
  "对 \\((a,b)\\) 一致的 unit-chart theorem、spatial translation 与 nonhomogeneous \\(H^{-1}\\) direct sum 给 wholeLineGraphCoercivity=CLOSED。": "The unit-chart theorem uniform in \\((a,b)\\), spatial translation, and the nonhomogeneous \\(H^{-1}\\) direct sum yield wholeLineGraphCoercivity=CLOSED.",
