  "另行构造的 all-L2 energy evolution 给 wholeLineBlockContraction=CLOSED；graph membership alone 不提供时间迹或能量律。": "The separately constructed all-L2 energy evolution yields wholeLineBlockContraction=CLOSED; graph membership alone supplies neither time traces nor an energy law.",
  "三十一个阶段、112 个节点：从约化递推到 exact cubic whole-line contraction。": "Thirty-one phases and 112 nodes: from reduced recurrences to exact cubic whole-line contraction.",
  "收录节点：112": "Nodes included: 112",
  "先证明与 collision rescaling 兼容的 weighted whole-line absorption，再检查 periodic exact-heat-path transfer。": "First prove weighted whole-line absorption compatible with the collision rescaling, then examine transfer to the exact periodic heat path.",
  "这页接在 R0.00–R0.60 的阶段回顾之后，保留 R0.61 到 R0.72V 的 112 个研究节点。R0.72V 以 coefficient-uniform unit charts 和 nonhomogeneous H^-1 direct sum 闭合 exact cubic linear scalar model 的 whole-line graph theorem；另行构造的 all-L2 energy evolution 给出 fixed-block contraction。节点状态只描述声明范围内的证据，不把线性标量结果写成 periodic、nonlinear 或 Clay 结论。": "This page follows the R0.00–R0.60 phase recap and retains 112 research nodes from R0.61 through R0.72V. R0.72V closes the whole-line graph theorem for the exact cubic linear scalar model using coefficient-uniform unit charts and a nonhomogeneous H^-1 direct sum; a separately constructed all-L2 energy evolution yields fixed-block contraction. Node statuses describe evidence only within the declared scope and do not turn the linear scalar result into a periodic, nonlinear, or Clay conclusion.",
  "exact cubic scalar collision block 已闭合；一般三维问题没有被外推": "The exact cubic scalar collision block is closed; the result is not extrapolated to the general three-dimensional problem",
  "R0.00–R0.60 的内容保留在上一份阶段回顾中。R0.70A–R0.72V 的 74 个版本已经公开，其中 50 个满足当前 formal-figure 完整封存合同。公开和封存不表示 Clay 问题已经解决。": "The R0.00–R0.60 material remains in the previous phase recap. Of the 74 releases from R0.70A through R0.72V, 50 satisfy the current formal-figure sealing contract. Publication and sealing do not mean the Clay problem is solved.",
  "R0.60 之后的路线分成三十一个阶段": "The post-R0.60 route is divided into thirty-one phases",
  "R0.60 之后的研究回顾：完整覆盖 R0.61 到 R0.72V 的 112 个节点；最新一节闭合 exact cubic scalar whole-line graph theorem 与 fixed-block contraction。": "Post-R0.60 research recap: complete coverage of 112 nodes from R0.61 through R0.72V; the latest section closes the exact cubic scalar whole-line graph theorem and fixed-block contraction.",
