  "保留 R0.72V 历史回顾": "Retain the R0.72V historical recap",
  "必须保留 physical Fourier normalization、scalar gauges、energy factors 和 later row summation constants，完成 pre/post-collision intervals 的 exact time concatenation。": "The physical Fourier normalization, scalar gauges, energy factors, and constants needed for later row summation must be preserved to complete exact time concatenation of the pre/post-collision intervals.",
  "不能把 113 个节点或 75 个公开版本解释成 Clay 问题完成比例。严格增量是对 global termwise absorption 的 no-go，以及 full analytic tail 下的 exact periodic graph theorem 与 one-block contraction。": "The 113 nodes or 75 public releases cannot be interpreted as a completion percentage for the Clay problem. The strict increment is the no-go result for global termwise absorption, together with the exact periodic graph theorem and one-block contraction under the full analytic tail.",
