  "这页接在 R0.00–R0.60 的阶段回顾之后，完整保留 R0.61 到 R0.72X 的 114 个研究节点。R0.69P 以后，路线从局部证书、exact A2 germ、whole-line 与 periodic scalar block，推进到固定物理紧集内的 all-center A2 path；Bloch-uniformity 只在 A2 rate 上闭合，A1--A2--A1 fast history 只声明 periodic representative beta=0。forced transfer、完整线性化系统、nonlinear Navier--Stokes 与 Clay 都没有被外推。": "This page follows the R0.00–R0.60 phase recap and retains all 114 research nodes from R0.61 through R0.72X. After R0.69P, the route advances from local certificates, the exact A2 germ, and whole-line and periodic scalar blocks to the all-center A2 path on fixed physical compact sets; Bloch uniformity closes only at the A2 rate, while the A1--A2--A1 fast history is stated only for the periodic representative beta=0. Forced transfer, the complete linearized system, nonlinear Navier--Stokes, and Clay are not extrapolated.",
  "A2 任意起点与 beta=0 fast history 分层闭合；完整三维系统没有外推": "Arbitrary-start A2 and the beta=0 fast history close in separate layers; no extrapolation to the complete three-dimensional system is made",
  "allCenterExactFamilyGraphCoercivity、allStartExactPathSemigroup、allStartIntegratedA2Scale、uniformTwistedPeriodicGraph 与 strongRowDirectSumNoCountLoss 均为 CLOSED。": "allCenterExactFamilyGraphCoercivity, allStartExactPathSemigroup, allStartIntegratedA2Scale, uniformTwistedPeriodicGraph, and strongRowDirectSumNoCountLoss are CLOSED.",
  "R0.00–R0.60 的内容保留在上一份阶段回顾中。R0.70A–R0.72X 的 76 个版本已公开，其中 52 个满足当前 formal-figure 完整封存合同。公开和封存不表示 Clay 问题已经解决。": "R0.00–R0.60 remains in the preceding phase recap. Of the 76 releases from R0.70A through R0.72X, 52 satisfy the current formal-figure sealing contract. Publication and sealing do not mean that the Clay problem is solved.",
