  "该双谐波 heat path 上 complete linearized row 的 viscous-rate finite transient 已闭合；A2 与 nonlinear 门仍未闭合": "On this two-harmonic heat path, the viscous-rate finite transient for the complete linearized row is closed; the A2 and nonlinear gates remain open",
