  "R0.70A–R0.73C 的 81 节已公开；57 节完整封存；24 节旧档待回补。": "The 81 sections from R0.70A through R0.73C are public; 57 are fully sealed; 24 legacy archives await backfill.",
  "R0.70A–R0.73C 已公开版本": "Public releases from R0.70A through R0.73C",
  "R0.73C 闭合 exact cubic neutral spectrum 与一条 infinite-dimensional frozen Rayleigh instability；它同时把 viscous fast-time transfer 保留为 OPEN，把 super-polynomial complete-row no-go 保留为 CONDITIONAL。": "R0.73C closes the exact cubic neutral spectrum and one infinite-dimensional frozen Rayleigh instability; it simultaneously keeps viscous fast-time transfer OPEN and the super-polynomial complete-row no-go CONDITIONAL.",
  "R0.73C 附图": "R0.73C figure",
  "R0.73C 证书": "R0.73C certificate",
  "R0.73D 研究 vanishing-viscosity Evans/Riesz persistence": "R0.73D studies vanishing-viscosity Evans/Riesz persistence",
  "01 · 三十九个研究阶段": "01 · Thirty-nine research phases",
  "02 · 120 节完整索引": "02 · Complete index of 120 sections",
  "保留 R0.73C 历史回顾": "Preserve the historical R0.73C recap",
  "不能把 120 个节点或 82 个公开版本解释成 Clay 完成比例。R0.73D 的严格增量是 fixed-cluster operator theorem，不是有限矩阵外推；一般 abstract persistence 已有 Shvydkoy--Friedlander 先例。本节对后续快时间路线有必要价值，但仍只覆盖一条冻结二维线性行。": "The 120 nodes or 82 public releases cannot be interpreted as a completion percentage for Clay. The rigorous R0.73D increment is a fixed-cluster operator theorem, not an extrapolation from finite matrices; general abstract persistence already has the Shvydkoy--Friedlander precedent. This section is necessary for the subsequent fast-time route, but still covers only one frozen two-dimensional linear row.",
  "查看 R0.73D 正式证书": "View the formal R0.73D certificate",
  "查看 R0.73D 证明": "View the R0.73D proof",
  "查看有限诊断与监控记录": "View the finite diagnostics and monitoring records",
  "打开最新节点 R0.73D": "Open the latest node R0.73D",
  "冻结不稳定与静态黏性持续都已成为定理；全局动力学仍缺补空间控制": "Frozen instability and static viscous persistence are now both theorems; global dynamics still lacks complementary-space control",
  "回顾截止节点：R0.73D": "Recap endpoint: R0.73D",
  "回顾截止时公开笔记：180": "Public notes at the recap endpoint: 180",
  "减去解析基础 resolvent 后，紧 sandwich 在围道上一致按算子范数收敛，因此 fixedClusterRieszProjectionNormConvergence、fixedClusterAlgebraicMultiplicityPreserved 与 fixedClusterEigenvaluesConverge 全部为 CLOSED。": "After subtracting the analytic base resolvent, the compact sandwich converges uniformly in operator norm on the contour; therefore fixedClusterRieszProjectionNormConvergence, fixedClusterAlgebraicMultiplicityPreserved, and fixedClusterEigenvaluesConverge are all CLOSED.",
  "累计回顾 · R0.61–R0.73D · 2026-08-30": "Cumulative recap · R0.61–R0.73D · 2026-08-30",
  "三十九个阶段、120 个节点：从约化递推和环带排除到认证 Rayleigh 谱簇的静态黏性持续。": "Thirty-nine phases, 120 nodes: from reduced recurrences and annular exclusion to static viscous persistence of the certified Rayleigh spectral cluster.",
  "收录节点：120": "Nodes included: 120",
  "先在固定右半平面带中排除围道外谱污染并控制 complement semigroup，再检查缓慢 profile drift 的 Volterra 传递。": "First rule out spectral pollution outside the contours on a fixed right-half-plane strip and control the complement semigroup, then examine Volterra transfer under slow profile drift.",
  "一般谱持续先例属于 Shvydkoy--Friedlander；本节不作首创声明。单性、显式阈值、全右半平面 complement、moving profile、fast time、完整 OS--Squire、nonlinear 与 Clay 保持 OPEN。": "The general spectral-persistence precedent is due to Shvydkoy--Friedlander; this section makes no priority claim. Simplicity, explicit thresholds, the full right-half-plane complement, moving profile, fast time, complete OS--Squire, nonlinear, and Clay remain OPEN.",
  "在固定 \\(d=0,\\gamma=1/2\\) 行上，exact kinetic-space isometry、紧 Fourier commutator、耗散基础 resolvent 与 Fredholm 因子闭合 fixedContourResolventUniform。": "On the fixed \\(d=0,\\gamma=1/2\\) row, the exact kinetic-space isometry, compact Fourier commutator, dissipative base resolvent, and Fredholm factor close fixedContourResolventUniform.",
  "这页保留 R0.61 到 R0.73D 的全部 120 个节点。R0.61–R0.69W 从约化递推走到严格环带排除；R0.70A–R0.71Z 检查移动尺度、临界账本、内部 entry 与 complete-root 边界；R0.72A–R0.73B 处理 strong coupling、critical log、碰撞几何与完整线性 Fourier--Leray 行；R0.73C 认证无穷维冻结 Rayleigh 不稳定；R0.73D 再闭合固定谱簇的静态小黏性持续。一般三维 nonlinear 与 Clay 没有被外推。": "This page retains all 120 nodes from R0.61 through R0.73D. R0.61–R0.69W progresses from reduced recurrences to rigorous annular exclusion; R0.70A–R0.71Z examines moving scales, critical ledgers, internal entry, and complete-root boundaries; R0.72A–R0.73B treats strong coupling, critical log, collision geometry, and the complete linear Fourier--Leray row; R0.73C certifies an infinite-dimensional frozen Rayleigh instability; R0.73D then closes static small-viscosity persistence of the fixed spectral cluster. No extrapolation is made to general three-dimensional nonlinear or Clay.",
  "逐节笔记、证明、证书、有限诊断、附图和历史回顾": "Section-by-section notes, proof, certificates, finite diagnostics, figures, and historical recaps",
  "continuum theorem 来自 compact-Fredholm 解析证明。Fourier cutoff 只做诊断和附图，不证明无穷维谱持续。": "The continuum theorem comes from a compact-Fredholm analytic proof. Fourier cutoff is used only for diagnostics and figures and does not prove infinite-dimensional spectral persistence.",
  "R0.00–R0.60 保留在上一份阶段回顾。R0.70A–R0.73D 的 82 个版本已经公开，其中 58 个满足当前完整封存合同，24 个历史版本仍欠 formal-figure 回补。公开和封存不表示 Clay 问题已经解决。": "R0.00–R0.60 remains in the preceding phase recap. The 82 releases from R0.70A through R0.73D are public; 58 satisfy the current complete-sealing contract, while 24 historical releases still await formal-figure backfill. Publication and sealing do not mean that the Clay problem is solved.",
  "R0.60 之后的路线分成三十九个阶段": "The route after R0.60 is divided into thirty-nine phases",
  "R0.60 之后的完整研究回顾：R0.61 到 R0.73D 共 120 个节点；最新一节闭合认证 Rayleigh 谱簇的静态小黏性持续。": "Complete research recap after R0.60: 120 nodes from R0.61 through R0.73D; the latest section closes static small-viscosity persistence of the certified Rayleigh spectral cluster.",
