  "R0.70A–R0.73D 的 82 节已公开；58 节完整封存；24 节旧档待回补。": "From R0.70A through R0.73D, 82 sections are public; 58 sections are fully sealed; 24 legacy archives await backfill.",
  "R0.70A–R0.73D 已公开版本": "Published releases from R0.70A through R0.73D",
  "R0.73D 闭合认证 Rayleigh 谱簇的 static vanishing-viscosity persistence、Riesz 投影算子范数收敛、总代数重数保持与簇特征值收敛；补空间和非自治传递仍开放。": "R0.73D closes, for the certified Rayleigh spectral cluster, static vanishing-viscosity persistence, operator-norm convergence of the Riesz projections, preservation of total algebraic multiplicity, and convergence of the cluster eigenvalues; the complement and nonautonomous transfer remain open.",
