  "R0.73D 证书": "R0.73D certificate",
  "R0.73E 检查 complement resolvent、semigroup dichotomy 与 fixed-projection transfer": "R0.73E examines complement resolvent, semigroup dichotomy, and fixed-projection transfer",
  "staticVanishingViscosityPersistence、fixedContourResolventUniform、fixedClusterRieszProjectionNormConvergence、fixedClusterAlgebraicMultiplicityPreserved 与 fixedClusterEigenvaluesConverge 为 CLOSED。inviscidRootUnique、inviscidEigenvalueSimple、explicitContourRadius、explicitViscosityThreshold、quantitativeEigenvalueRate、globalRightHalfPlaneNoPollution、uniformComplementaryDichotomy、movingProfileUniformContour、graphDomainKatoTransport、logFastTimeTransfer、completeOSSquireA2DirectSum、nonlinearNavierStokes 与 Clay 为 OPEN；superPolynomialCompleteRowNoGo 为 CONDITIONAL。": "staticVanishingViscosityPersistence, fixedContourResolventUniform, fixedClusterRieszProjectionNormConvergence, fixedClusterAlgebraicMultiplicityPreserved, and fixedClusterEigenvaluesConverge are CLOSED. inviscidRootUnique, inviscidEigenvalueSimple, explicitContourRadius, explicitViscosityThreshold, quantitativeEigenvalueRate, globalRightHalfPlaneNoPollution, uniformComplementaryDichotomy, movingProfileUniformContour, graphDomainKatoTransport, logFastTimeTransfer, completeOSSquireA2DirectSum, nonlinearNavierStokes, and Clay are OPEN; superPolynomialCompleteRowNoGo is CONDITIONAL.",
  "01 · 四十个研究阶段": "01 · Forty research phases",
  "02 · 121 节完整索引": "02 · Complete 121-section index",
  "保留 R0.73D 历史回顾": "Retain the R0.73D historical recap",
  "不能把 121 个节点或 83 个公开版本解释成 Clay 完成比例。R0.73E 的严格增量是 fixed-half-plane operator theorem、relative dichotomy 和 logarithmic Volterra transfer，不是有限矩阵外推。": "The 121 nodes or 83 public releases cannot be interpreted as a completion percentage for Clay. The rigorous increment in R0.73E is a fixed-half-plane operator theorem, a relative dichotomy, and logarithmic Volterra transfer, not an extrapolation from finite matrices.",
  "查看 R0.73E 证明": "View the R0.73E proof",
  "查看独立解析审计": "View the independent analytic audit",
  "打开最新节点 R0.73E": "Open the latest node R0.73E",
  "回顾截止节点：R0.73E": "Recap endpoint: R0.73E",
  "回顾截止时公开笔记：181": "Public notes at the recap endpoint: 181",
  "累计回顾 · R0.61–R0.73E · 2026-08-30": "Cumulative recap · R0.61–R0.73E · 2026-08-30",
  "目标是建立统一谱隙与演化二分，把 logarithmic fast-time lower bound 升级为 fixed-window \\(e^{c|\\Lambda|}\\)。graph-domain/Kato transport 仍只是候选方法。": "The target is to establish a uniform spectral gap and evolution dichotomy and upgrade the logarithmic fast-time lower bound to fixed-window \\(e^{c|\\Lambda|}\\). Graph-domain/Kato transport remains only a candidate method.",
  "收录节点：121": "Nodes included: 121",
  "四十个阶段、121 个节点：从约化递推和环带排除到一条精确线性行的对数快时间传递。": "Forty phases and 121 nodes: from reduced recurrences and annular exclusions to logarithmic fast-time transfer on one exact linear row.",
  "选取完整 top cluster 后，Bromwich 移线给出相对 semigroup dichotomy；精确 \\(O(\\varepsilon\\theta)\\) profile drift 再通过固定生成元 Volterra 论证传递到任意固定 \\(M\\log(1/\\varepsilon)\\) 快时间。": "After selecting the complete top cluster, a Bromwich contour shift gives a relative semigroup dichotomy; the exact \\(O(\\varepsilon\\theta)\\) profile drift then transfers through a fixed-generator Volterra argument to any fixed fast-time scale \\(M\\log(1/\\varepsilon)\\).",
  "一条精确线性行的对数快时间增长已成为定理；固定窗口与非线性仍未闭合": "Logarithmic fast-time growth on one exact linear row is now a theorem; the fixed window and nonlinearity remain unclosed",
  "这页保留 R0.61 到 R0.73E 的全部 121 个节点。R0.61–R0.69W 从约化递推走到严格环带排除；R0.70A–R0.71Z 检查移动尺度、临界账本、内部 entry 与 complete-root 边界；R0.72A–R0.73B 处理 strong coupling、critical log、碰撞几何与完整线性 Fourier--Leray 行；R0.73C 认证冻结 Rayleigh 不稳定，R0.73D 闭合静态黏性谱簇持续，R0.73E 再闭合固定正半平面与对数快时间传递。一般三维 nonlinear 与 Clay 没有被外推。": "This page retains, from R0.61 through R0.73E, all 121 nodes. R0.61–R0.69W moves from reduced recurrences to rigorous annular exclusion; R0.70A–R0.71Z examines moving scales, critical ledgers, internal entry, and complete-root boundaries; R0.72A–R0.73B treats strong coupling, the critical log, collision geometry, and the complete linear Fourier--Leray row; R0.73C certifies frozen Rayleigh instability, R0.73D closes static viscous spectral-cluster persistence, and R0.73E closes the fixed positive half-plane and logarithmic fast-time transfer. No extrapolation is made to general three-dimensional nonlinearity or Clay.",
  "逐节笔记、证明、审计、证书、有限诊断、附图和历史回顾": "Section-by-section notes, proofs, audits, certificates, finite diagnostics, figures, and historical recaps",
  "compact--Fredholm 核心、高虚部 resolvent 尾部与高实部耗散估计拼接后，每个固定正半平面的谱完备性、总 Riesz 投影和 reduced resolvent 统一界闭合。": "After joining the compact--Fredholm core, the high-imaginary-part resolvent tail, and the high-real-part dissipative estimate, spectral completeness in every fixed positive half-plane, the total Riesz projection, and a uniform reduced-resolvent bound are closed.",
  "continuum theorem 来自解析证明与独立审计。Fourier cutoff 只做诊断和附图。": "The continuum theorem comes from the analytic proof and independent audit. The Fourier cutoff serves only diagnostics and figures.",
  "R0.00–R0.60 保留在上一份阶段回顾。R0.70A–R0.73E 的 83 个版本已经公开，其中 59 个满足当前完整封存合同，24 个历史版本仍欠 formal-figure 回补。公开和封存不表示 Clay 问题已经解决。": "R0.00–R0.60 remains in the preceding phase recap. The 83 releases from R0.70A–R0.73E are public; 59 satisfy the current complete-archive contract, while 24 historical releases still lack formal-figure backfill. Publication and archival do not mean that the Clay problem is solved.",
  "R0.60 之后的路线分成四十个阶段": "The route after R0.60 is divided into forty phases",
  "R0.60 之后的完整研究回顾：R0.61 到 R0.73E 共 121 个节点；最新一节闭合固定正半平面分裂与对数快时间传递。": "Complete research recap after R0.60: from R0.61 through R0.73E, 121 nodes; the latest section closes fixed-positive-half-plane splitting and logarithmic fast-time transfer.",
  "R0.61–R0.73E 的 121 节公开笔记": "R0.61–R0.73E: 121 public notes",
