  "R0.70A–R0.73E 已公开版本": "Public releases from R0.70A–R0.73E",
  "R0.73E 闭合每个固定正半平面的谱完备性、完整 top cluster 相对二分、固定生成元 Volterra 传递与任意固定次数多项式上界排除；moving-profile fixed-window、nonlinear 与 Clay 仍开放。": "R0.73E closes spectral completeness in every fixed positive half-plane, a relative dichotomy for the complete top cluster, and fixed-generator Volterra transfer, and rules out every fixed-degree polynomial upper bound required to cover this exact row; the moving-profile fixed-window problem, nonlinearity, and Clay remain open.",
