  "R0.73F 证明或否证固定小物理窗口上的 moving-profile top bundle": "R0.73F: prove or disprove the existence of a moving-profile top bundle on a fixed small physical window",
  "01 · 四十一个研究阶段": "01 · Forty-one research phases",
  "02 · 122 节完整索引": "02 · Full 122-section index",
  "保留 R0.73E 历史回顾": "Keep the historical R0.73E recap",
  "不能把 122 个节点或 84 个公开版本解释成 Clay 完成比例。R0.73F 的严格增量是 conditional one-row operator theorem，不是有限矩阵外推，也不是 all-row 或 nonlinear 结论。": "The 122 nodes or 84 public releases cannot be interpreted as a percentage of the Clay problem completed. The rigorous increment in R0.73F is a conditional one-row operator theorem, not an extrapolation from finite matrices and not an all-row or nonlinear conclusion.",
