  "回顾截止时公开笔记：182": "Public notes at the recap endpoint: 182",
  "局部瞬时共同围道、移动动力学不稳定束与每个固定观察窗口内的 \\(e^{c_D|\\Lambda|}\\) 算子范数下界闭合。有限诊断只承担复算和附图，不证明 continuum theorem。": "The local common instantaneous contour, moving dynamical unstable bundle, and operator-norm lower bound \\(e^{c_D|\\Lambda|}\\) on every fixed observation window are closed. Finite diagnostics support only recomputation and the figure; they do not prove a continuum theorem.",
  "累计回顾 · R0.61–R0.73F · 2026-08-30": "Cumulative recap · R0.61–R0.73F · 2026-08-30",
  "明确 seed size、Sobolev topology、lifespan 与 mode-convolution remainder；目标是给出闭合证明，或给出阻止闭合的否定障碍。": "Specify the seed size, Sobolev topology, lifespan, and mode-convolution remainder; the target is either a closed proof or a negative obstruction to closure.",
