  "四十一个阶段、122 个节点：从约化递推和环带排除到一条精确线性行的固定窗口指数增益。": "Forty-one phases and 122 nodes: from reduced recurrences and annular exclusion to fixed-window exponential gain on one exact linear row.",
  "一条精确线性行的固定窗口指数增益已成为定理；非线性闭合仍不存在": "Fixed-window exponential gain on one exact linear row is now a theorem; nonlinear closure still does not exist",
  "这页保留 R0.61 到 R0.73F 的全部 122 个节点。R0.61–R0.69W 从约化递推走到严格环带排除；R0.70A–R0.71Z 检查移动尺度、临界账本、内部 entry 与 complete-root 边界；R0.72A–R0.73B 处理 strong coupling、critical log、碰撞几何与完整线性 Fourier--Leray 行；R0.73C–F 依次认证冻结 Rayleigh 不稳定、静态黏性持续、固定正半平面传递和移动剖面固定窗口指数增益。完整全行、非线性与 Clay 没有被外推。": "From R0.61 through R0.73F, this page preserves all 122 nodes. R0.61–R0.69W runs from reduced recurrences to strict annular exclusion; R0.70A–R0.71Z examines moving scales, critical ledgers, internal entries, and complete-root boundaries; R0.72A–R0.73B treats strong coupling, the critical log, collision geometry, and the complete linear Fourier--Leray row; R0.73C–F successively certifies frozen Rayleigh instability, static viscous persistence, fixed-positive-half-plane transfer, and moving-profile fixed-window exponential gain. The complete all-row, nonlinear, and Clay problems are not extrapolated.",
  "R0.00–R0.60 保留在上一份阶段回顾。R0.70A–R0.73F 的 84 个版本已经公开，其中 60 个满足当前完整封存合同，24 个历史版本仍欠 formal-figure 回补。公开和封存不表示 Clay 问题已经解决。": "R0.00–R0.60 remains in the preceding phase recap. From R0.70A through R0.73F, 84 releases are public; 60 satisfy the current complete-archive contract, while 24 historical releases still lack formal-figure backfill. Publication and archival do not mean that the Clay problem is solved.",
  "R0.60 之后的路线分成四十一个阶段": "The route after R0.60 is divided into forty-one phases",
  "R0.60 之后的完整研究回顾：R0.61 到 R0.73F 共 122 个节点；最新一节闭合一条精确线性行的固定窗口指数增益。": "Complete research recap after R0.60: from R0.61 through R0.73F there are 122 nodes; the latest section closes fixed-window exponential gain on one exact linear row.",
