  "R0.73N 把 R0.73M 的变背景族结论与固定成员问题严格分开：每个固定有限 \\(\\Lambda\\) 具有正的全三维同步 \\(H^3,H^3\\) 稳定管，平面子系统具有真正的 \\(L^2\\) 初值小性；全三维 FPS \\(H^3,L^2\\) 仍为 OPEN。": "R0.73N strictly separates the varying-background-family conclusion of R0.73M from the fixed-member question: every fixed finite \\(\\Lambda\\) has a positive full-three-dimensional synchronized \\(H^3,H^3\\) stability tube, and the planar subsystem has genuine smallness in the initial \\(L^2\\) norm; full-three-dimensional FPS \\(H^3,L^2\\) remains OPEN.",
