  "已知全局无强迫背景与强迫非衰减背景已经分开": "The known global unforced background and the forced nondecaying background have been separated",
  "R0.00–R0.60 保留在上一份阶段回顾。R0.70A–R0.73O 的 93 个版本已经公开，其中 69 个满足当前完整封存合同，24 个历史版本仍欠 formal-figure 回补。公开和封存不表示 Clay 问题已经解决。": "R0.00–R0.60 is retained in the previous stage recap. R0.70A–R0.73O has 93 public versions: 69 satisfy the current complete-sealing contract, while 24 historical versions still require formal-figure backfill. Publication and sealing do not mean that the Clay problem has been solved.",
  "R0.60 之后的路线分成 50 个阶段": "The route after R0.60 is divided into 50 stages",
  "R0.60 之后的完整研究回顾：R0.61 到 R0.73O 共 131 个节点；最新一节分开先验全局轨道的条件稳定与强迫非衰减对照。": "Complete research recap after R0.60: from R0.61 through R0.73O, 131 nodes; the latest section separates conditional stability of an a priori global orbit from the forced nondecaying contrast.",
  "R0.61–R0.73O 的 131 节公开笔记": "Public research notes from R0.61–R0.73O: 131 sections",
