  "R0.00–R0.60 保留在上一份阶段回顾。R0.70A–R0.73P 的 94 个版本已经公开，其中 70 个满足当前完整封存合同，24 个历史版本仍欠 formal-figure 回补。公开和封存不表示 Clay 问题已经解决。": "R0.00–R0.60 is retained in the previous stage review. R0.70A–R0.73P has 94 public releases; 70 satisfy the current complete-archive contract, while 24 historical releases still lack formal-figure backfills. Publication and archiving do not constitute a solution to the Clay problem.",
  "R0.60 之后的路线分成 51 个阶段": "The Route after R0.60 Is Divided into 51 Stages",
  "R0.60 之后的完整研究回顾：R0.61 到 R0.73P 共 132 个节点；最新一节分开临界稳定、带限频率门槛、延迟同步与早期弱区间。": "Complete research review after R0.60: from R0.61 through R0.73P, 132 nodes; the latest section separates critical stability, the band-limited frequency threshold, delayed synchronization, and the early weak interval.",
  "R0.61–R0.73P 的 132 节公开笔记": "R0.61–R0.73P: 132 Public Notes",
