  "R0.00–R0.60 保留在上一份阶段回顾。R0.70A–R0.73Q 的 95 个版本已经公开，其中 71 个满足当前完整封存合同，24 个历史版本仍欠 formal-figure 回补。公开和封存不表示 Clay 问题已经解决。": "R0.00–R0.60 remains in the previous phase recap. Among R0.70A–R0.73Q, 95 releases have been published; 71 satisfy the current complete-seal contract, while 24 historical releases still await formal-figure backfilling. Publication and sealing do not constitute a Clay resolution.",
  "R0.60 之后的路线分成 52 个阶段": "The route after R0.60 is divided into 52 phases",
  "R0.60 之后的完整研究回顾：R0.61 到 R0.73Q 共 133 个节点；最新一节分开临界热流稳定管、严格扩域、端点阻断与 L2-only 开放边界。": "Complete research recap after R0.60: from R0.61 through R0.73Q, 133 nodes; the latest section separates the critical heat-flow stability tube, strict domain enlargement, endpoint obstruction, and the L2-only open boundary.",
