  "R0.00–R0.60 保留在上一份阶段回顾。R0.70A–R0.73R 的 96 个版本已经公开，其中 72 个满足当前完整封存合同，24 个历史版本仍欠 formal-figure 回补。公开和封存不表示 Clay 问题已经解决。": "R0.00–R0.60 remains in the preceding stage recap. R0.70A–R0.73R has 96 public versions: 72 satisfy the current full-seal contract, while 24 historical versions still await formal-figure backfill. Publication and sealing do not mean that the Clay problem has been solved.",
  "R0.60 之后的路线分成 53 个阶段": "The route after R0.60 is divided into 53 stages",
  "R0.60 之后的完整研究回顾：R0.61 到 R0.73R 共 134 个节点；最新一节分开经典热--Besov 机制、逐壳证书、相位分离与 L2-only 开放边界。": "Complete research recap after R0.60: from R0.61 through R0.73R there are 134 nodes; the latest section separates the classical heat--Besov mechanism, shellwise certificates, phase separation, and the L2-only open boundary.",
  "R0.61–R0.73R 的 134 节公开笔记": "Public notes from R0.61–R0.73R: 134 sections",
  "R0.61–R0.73R 回顾 · 2026-08-31": "R0.61–R0.73R recap · 2026-08-31",
