  "R0.70A–R0.73S 已公开版本": "Published versions R0.70A–R0.73S",
  "R0.73S 把逐壳六次矩充分上界降到完整二次自相关，并分开三条事实：基础不等式与差集 Nikolskii 分支属于经典直接推论；选定移位尾界与有限证书可精确复算；固定宽比环带上的差集因子和低摘要不可辨识性给出严格 no-go。这不包含运行时间下界、Navier--Stokes 仿真或 Clay 结论。": "R0.73S reduces a sufficient upper bound for the shellwise sixth moment to the complete quadratic autocorrelation and separates three facts: the basic inequality and the difference-set Nikolskii branch are direct classical consequences; the selected-shift tail bound and finite certificate are exactly reproducible; and the difference-set factor on a fixed-width-ratio annulus, together with low-summary non-identifiability, yields a rigorous no-go. This includes no runtime lower bound, Navier--Stokes simulation, or Clay conclusion.",
  "R0.73S 的有限公式证书和正式附图只复算自相关、矩与反例族；它们不计算热流积分，不运行 Navier--Stokes，也不建立复杂度下界。NOT CLAY。": "The finite-formula certificate and formal figure for R0.73S only recompute autocorrelations, moments, and counterexample families; they do not compute heat-flow integrals, run Navier--Stokes, or establish a complexity lower bound. NOT CLAY.",
