  "R0.00–R0.60 保留在上一份阶段回顾。R0.70A–R0.73U 的 99 个版本已经公开，其中 75 个满足当前完整封存合同，24 个历史版本仍欠 formal-figure 回补。公开和封存不表示 Clay 问题已经解决。": "R0.00–R0.60 remain in the previous phase recap. Of the 99 versions from R0.70A–R0.73U, all are public and 75 satisfy the current full sealing contract; 24 historical versions still lack formal-figure backfills. Publication and sealing do not mean that the Clay problem has been solved.",
