  "R0.60 之后的完整研究回顾：R0.61 到 R0.73U 共 137 个节点；最新一节分开 heat covariance、同尺度压力重建、临界 stress 行与二次状态非自治。": "Complete research recap after R0.60: 137 nodes from R0.61 through R0.73U; the latest section separates the heat covariance, same-scale pressure reconstruction, the critical stress row, and quadratic-state non-autonomy.",
