  "R0.60 之后的完整研究回顾：R0.61 到 R0.73V 共 138 个节点；最新一节分开有符号三阶尺度生成、完整压力账本、条件临界行与 3→4 物理时间边界。": "Complete research review after R0.60: 138 nodes from R0.61 through R0.73V; the latest section separates signed third-order scale generation, the complete pressure ledger, conditional critical rows, and the 3→4 physical-time boundary.",
