  "有限证书是光滑三角多项式上的精确 Fourier 代数，不是 DNS、Navier--Stokes 时间仿真、generic turbulence、奇性或 blow-up 候选；它排除指定的普适单边符号律和同时刻振幅无关二次吸收，不排除非线性、时间积分或局部化估计。 NOT CLAY。": "The finite certificate is exact Fourier algebra on smooth trigonometric polynomials, not DNS, Navier--Stokes time simulation, generic turbulence, or a singularity or blow-up candidate; it rules out the specified universal one-sided sign law and same-time amplitude-independent quadratic absorption, but does not rule out nonlinear, time-integrated, or localized estimates. NOT CLAY.",
  "CLASSICAL：gaussianStressDuhamel=VERIFIED_CLASSICAL_REDERIVED；deviatoricProductionIdentity=VERIFIED_CLASSICAL_REDERIVED。INTERNAL：heatPlaneCharacteristicIdentity=INTERNAL_EXACT_AUDITED；energyClassFixedScaleEstimate=INTERNAL_UNCONDITIONAL_AUDITED；centeredIncrementSplit=INTERNAL_EXACT_AUDITED；criticalHalfScaleAverage=INTERNAL_CRITICAL_AUDITED。FINITE：formalFiniteCertificate=SEALED_COMMIT_BOUND；formalFiniteCertificateChecks=56+56；primaryWitnessFrequencyRank=3；formalFigurePackage=SEALED_COMMIT_BOUND；navierStokesSimulation=NOT_RUN；directNumericalSimulation=NOT_RUN；ordinaryTranslationPath=LOCAL_DIRECT_NO_DGX；dgxUsed=false。OPEN：fixedScaleUniformEnergyClassControl=OPEN；localizedScaleCriticalControl=OPEN；arbitraryThreeDimensionalGlobalRegularity=OPEN；clayConclusion=OPEN。有限证书是光滑三角多项式上的精确 Fourier 代数，不是 DNS、Navier--Stokes 时间仿真、generic turbulence、奇性或 blow-up 候选；它排除指定的普适单边符号律和同时刻振幅无关二次吸收，不排除非线性、时间积分或局部化估计。 NOT CLAY。": "CLASSICAL: gaussianStressDuhamel=VERIFIED_CLASSICAL_REDERIVED; deviatoricProductionIdentity=VERIFIED_CLASSICAL_REDERIVED. INTERNAL: heatPlaneCharacteristicIdentity=INTERNAL_EXACT_AUDITED; energyClassFixedScaleEstimate=INTERNAL_UNCONDITIONAL_AUDITED; centeredIncrementSplit=INTERNAL_EXACT_AUDITED; criticalHalfScaleAverage=INTERNAL_CRITICAL_AUDITED. FINITE: formalFiniteCertificate=SEALED_COMMIT_BOUND; formalFiniteCertificateChecks=56+56; primaryWitnessFrequencyRank=3; formalFigurePackage=SEALED_COMMIT_BOUND; navierStokesSimulation=NOT_RUN; directNumericalSimulation=NOT_RUN; ordinaryTranslationPath=LOCAL_DIRECT_NO_DGX; dgxUsed=false. OPEN: fixedScaleUniformEnergyClassControl=OPEN; localizedScaleCriticalControl=OPEN; arbitraryThreeDimensionalGlobalRegularity=OPEN; clayConclusion=OPEN. The finite certificate is exact Fourier algebra on smooth trigonometric polynomials, not DNS, Navier--Stokes time simulation, generic turbulence, or a singularity or blow-up candidate; it rules out the specified universal one-sided sign law and same-time amplitude-independent quadratic absorption, but does not rule out nonlinear, time-integrated, or localized estimates. NOT CLAY.",
  "R0.00–R0.60 保留在上一份阶段回顾。R0.70A–R0.73W 的 101 个版本已经公开，其中 77 个满足当前完整封存合同，24 个历史版本仍欠 formal-figure 回补。公开和封存不表示 Clay 问题已经解决。": "R0.00–R0.60 remains in the preceding phase recap. Of the 101 releases from R0.70A through R0.73W, all have been published; 77 satisfy the current complete-seal contract, while 24 historical releases still await formal-figure backfilling. Publication and sealing do not mean that the Clay problem has been solved.",
