  "这是 R0.60 之后的累计里程碑回顾。收录节点：190；回顾截止时公开笔记：250。它保留截至 R0.75A 的既有 recap 字节不变，并把 B–V 二十一节点压缩为一条可审计路线，尤其严格区分 T、U、V 三个连续结论。": "This cumulative milestone recap after R0.60 contains 190 nodes and covers 250 public notes. It preserves the recap through R0.75A byte-for-byte and compresses the twenty-one B–V nodes into an auditable route, with a strict distinction among T, U, and V.",
  "这些步骤整理必要账本，不是任意场 E.24。": "These steps organize necessary ledgers; they do not prove arbitrary-field E.24.",
  "证明 sharp spatial collar coercivity，以 H^2=(A-C)^2+AC min(1,(d aR)^2+delta_pi^2) 记录两波抵消。": "Prove sharp spatial collar coercivity, recording two-wave cancellation with the stated beat defect.",
  "支付 difference-frequency row。": "Pay the difference-frequency row.",
  "只对 exact diffusive high-carrier dyadic two-harmonic pair；Version-M V.43 仍条件化。": "Only the exact diffusive high-carrier dyadic two-harmonic pair; Version-M V.43 remains conditional.",
  "只覆盖单谐波或诊断性 family。": "Covers only one harmonic or a diagnostic family.",
