  "逐 packet cardinality loss；只用 plateau mass 支付任意 multimode flux。": "A packetwise cardinality loss; paying arbitrary multimode flux from plateau mass alone.",
  "B 支付 safe subclock；C--F 排除 packing、positivity 与 naive modal routes；G 固定 exact gain threshold。": "B pays the safe subclock; C--F rule out packing, positivity, and naive modal routes; G fixes the exact gain threshold.",
  "exact high-carrier dyadic pair 的四频 signed flux 已完整付款": "The four-frequency signed flux of the exact high-carrier dyadic pair is fully paid",
