  "V 保留 quadratic cancellation 联合支付剩余 block；与 U 合并后才得到 high-carrier exact-pair theorem。": "V retains quadratic cancellation and jointly pays the remaining block; only after combining with U does this yield the high-carrier exact-pair theorem.",
  "W 不延伸 T defect，而以 confluent observation、Turan–Nazarov trace 与 local-energy identity 支付 maR<C_0；与 V 构成 exhaustive high/low union。": "W does not extend T's defect: confluent observation, a Turan–Nazarov trace, and the local-energy identity pay maR<C_0 and form an exhaustive high/low union with V.",
