  "下一发布门 R0.73S 将优先检查：能否用部分自相关、低阶加法能量或 可分块相位图，构造复杂度明显低于精确三重卷积、同时严格支配 \\(\\Theta_j\\) 的确定性代理量。若做不到，结果应以 no-go 或复杂度 下界形式发布。": "The next release gate, R0.73S, will first test whether partial autocorrelations, low-order additive energy, or a block-separable phase graph can yield a deterministic proxy whose complexity is substantially lower than exact triple convolution while still strictly controlling \\(\\Theta_j\\). If not, the result should be published as a no-go theorem or a complexity lower bound.",
