  "R0.58 已完成：": "R0.58 completed:",
  "R0.59 的周期热–Carleson 估计与 R0.66 的主根区间给出 \\[ \\|U_r(0)\\|_{BMO^{-1}_{\\rm per}} \\le (6+4\\sqrt{2})\\rho^r, \\qquad \\rho<0.797586. \\] 虽然每个物理 Fourier 振幅随 \\(r\\) 指数增长，这个缩放临界 上界却几何衰减。13 项源锁定检查全部通过。": "The periodic heat–Carleson estimate from R0.59 and the dominant-root interval from R0.66 give \\[ \\|U_r(0)\\|_{BMO^{-1}_{\\rm per}} \\le (6+4\\sqrt{2})\\rho^r, \\qquad \\rho<0.797586. \\] Although each physical Fourier amplitude grows exponentially with \\(r\\), this scale-critical upper bound decays geometrically. All 13 source-locked checks pass.",
  "R0.59 高频包严格保持 \\[ u=(0,F(x_1,t),G(x_1,x_2,t)) \\] 的平行剪切结构。完整 Navier--Stokes 方程因此约化为 \\[ \\partial_tF-\\partial_1^2F=0,\\qquad \\partial_tG-\\Delta_{12}G+F\\partial_2G=0. \\] 对每个固定光滑频率包，后一个方程是已知光滑剪切速度下的线性 抛物方程，所以该构造在这个对称类内全局光滑。": "The R0.59 packet exactly preserves the plane-parallel shear form \\[ u=(0,F(x_1,t),G(x_1,x_2,t)) \\]. The full Navier--Stokes system therefore reduces to \\[ \\partial_tF-\\partial_1^2F=0,\\qquad \\partial_tG-\\Delta_{12}G+F\\partial_2G=0. \\] For each fixed smooth packet, the second equation is a linear parabolic equation with a known smooth shear velocity, so the construction is globally smooth inside this symmetry class.",
  "R0.59 已完成：": "R0.59 completed:",
  "R0.6 解析候选的约束 Hessian 在去掉两个平移方向后数值正定。 但完整中心空间都属于 \\(k_3=0\\) 的 2D3C 类，因而分裂成二维 Navier–Stokes 与被动标量，中心模型本身全局正则。": "R0.6 The candidate constraint Hessian, after removing two translation directions, is numerically positive definite. However, the entire central space belongs to the 2D3C class of \\(k_3=0\\), thus splitting into two-dimensional Navier–Stokes and a passive scalar; the central model itself is globally regular.",
  "R0.6 已完成：": "R0.6 has been completed:",
